aymentProcessRequestStatusHierarchy.paymentProcessRequestStatusCode\",        \"paymentRunInstallmentStatusHierarchy.documentStatusCode\",        \"supplierHierarchy.supplierId\",        \"supplierHierarchy.supplierName\",        \"supplierHierarchy.supplierNumber\",        \"supplierHierarchy.supplierSiteId\",        \"supplierHierarchy.supplierSiteName\",        \"supplierHierarchy.supplierType\",        \"supplierHierarchy.supplierTypeMeaning\",        \"transactionTypeHierarchy.transactionType\"      ],      \"filterConditions\": [        {          \"name\": \"paymentProcessRequestHierarchy.name\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentProcessRequestHierarchy.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user names a PPR or payment run.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentProcessRequestHierarchy.paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentProcessRequestHierarchy.paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user provides the Oracle Payments payment process request id.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"exceptionReasonHierarchy.errorCode\",          \"attribute\": \"exceptionReasonHierarchy.errorCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for a specific exception code or error family.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"exceptionStatusHierarchy.errorStatusCode\",          \"attribute\": \"exceptionStatusHierarchy.errorStatusCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes exceptions by unresolved, resolved, or other exception status code.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"transactionTypeHierarchy.transactionType\",          \"attribute\": \"transactionTypeHierarchy.transactionType\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use to group or filter installment-level, payment-level, and payment-instruction-level exception scopes.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusHierarchy.paymentProcessRequestStatusCode\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusHierarchy.paymentProcessRequestStatusCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes exceptions by PPR lifecycle status.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentRunInstallmentStatusHierarchy.documentStatusCode\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentRunInstallmentStatusHierarchy.documentStatusCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for installment or document status in exception summaries.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"disbursementPaymentStatusHierarchy.paymentStatusCode\",          \"attribute\": \"disbursementPaymentStatusHierarchy.paymentStatusCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for payment-level exception status.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentInstructionStatusHierarchy.paymentInstructionStatusCode\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentInstructionStatusHierarchy.paymentInstructionStatusCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for payment-file or payment-instruction exception status.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"supplierHierarchy.supplierName\",          \"attribute\": \"supplierHierarchy.supplierName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks whether exceptions are concentrated with a supplier.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"businessUnitHierarchy.businessUnitName\",          \"attribute\": \"businessUnitHierarchy.businessUnitName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes or groups exception value by business unit.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentCurrencyHierarchy.currencyCode\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentCurrencyHierarchy.currencyCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when payment amount is returned or the user asks for exception value by currency.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentMethodHierarchy.paymentMethodCode\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentMethodHierarchy.paymentMethodCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for exception concentration by payment method.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentFormatHierarchy.paymentFormatCode\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentFormatHierarchy.paymentFormatCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for payment-file formatting exception concentration.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"errorDateToYearHierarchy.calendarDate\",          \"attribute\": \"errorDateToYearHierarchy.calendarDate\",          \"type\": \"date\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for exceptions raised on a date or date range.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentDateToYearHierarchy.calendarDate\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentDateToYearHierarchy.calendarDate\",          \"type\": \"date\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for blocked payment value by payment date.\"        }      ],      \"dateFilterGuidance\": {        \"description\": \"Use `errorDateToYearHierarchy.calendarDate` for when the exception was raised. Use `paymentDateToYearHierarchy.calendarDate` when the user asks about the payment date or value scheduled for a specific payment window.\",        \"patterns\": [          {            \"userRequest\": \"exceptions today, yesterday, this week, last 7 days, or raised during a date range\",            \"clause\": \"apply the date window to errorDateToYearHierarchy.calendarDate\"          },          {            \"userRequest\": \"blocked payments due to be paid today, this week, or in a payment-date range\",            \"clause\": \"apply the date window to paymentDateToYearHierarchy.calendarDate\"          }        ]      },      \"businessDrivers\": [        {          \"name\": \"consolidatedExceptionTriage\",          \"description\": \"Summarize all exception types and value at risk for one PPR or a set of payment runs.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for all exceptions, what is blocking a PPR, or what to fix first.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentAmount\",            \"paymentRuns\",            \"payments\",            \"installmentPayments\",            \"paymentInstructions\",            \"paymentProcessRequestHierarchy\",            \"exceptionReasonHierarchy\",            \"transactionTypeHierarchy\",            \"paymentCurrencyHierarchy\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestHierarchy.name='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>' or paymentProcessRequestHierarchy.paymentProcessRequestId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER>\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Return a grouped AV result and rank outside the AV by blocked payment amount or affected count. Use paymentCurrencyHierarchy.currencyCode whenever paymentAmount is returned.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"exceptionScopeBreakdown\",          \"description\": \"Distinguish installment-level, payment-level, and payment-instruction-level exceptions.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which failures affect files, payments, or installment/document rows.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"transactionTypeHierarchy\",            \"exceptionReasonHierarchy\",            \"paymentAmount\",            \"payments\",            \"installmentPayments\",            \"paymentInstructions\",            \"paymentCurrencyHierarchy\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [],          \"notes\": \"Use transaction type as the scope indicator, then drill into the matching exception extraction shape for row-level explanation.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccountInstallmentExceptionSummary\",          \"description\": \"Summarize installment-level exceptions where the error message indicates a bank-account setup or assignment problem.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which installments were excluded or rejected from today's run because of bank account errors.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"exceptionReasonHierarchy\",            \"transactionTypeHierarchy\",            \"paymentRunInstallmentStatusHierarchy\",            \"paymentProcessRequestHierarchy\",            \"paymentAmount\",            \"installmentPayments\",            \"paymentCurrencyHierarchy\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"exceptionReasonHierarchy.errorMessage contains 'bank account' or the equivalent case-insensitive bank-account wording\",            \"transactionTypeHierarchy.transactionType corresponds to installment or document-payable exceptions when exposed\",            \"errorDateToYearHierarchy.calendarDate=<TODAY> when the user says today's run\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Group first by exceptionReasonHierarchy.errorMessage and return installmentPayments plus paymentAmount by currency. Drill into paymentRunInstallmentExceptionsExtraction or paymentRunInstallmentsExtraction only when invoice, supplier, due-date, or installment rows are requested.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"supplierAndBusinessUnitConcentration\",          \"description\": \"Find suppliers or business units with concentrated exception count or blocked payment value.\",          \"when\": \"User asks whether exceptions are systemic, concentrated, or recurring for a supplier or business unit.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"supplierHierarchy\",            \"businessUnitHierarchy\",            \"exceptionReasonHierarchy\",            \"paymentAmount\",            \"paymentCurrencyHierarchy\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [],          \"notes\": \"Use this to identify likely systemic setup patterns; use row-level exception detail only after the concentrated group is known.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"exceptionTimingAndAging\",          \"description\": \"Summarize exception aging or trend by error date.\",          \"when\": \"User asks when exceptions were raised, how old they are, or whether failures are recent.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorDateToYearHierarchy\",            \"errorDateDaysAgoSevenDayBucketHierarchy\",            \"exceptionReasonHierarchy\",            \"paymentAmount\",            \"paymentCurrencyHierarchy\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [],          \"notes\": \"Use error-date dimensions for exception aging. Use payment-date dimensions only when the user asks about scheduled payment value.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"validationErrorsBlockingPriorityPayments\",          \"description\": \"Show validation-error reasons that are blocking high-priority  payments, with blocked amount and affected payment/installment counts. Sort by paymentAmount desc\",          \"when\": \"User asks to show validation errors blocking high-priority payments, overdue payments, high-priority installments, or overdue installments and wants a grouped blocked-value or affected-count summary.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"exceptionReasonHierarchy.errorMessage\",            \"transactionTypeHierarchy.transactionType\",            \"paymentAmount\",            \"payments\",            \"installmentPayments\",            \"paymentCurrencyHierarchy.currencyCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"$filterfact =paymentProcessRequestStatusHierarchy[paymentProcessRequestStatusCode IN ('PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS')] AND transactionTypeHierarchy[transactionType='PAYMENT']\",            \"filter =paymentProcessRequestStatusHierarchy.$levelName='PAYMENTPROCESSREQUESTSTATUS' AND exceptionReasonHierarchy.$levelName='EXCEPTIONREASON' AND transactionTypeHierarchy.$levelName='TRANSACTIONTYPE' AND paymentCurrencyHierarchy.$levelName='CURRENCYCODE'\",            \"sortBy =paymentAmount:desc\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Always generate paymentRunExceptionsSummaries AV for this pattern. Do not return unsupported. High-priority is handled as triage ranking; use paymentAmount desc because no separate priority field is exposed in this AV.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"allPprExceptionSummary\",          \"description\": \"Summarize exceptions across all payment process requests, grouped by PPR, exception reason, status, and currency.\",          \"when\": \"User asks to show exceptions for all PPRs, review exception activity across payment runs, or summarize exception messages without restricting to a single named batch.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestHierarchy.name\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusHierarchy.paymentProcessRequestStatus\",            \"exceptionReasonHierarchy.errorMessage\",            \"payments\",            \"paymentAmount\",            \"paymentCurrencyHierarchy.currencyCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"filterfact: null\",            \"filter: paymentProcessRequestHierarchy.$levelName='PAYMENTPROCESSREQUEST' AND paymentProcessRequestStatusHierarchy.$levelName='PAYMENTPROCESSREQUESTSTATUS' AND exceptionReasonHierarchy.$levelName='EXCEPTIONREASON' AND paymentCurrencyHierarchy.$levelName='CURRENCYCODE'\",            \"sortBy = paymentAmount:desc\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Do not add a PPR-specific filterfact when the user asks for all PPRs. Always sort on paymentAmount.  Never omit paymentCurrencyHierarchy.$levelName='CURRENCYCODE' whenever paymentCurrencyHierarchy.currencyCode is included in fieldsToReturn or otherwise referenced. Every field used in either fieldsToReturn or filterfact must be included in fieldsToReturn.No need to apply filter paymentProcessRequestStatusCode!='COMPLETED'\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentConfirmationFailureSummary\",          \"description\": \"Summarize payment-instruction exceptions for a named payment request whose payment confirmation failed.\",          \"when\": \"User asks why payment confirmation for a PPR failed.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"exceptionReasonHierarchy.errorMessage\",            \"transactionTypeHierarchy.transactionType\",            \"paymentAmount\",            \"payments\",            \"installmentPayments\",            \"paymentCurrencyHierarchy.currencyCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"$filterfact=paymentProcessRequestHierarchy[name='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER_WITH_LEADING_PPR_PREFIX_REMOVED>'] AND transactionTypeHierarchy[transactionType='PAYMENT_INSTRUCTION']\",            \"filter=paymentProcessRequestHierarchy.$levelName='PAYMENTPROCESSREQUEST' AND exceptionReasonHierarchy.$levelName='EXCEPTIONREASON' AND transactionTypeHierarchy.$levelName='TRANSACTIONTYPE' AND paymentCurrencyHierarchy.$levelName='CURRENCYCODE'\",            \"sortBy=transactionTypeHierarchy.transactionType:asc\",            \"limit=20\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Pair this AV summary with disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptionsExtraction for payment confirmation failure questions.\"        }      ],      \"additionalInstructions\": [        \"Use this AV for grouped exception summaries across payment-run installment, payment, and payment-instruction exception sources. Do not use it for row-level error messages when the user asks for specific invoices, payments, payment files, or setup context.\",        \"Use hierarchy names and hierarchy attributes exactly as declared in `fields.dimensions`, such as `paymentProcessRequestHierarchy.name`, `exceptionReasonHierarchy.errorCode`, and `transactionTypeHierarchy.transactionType`.\",        \"When a named PPR is provided, filter with `paymentProcessRequestHierarchy.name` or `paymentProcessRequestHierarchy.paymentProcessRequestId` and keep the payment process request hierarchy at `PAYMENTPROCESSREQUEST` level.\",        \"Payment amount is a sum measure. Always include `paymentCurrencyHierarchy.currencyCode` when returning `paymentAmount` so values are not mixed across currencies.\",        \"Use `paymentRunInstallmentExceptionsExtraction`, `disbursementPaymentExceptionsExtraction`, or `disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptionsExtraction` for detail rows after this AV identifies the exception reason, scope, or concentration.\",        \"For bank-account error exclusion questions, filter exceptionReasonHierarchy.errorMessage for bank-account wording and group by exception message before drilling into installment-level exception rows.\",        \"Use `transactionTypeHierarchy.transactionType` as the first-stage scope signal for installment-level, payment-level, and payment-instruction-level exception summaries.\",        \"Do not use this AV for 'What are the PPRs stuck because of document validation failure' or close variants asking which PPRs/runs are stuck because of document validation. Use paymentRunInstallmentExceptions BV with payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode = 'PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS' for those detail-list requests.\",        \"For high-priority payment validation-error triage, use paymentRunExceptionsSummaries AV with PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS/PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS and transactionType PAYMENT; sort paymentAmount desc.\",        \"The exact question 'Show me validation errors that are blocking high-priority payments' is supported by paymentRunExceptionsSummaries AV. Use the locked filterfact, filter, sort paymentAmount:desc, and limit 20; do not return unsupported.\"      ],      \"fieldSelectionRuleUsage\": {        \"match\": \"Choose the closest questionExamples entry for the user request.\",        \"fields\": \"Use the matching fields value exactly and preserve order.\",        \"paraphrases\": \"Use the same fields for paraphrased or equivalent requests.\",        \"addFieldsOnlyWhen\": \"The user explicitly asks for more displayed columns, or the field is required for filter, sort, group, key, or deeplink handling.\"      },      \"fieldSelectionRules\": [        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"Show me exceptions for all PPRs\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"AV\",          \"fields\": \"paymentProcessRequestHierarchy.name,paymentProcessRequestStatusHierarchy.paymentProcessRequestStatus,exceptionReasonHierarchy.errorMessage,payments,paymentAmount,paymentCurrencyHierarchy.currencyCode\",          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true        },        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"Show me validation errors that are blocking high-priority or overdue payments\",            \"Show me validation errors that are blocking high-priority payments\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"AV\",          \"fields\": \"exceptionReasonHierarchy.errorMessage,transactionTypeHierarchy.transactionType,paymentAmount,payments,installmentPayments,paymentCurrencyHierarchy.currencyCode\",          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true,          \"shape\": \"paymentRunExceptionsSummaries\",          \"filterfact\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusHierarchy[paymentProcessRequestStatusCode IN ('PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS')] AND transactionTypeHierarchy[transactionType='PAYMENT']\",          \"filter\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusHierarchy.$levelName='PAYMENTPROCESSREQUESTSTATUS' AND exceptionReasonHierarchy.$levelName='EXCEPTIONREASON' AND transactionTypeHierarchy.$levelName='TRANSACTIONTYPE' AND paymentCurrencyHierarchy.$levelName='CURRENCYCODE'\",          \"sortBy\": \"paymentAmount:desc\",          \"limit\": 20,          \"notes\": \"Exact supported pattern for high-priority payment validation-error triage. Do not return unsupported. High-priority does not require a separate priority field in this AV; rank by paymentAmount desc.\"        },        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"Why did payment confirmation for PPR <PPR_NAME> fail?\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"AV\",          \"shape\": \"paymentRunExceptionsSummaries\",          \"fields\": \"exceptionReasonHierarchy.errorMessage,transactionTypeHierarchy.transactionType,paymentAmount,payments,installmentPayments,paymentCurrencyHierarchy.currencyCode\",          \"filterfact\": \"paymentProcessRequestHierarchy[name='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER_WITH_LEADING_PPR_PREFIX_REMOVED>'] AND transactionTypeHierarchy[transactionType='PAYMENT_INSTRUCTION']\",          \"filter\": \"paymentProcessRequestHierarchy.$levelName='PAYMENTPROCESSREQUEST' AND exceptionReasonHierarchy.$levelName='EXCEPTIONREASON' AND transactionTypeHierarchy.$levelName='TRANSACTIONTYPE' AND paymentCurrencyHierarchy.$levelName='CURRENCYCODE'\",          \"sortBy\": \"transactionTypeHierarchy.transactionType:asc\",          \"limit\": 20,          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true,          \"notes\": \"Use this AV summary as the first query context for payment-confirmation failures, paired with disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptionsExtraction detail. Strip a leading 'PPR ' from the user value.\"        }      ]    },    \"paymentRunInstallments\": {      \"key\": \"paymentRunInstallments\",      \"name\": \"paymentRunInstallments\",      \"type\": \"BV\",      \"shapeRole\": \"detail\",      \"module\": \"oraErpCorePaymentsFundsDisbursement\",      \"businessObject\": \"PayablesDocumentPayable\",      \"api\": \"objects/ora/erpCore/paymentsFundsDisbursement/v1/paymentRunInstallments\",      \"description\": \"Business view for payment-run installments in Funds Disbursement. Use this IBY-source shape when the PPR status is resolved to an Oracle Payments stage, when the user asks for the row list of installments stuck because of failure, or when the user needs disbursement bank-account context, missing-attribute drill-down, supplier type and destination-country slicing, or resulting payment and payment-file details. Do not use it as the primary shape for generic PPR installment review; use the deduplicated PPR installment extraction shapes first.\",      \"exampleQuestions\": [        \"What are all the installments that are stuck because of failure?\",        \"Show IBY payment-run installments for a PPR in a validation-error status.\",        \"Which documents are missing disbursement bank account?\",        \"Which documents are missing attributes in this payment run?\",        \"Show IBY payment-run installments for payment process request PPR_123 in PENDING_REVIEW status\",        \"Show me installments where the payment currency is different from the invoice currency, group by destination country, and highlight any with missing conversion rates\",        \"Display payments grouped by bank account so I can verify we have sufficient funds in each\",        \"Which suppliers represent 80% of the total payment value in this PPR after it entered Oracle Payments?\",        \"Show me all IBY payment-run installments over 100000 with supplier details and invoice references in this payment run\",        \"Which installment in PPR PPR_123 is being paid from which disbursement bank account and to which external bank account?\",        \"Which internal bank account is funding the 50000 installment for Supplier ABC?\",        \"Show the payment method, payment mode, and payment profile for installment 3 on invoice INV-1001\",        \"List installments in this payment run with resulting payment id, payment reference number, and payment file id\",        \"What bank account is being used to pay for Installment 1 for invoice <INVOICE_NUMBER>\",        \"Which documents are missing disbursement bank account for PPR <PPR_NAME>\",        \"Show me what attributes are missing for processing PPR <PPR_NAME>\"      ],      \"fields\": {        \"fields\": [          \"documentPayableId\",          \"paymentDate\",          \"documentDate\",          \"documentCurrencyCode\",          \"documentAmount\",          \"interestRate\",          \"discount\",          \"invoiceTypeCode\",          \"documentCurrencyPaymentAmount\",          \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"amountToBePaid\",          \"paymentDueDate\",          \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"sourceProductFirstUniqueIdentifier\",          \"sourceProductThirdUniqueIdentifier\",          \"withheldAmount\",          \"supplierPayGroup\",          \"paymentFunctionLookupCode\",          \"bankAccount.id\",          \"externalBankAccount.id\",          \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\",          \"paymentFunction.lookupCode\",          \"paymentFunction.meaning\",          \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.timeCreated\",          \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",          \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceToPaymentConversionRate\"        ],        \"accessors\": {          \"paymentMethod\": {            \"fields\": [              \"code\",              \"paymentMethodName\"            ]          },          \"paymentFunction\": {            \"fields\": [              \"lookupType\",              \"meaning\",              \"lookupCode\"            ]          },          \"type\": {            \"fields\": [              \"lookupType\",              \"meaning\",              \"lookupCode\"            ]          },          \"documentPayableStatus\": {            \"fields\": [              \"lookupType\",              \"meaning\",              \"lookupCode\"            ]          },          \"paymentMode\": {            \"fields\": [              \"lookupType\",              \"meaning\",              \"lookupCode\"            ]          },          \"businessUnit\": {            \"fields\": [              \"id\",              \"name\",              \"effectiveStartDate\",              \"effectiveEndDate\"            ]          },          \"legalEntity\": {            \"fields\": [              \"legalEntityId\",              \"name\"            ]          },          \"supplierSite\": {            \"fields\": [              \"id\",              \"name\"            ],            \"accessors\": {              \"supplier\": {                \"fields\": [                  \"supplierId\",                  \"name\"                ],                \"accessors\": {                  \"supplierType\": {                    \"fields\": [                      \"lookupType\",                      \"meaning\",                      \"lookupCode\"                    ]                  }                }              }            }          },          \"payeeParty\": {            \"fields\": [              \"id\",              \"name\"            ]          },          \"bankAccount\": {            \"fields\": [              \"id\",              \"name\"            ]          },          \"externalBankAccount\": {            \"fields\": [              \"id\",              \"bankAccountName\",              \"countryCode\"            ]          },          \"accountPaymentProfile\": {            \"fields\": [              \"paymentProfileId\",              \"paymentProfileName\"            ],            \"accessors\": {              \"systemPaymentProfile\": {                \"fields\": [                  \"systemProfileCode\"                ],                \"accessors\": {                  \"processingType\": {                    \"fields\": [                      \"lookupType\",                      \"meaning\",                      \"lookupCode\"                    ]                  },                  \"paymentFormat\": {                    \"fields\": [                      \"paymentFormatCode\",                      \"formatName\"                    ]                  },                  \"paymentRemitAdviceSetup\": {                    \"fields\": [                      \"systemProfileCode\",                      \"documentCountLimit\",                      \"allowMultipleCopyFlag\",                      \"sraOverridePayeeFlag\",                      \"automaticSraSubmitFlag\"                    ]                  },                  \"paymentLogicalGroupingRule\": {                    \"fields\": [                      \"systemProfileCode\",                      \"groupByPaymentDateFlag\",                      \"groupByInternalBankAccountFlag\",                      \"groupBySettlemntPriorityFlag\",                      \"groupByServiceLevelFlag\",                      \"groupByBankChargeBearerFlag\",                      \"groupByUltimateDebtorFlag\",                      \"groupByCategoryPurposeFlag\"                    ]                  }                }              }            }          },          \"payablesInvoiceInstallment\": {            \"fields\": [              \"invoiceId\",              \"installmentNumber\",              \"invoiceToPaymentConversionRate\",              \"unpaidAmount\",              \"dueDate\",              \"installmentAmount\",              \"remitToSupplierName\"            ],            \"accessors\": {              \"invoiceTransaction\": {                \"fields\": [                  \"invoiceId\",                  \"invoiceNumber\",                  \"invoiceTypeDiscriminator\",                  \"invoiceType\",                  \"invoiceDate\",                  \"invoiceAmount\"                ],                \"accessors\": {                  \"invoiceTypeCode\": {                    \"fields\": [                      \"lookupCode\",                      \"lookupType\",                      \"meaning\"                    ]                  }                }              }            }          },          \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest\": {            \"fields\": [              \"paymentProcessRequestId\",              \"paymentProcessRequestName\",              \"timeCreated\",              \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\"            ],            \"accessors\": {              \"paymentProcessRequestStatus\": {                \"fields\": [                  \"lookupType\",                  \"meaning\",                  \"lookupCode\"                ]              },              \"paymentInitiation\": {                \"fields\": [                  \"lookupType\",                  \"meaning\",                  \"lookupCode\"                ]              },              \"bankAccount\": {                \"fields\": [                  \"id\"                ]              }            }          },          \"payablesDisbursementPayment\": {            \"fields\": [              \"paymentId\",              \"paymentProfileAccountName\",              \"paymentProfileSystemName\",              \"paymentReferenceNumber\",              \"paperDocumentNumber\",              \"paymentAmount\",              \"paymentDate\",              \"paymentCompleteFlag\",              \"bepErrorCode\",              \"bepErrorMessageText\",              \"maturityDate\",              \"paymentReasonComments\",              \"bankStatusCode\",              \"paymentSystemResponseIdentifier\",              \"issuerAuthorizationReference\",              \"acquirerTransactionReference\",              \"issuerProcessingTimestamp\",              \"voidDate\",              \"voidReason\",              \"invoiceDueDate\",              \"stopRequestPlacedBy\",              \"paymentStatusLookupCode\",              \"paymentFunctionLookupCode\"            ],            \"accessors\": {              \"paymentStatus\": {                \"fields\": [                  \"lookupType\",                  \"meaning\",                  \"lookupCode\"                ]              },              \"fundsStatus\": {                \"fields\": [                  \"lookupType\",                  \"meaning\",                  \"lookupCode\"                ]              },              \"paymentFunction\": {                \"fields\": [                  \"lookupType\",                  \"meaning\",                  \"lookupCode\"                ]              },              \"payablesPayment\": {                \"fields\": [                  \"paymentId\",                  \"paymentDate\",                  \"paymentCurrencyCode\",                  \"supplierName\",                  \"paymentAmount\",                  \"remitToSupplierName\",                  \"remitToAddressName\",                  \"futurePayDueDate\",                  \"conversionRate\",                  \"conversionDate\",                  \"paymentBaseAmount\",                  \"positivePayStatusCode\",                  \"paymentNumber\",                  \"clearingAmount\",                  \"clearingDate\",                  \"clearingBaseAmount\",                  \"clearingConversionRate\",                  \"clearingConversionDate\",                  \"clearingConversionRateType\",                  \"reconciledFlag\",                  \"maturityConversionRate\",                  \"maturityConversionDate\",                  \"maturityConversionRateType\",                  \"releasedDate\",                  \"stopDate\"                ],                \"accessors\": {                  \"paymentType\": {                    \"fields\": [                      \"lookupType\",                      \"meaning\",                      \"lookupCode\"                    ]                  },                  \"paymentStatus\": {                    \"fields\": [                      \"lookupType\",                      \"meaning\",                      \"lookupCode\"                    ]                  },                  \"paymentCurrency\": {                    \"fields\": [                      \"currencyCode\",                      \"issuingTerritoryCode\"                    ]                  },                  \"paymentSettlementPriority\": {                    \"fields\": [                      \"lookupType\",                      \"meaning\",                      \"lookupCode\"                    ]                  }                }              },              \"payablesPaymentFile\": {                \"fields\": [                  \"paymentInstructionId\",                  \"paymentCount\",                  \"transmissionDate\",                  \"processingDate\",                  \"bankStatusCode\",                  \"paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode\"                ],                \"accessors\": {                  \"paymentFileProcessingStatus\": {                    \"fields\": [                      \"lookupType\",                      \"meaning\",                      \"lookupCode\"                    ]                  },                  \"disbursementInboundFile\": {                    \"fields\": [                      \"id\",                      \"fileName\",                      \"timeCreated\",                      \"errorMessage\"                    ],                    \"accessors\": {                      \"paymentSystem\": {                        \"fields\": [                          \"id\",                          \"paymentSystemName\"                        ]                      },                      \"inboundFileProcessingStatus\": {                        \"fields\": [                          \"lookupType\",                          \"meaning\",                          \"lookupCode\"                        ]                      }                    }                  },                  \"paymentFileConfirmationStatus\": {                    \"fields\": [                      \"lookupType\",                      \"meaning\",                      \"lookupCode\"                    ]                  },                  \"paymentDocument\": {                    \"fields\": [                      \"id\",                      \"paymentDocument\",                      \"firstAvailableDocumentNumber\",                      \"lastAvailableDocumentNumber\",                      \"lastIssuedDocumentNumber\"                    ],                    \"accessors\": {                      \"paymentDocumentCategory\": {                        \"fields\": [                          \"code\",                          \"applicationId\",                          \"name\"                        ]                      }                    }                  }                }              }            }          }        },        \"fieldAlias\": {          \"Document Payable ID\": \"documentPayableId\",          \"Source Product Reference\": \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"Source Product Identifier 1\": \"sourceProductFirstUniqueIdentifier\",          \"Source Product Identifier 3\": \"sourceProductThirdUniqueIdentifier\",          \"Document Date\": \"documentDate\",          \"Document Currency\": \"documentCurrencyCode\",          \"Document Amount\": \"documentAmount\",          \"Document Currency Payment Amount\": \"documentCurrencyPaymentAmount\",          \"Interest Rate\": \"interestRate\",          \"Discount\": \"discount\",          \"Invoice Type Code\": \"invoiceTypeCode\",          \"Amount\": \"amountToBePaid\",          \"Payment Currency\": \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"Payment Date\": \"paymentDate\",          \"Payment Due Date\": \"paymentDueDate\",          \"Withheld Amount\": \"withheldAmount\",          \"Supplier Pay Group\": \"supplierPayGroup\",          \"Payment Function Lookup Code\": \"paymentFunctionLookupCode\",          \"Payment Method Code\": \"paymentMethod.code\",          \"Payment Method\": \"paymentMethod.paymentMethodName\",          \"Payment Function Code\": \"paymentFunction.lookupCode\",          \"Payment Function\": \"paymentFunction.meaning\",          \"Payment Mode Code\": \"paymentMode.lookupCode\",          \"Payment Mode\": \"paymentMode.meaning\",          \"Document Payable Status Code\": \"documentPayableStatus.lookupCode\",          \"Document Payable Status\": \"documentPayableStatus.meaning\",          \"Business Unit\": \"businessUnit.name\",          \"Legal Entity\": \"legalEntity.name\",          \"Supplier Site\": \"supplierSite.name\",          \"Supplier ID\": \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierId\",          \"Supplier Name\": \"supplierSite.supplier.name\",          \"Supplier Type Code\": \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.lookupCode\",          \"Supplier Type\": \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.meaning\",          \"Payee\": \"payeeParty.name\",          \"Disbursement Bank Account\": \"bankAccount.name\",          \"Disbursement Bank Account ID\": \"bankAccount.id\",          \"External Bank Account\": \"externalBankAccount.bankAccountName\",          \"External Bank Account ID\": \"externalBankAccount.id\",          \"External Bank Country\": \"externalBankAccount.countryCode\",          \"Payment Profile\": \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\",          \"Payment Profile ID\": \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileId\",          \"System Payment Profile\": \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.systemProfileCode\",          \"Processing Type\": \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.processingType.meaning\",          \"Payment Format Code\": \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.paymentFormat.paymentFormatCode\",          \"Payment Format\": \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.paymentFormat.formatName\",          \"SRA Document Count Limit\": \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.paymentRemitAdviceSetup.documentCountLimit\",          \"Automatic SRA Submit\": \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.paymentRemitAdviceSetup.automaticSraSubmitFlag\",          \"Logical Group By Payment Date\": \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.paymentLogicalGroupingRule.groupByPaymentDateFlag\",          \"Logical Group By Internal Bank Account\": \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.paymentLogicalGroupingRule.groupByInternalBankAccountFlag\",          \"Logical Group By Service Level\": \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.paymentLogicalGroupingRule.groupByServiceLevelFlag\",          \"Invoice ID\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceId\",          \"Installment Number\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",          \"Due Date\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.dueDate\",          \"Installment Amount\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentAmount\",          \"Installment Unpaid Amount\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.unpaidAmount\",          \"Remit-To Supplier\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.remitToSupplierName\",          \"Invoice Number\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",          \"Invoice Type\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceType\",          \"Invoice Date\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceDate\",          \"Invoice Amount\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceAmount\",          \"PPR ID\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"PPR Name\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"PPR Created On\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.timeCreated\",          \"PPR Status Lookup Code\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",          \"PPR Status Code\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"PPR Status\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\",          \"PPR Initiation\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentInitiation.meaning\",          \"Disbursement Payment ID\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentId\",          \"Disbursement Payment Reference\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentReferenceNumber\",          \"Payment Number\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentReferenceNumber\",          \"Disbursement Payment Amount\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentAmount\",          \"Disbursement Payment Date\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentDate\",          \"Disbursement Payment Function Lookup Code\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentFunctionLookupCode\",          \"Funds Status\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.fundsStatus.meaning\",          \"Payment File ID\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentInstructionId\",          \"Payment File Processing Status Lookup Code\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode\",          \"Payment File Status Code\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatus.lookupCode\",          \"Payment File Status\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatus.meaning\",          \"AP Payment Number\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPayment.paymentNumber\",          \"AP Payment Status\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPayment.paymentStatus.meaning\",          \"Conversion Rate\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceToPaymentConversionRate\",          \"Reconciled\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPayment.reconciledFlag\",          \"Clearing Date\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPayment.clearingDate\"        }      },      \"fieldSelection\": {        \"base\": [          \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\",          \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",          \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",          \"amountToBePaid\",          \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.dueDate\"        ],        \"optional\": [          \"documentPayableId\",          \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"paymentDate\",          \"paymentDueDate\",          \"documentAmount\",          \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"documentDate\",          \"documentCurrencyCode\",          \"interestRate\",          \"discount\",          \"invoiceTypeCode\",          \"documentCurrencyPaymentAmount\",          \"sourceProductFirstUniqueIdentifier\",          \"sourceProductThirdUniqueIdentifier\",          \"withheldAmount\",          \"bankAccount.id\",          \"externalBankAccount.id\",          \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\",          \"paymentFunction.meaning\",          \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.timeCreated\",          \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceToPaymentConversionRate\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentReferenceNumber\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentDate\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentInstructionId\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatus.meaning\"        ]      },      \"sortableAttributes\": [        \"documentPayableId\",        \"paymentCurrencyCode\",        \"amountToBePaid\",        \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",        \"bankAccount.id\",        \"externalBankAccount.id\",        \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\",        \"paymentFunction.lookupCode\",        \"paymentFunction.meaning\",        \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.timeCreated\",        \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\"      ],      \"filterConditions\": [        {          \"name\": \"documentPayableId\",          \"attribute\": \"documentPayableId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user provides the internal document payable identifier.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"attribute\": \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user refers to the source transaction or expense/reference number.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks about a specific installment number.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceId\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the invoice id is available.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user provides the invoice number for the installment.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentDate\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentDate\",          \"type\": \"date\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use for payment-date filters and date windows.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentDueDate\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentDueDate\",          \"type\": \"date\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks about due-date-oriented installment payment runs.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"amountToBePaid\",          \"attribute\": \"amountToBePaid\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use for amount-threshold questions such as installments or proposed payments over 50000 or 100000.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payeeParty.name\",          \"attribute\": \"payeeParty.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters by payee or supplier party name.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"supplierSite.name\",          \"attribute\": \"supplierSite.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters by supplier site.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierId\",          \"attribute\": \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the supplier resolves to an internal supplier identifier.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes installments by supplier type.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentMethod.code\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentMethod.code\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters by payment method code.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentMode.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentMode.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters by payment mode.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"businessUnit.id\",          \"attribute\": \"businessUnit.id\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes installments by business unit.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"businessUnit.name\",          \"attribute\": \"businessUnit.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user groups or filters installments by business unit name.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"legalEntity.legalEntityId\",          \"attribute\": \"legalEntity.legalEntityId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes installments by legal entity.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"documentCurrencyCode\",          \"attribute\": \"documentCurrencyCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user compares the payable document currency to the payment currency.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for a specific payment currency or for document-versus-payment currency mismatches.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceToPaymentConversionRate\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceToPaymentConversionRate\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use =null as the conversion-rate predicate when the user asks for currency mismatch rows with missing conversion rates.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user provides a payment process request id.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user provides a payment process request name.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"INSERTED\",            \"PENDING_REVIEW\",            \"INFORMATION_REQUIRED\",            \"DOCUMENTS_VALIDATED\",            \"PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS\",            \"PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS\",            \"VALIDATION_FAILED\",            \"FAILED_PAYMENT_VALIDATION\",            \"ORA_REQUIRE_APPROVAL\",            \"ORA_APPROVAL_INITIATED\",            \"ORA_APPROVED\",            \"ORA_APPROVAL_WITHDRAWN\",            \"ORA_APPROVAL_ERROR\",            \"PAYMENTS_INITIATED\",            \"PAYMENTS_CREATED\",            \"RETRY_DOCUMENT_VALIDATION\",            \"RETRY_PAYMENT_CREATION\",            \"COMPLETED\",            \"ASSIGNMENT_COMPLETE\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use this IBY-source status filter when the user asks for installments under an Oracle Payments PPR status. For AP-only statuses such as MISSING RATES or MISSING_X_RATES, use selectedPaymentInstallments instead. For mixed-source statuses such as CANCELING or TERMINATED, use the deduplicated extraction shapes.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.name\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks which disbursement bank account is paying the installment.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.id\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.id\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user groups or filters proposed payments by the disbursement bank account identifier.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"externalBankAccount.bankAccountName\",          \"attribute\": \"externalBankAccount.bankAccountName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks which external bank account the installment is being paid to.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"externalBankAccount.id\",          \"attribute\": \"externalBankAccount.id\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user wants to isolate payments by the supplier bank account identifier.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"externalBankAccount.countryCode\",          \"attribute\": \"externalBankAccount.countryCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user groups installments by destination country.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileId\",          \"attribute\": \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters by payment profile.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\",          \"attribute\": \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for proposed payments routed through a named payment profile.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"withheldAmount\",          \"attribute\": \"withheldAmount\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks which installments have withholding tax or wants withheld totals in the payment run.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"discount\",          \"attribute\": \"discount\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks which installments are carrying discount effects in the run.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentId\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user wants the resulting disbursement payment for the installment.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentInstructionId\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentInstructionId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes installments by resulting payment file id.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentAmount\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentAmount\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user gives a payment amount threshold or asks for high-value payments.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payment amount provided by user\"        }      ],      \"dateFilterGuidance\": {        \"description\": \"For broad acknowledgement-rejected installment questions without a payment file, supplier, date range, or active context, prefer `paymentRunInstallmentsExtraction` and its `acknowledgementFileCreatedOn` alias for the default last-30-days date axis. Do not build a direct BV filter on `payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.disbursementInboundFile.timeCreated` for this broad REST path. Do not add a default date filter when the user provides a payment file id.\",        \"patterns\": [          {            \"userRequest\": \"show me installments that are in acknowledgement rejected status\",            \"clause\": \"Use `paymentRunInstallmentsExtraction` with `acknowledgementFileCreatedOn>=TIMESTAMP '<TODAY_MINUS_30_DAYS> 00:00:00'` when no payment file, supplier, date range, or active context is supplied.\"          },          {            \"userRequest\": \"show me installments in payment file <id> that are in acknowledgement rejected status\",            \"clause\": \"Do not add a default date filter because paymentInstructionId is the scope.\"          }        ]      },      \"extractionQuery\": null,      \"businessDrivers\": [        {          \"name\": \"installmentByIdOrReference\",          \"description\": \"Retrieve a payment-run installment by document payable id or source reference number.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for one installment, one source transaction, or one document payable entry.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"documentPayableId\",            \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",            \"paymentDate\",            \"paymentDueDate\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"documentPayableStatus.meaning\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"documentPayableId=<DOCUMENT_PAYABLE_ID_FROM_USER> or sourceProductReferenceNumber='<SOURCE_REFERENCE_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"\"        },        {          \"name\": \"installmentsByPpr\",          \"description\": \"Retrieve payment-run installments under a named or identified payment process request.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for installments in a PPR or payment run.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentDate\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentId\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentInstructionId\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccountByInstallment\",          \"description\": \"Retrieve the paying bank account and the payee external bank account for a specific installment, with surrounding payment logistics.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which bank account is being used to pay for a specific installment in a payment run or PPR.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"documentPayableId\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",            \"bankAccount.name\",            \"externalBankAccount.bankAccountName\",            \"externalBankAccount.countryCode\",            \"paymentMethod.paymentMethodName\",            \"paymentMode.meaning\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentId\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentReferenceNumber\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"documentPayableId=<DOCUMENT_PAYABLE_ID_FROM_USER> or payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber=<INSTALLMENT_NUMBER_FROM_USER>\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber='<INVOICE_NUMBER_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Prefer combining installment number with invoice number or PPR context when the installment number alone is ambiguous.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentSetupByInstallment\",          \"description\": \"Retrieve payment setup details for an installment, including payment method, payment mode, payment profile, processing type, and format.\",          \"when\": \"User asks about payment and processing options for a specific installment.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"documentPayableId\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",            \"paymentMethod.paymentMethodName\",            \"paymentMode.meaning\",            \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\",            \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.systemProfileCode\",            \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.processingType.meaning\",            \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.paymentFormat.paymentFormatCode\",            \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.paymentFormat.formatName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"documentPayableId=<DOCUMENT_PAYABLE_ID_FROM_USER> or payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber=<INSTALLMENT_NUMBER_FROM_USER>\"          ],          \"notes\": \"\"        },        {          \"name\": \"resultingPaymentTrace\",          \"description\": \"Trace a payment-run installment to the resulting disbursement payment and payment file.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which payment, payment file, or payment status resulted from a specific installment.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"documentPayableId\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentId\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.meaning\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.fundsStatus.meaning\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentInstructionId\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatus.meaning\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"documentPayableId=<DOCUMENT_PAYABLE_ID_FROM_USER> or payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber=<INSTALLMENT_NUMBER_FROM_USER>\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Add invoice number or source reference when needed to disambiguate an installment.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"proposedPaymentsByPpr\",          \"description\": \"Review proposed payments in a payment run with the bank-account and payment-formation context needed before approval.\",          \"when\": \"User asks to review proposed payments for a PPR after the run has grouped installments into payments.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"payeeParty.name\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentDate\",            \"bankAccount.name\",            \"externalBankAccount.bankAccountName\",            \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\",            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use this driver when the user explicitly wants the readable disbursement bank account name instead of only the internal bank account id.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"fundingCheckByBankAccount\",          \"description\": \"Review proposed payment totals by disbursement bank account for funding sufficiency.\",          \"when\": \"User asks to group payments by bank account to verify funds before approval or transmission.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"bankAccount.id\",            \"bankAccount.name\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"payeeParty.name\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Group externally by bankAccount.id or bankAccount.name and sum amountToBePaid.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"supplierValueConcentrationInRun\",          \"description\": \"Identify the suppliers or payees that account for most of the proposed payment value in the run.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which suppliers represent 80 percent of the total value in a PPR.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"payeeParty.name\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",            \"bankAccount.name\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Aggregate by payeeParty.name, sort descending by summed amountToBePaid, and compute the running cumulative percentage outside the base fetch.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"highValueProposedPayments\",          \"description\": \"Surface high-value proposed payments with supplier, invoice, and bank-routing context for approval review.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for payments above a threshold that need manager approval within a named PPR or approval-review context. Do not use this generic driver for all-PPR proposed-payment questions with supplier details; use highValueProposedPaymentsWithSupplierDetails instead.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"payeeParty.name\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentDate\",            \"bankAccount.name\",            \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"(paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>')\",            \"amountToBePaid > <AMOUNT_THRESHOLD_FROM_USER_OR_DEFAULT_100000>\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use the companion EV PayablesPaymentProcessRequestDetails for the run-level approver and pending-since aging. Do not use this generic driver for all-PPR proposed-payment questions with supplier details; those require the highValueProposedPaymentsWithSupplierDetails driver and locked BV field-selection rule.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"documentsMissingDisbursementBankAccount\",          \"description\": \"Find non-virtual-card document payables in the run that do not yet have a disbursement bank account assigned.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which documents are missing the disbursement bank account during installment review.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",            \"payeeParty.name\",            \"paymentMethod.paymentMethodName\",            \"paymentMode.meaning\",            \"paymentDate\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>' when the user provides a PPR\",            \"bankAccount.id=null\",            \"(paymentMode.lookupCode!='VIRTUAL_CARD' or paymentMode.lookupCode=null)\"          ],          \"notes\": \"For a named PPR, combine the exact PPR filter with bankAccount.id=null and the virtual-card exclusion. Do not omit the virtual-card exclusion and do not replace bankAccount.id with a different setup field.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"documentsMissingProcessingAttributes\",          \"description\": \"Find non-virtual-card document payables missing required payment setup such as disbursement bank account or payment profile.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which documents are missing attributes before the payment run can continue.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.dueDate\",            \"paymentMethod.paymentMethodName\",            \"businessUnit.name\",            \"legalEntity.name\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"bankAccount.name\",            \"externalBankAccount.bankAccountName\",            \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\",            \"paymentMode.meaning\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>' when the user provides a PPR\",            \"(bankAccount.id=null or accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileId=null)\",            \"(paymentMode.lookupCode!='VIRTUAL_CARD' or paymentMode.lookupCode=null)\"          ],          \"notes\": \"For a named PPR, combine the exact PPR filter with the missing bank-account/payment-profile predicate and the virtual-card exclusion. This is supported for questions about missing attributes for processing a PPR. Detail output must include Payment Method, Business Unit, Legal Entity, and Currency.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"stuckDueToFailure\",          \"description\": \"List payment-run installments that are stuck because the PPR or related payment file is in a failure, validation, approval-error, or information-required state.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for all installments, documents, or rows stuck because of failure and needs the detail columns PPR Name, PPR Status, Payment File Status, Invoice Number, Installment Number, Amount, Payment Currency, and Due Date.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatus.lookupCode\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatus.meaning\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.dueDate\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"(paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode in ('INFORMATION_REQUIRED','PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS','VALIDATION_FAILED','FAILED_PAYMENT_VALIDATION','ORA_APPROVAL_ERROR') or payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatus.lookupCode in ('FORMATTING_FAILED','TRANSMISSION_FAILED','CREATION_ERROR'))\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use this as the primary detail row-list path for broad all-installments-stuck-because-of-failure questions. Keep the visible detail columns limited to PPR Name, PPR Status, Payment File Status, Invoice Number, Installment Number, Amount, Payment Currency, and Due Date unless the user explicitly asks for error, supplier, or setup context. Payment File Status is mandatory because payment-file failure statuses are part of the OR filter and may be the reason the installment is stuck. Return payment file status code as a helper field when available; it is not intended as a visible business column. Use paymentRunInstallmentExceptions or documentValidationErrors only to add attached error codes, messages, or status reasons. Missing-rate statuses are AP-source statuses and should route to selectedPaymentInstallments.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"currencyMismatchByDestinationCountry\",          \"description\": \"Review installments where the payable document currency differs from the payment currency and summarize them by destination country.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for currency mismatches grouped by destination country during installment review.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"payeeParty.name\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",            \"documentCurrencyCode\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"externalBankAccount.countryCode\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceToPaymentConversionRate\",            \"amountToBePaid\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"documentCurrencyCode!=paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceToPaymentConversionRate=null\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use externalBankAccount.countryCode as the destination-country grouping dimension. For this combined query, apply both predicates together: DOCUMENT_CURRENCY_CODE != PAYMENT_CURRENCY_CODE and CONVERSION_RATE = null.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"highValueInstallmentsBySupplierType\",          \"description\": \"Find high-value installments in the Oracle Payments run branch for a supplier type or category.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for installments above a threshold for suppliers in a category such as manufacturing and the request is explicitly scoped to Oracle Payments, payment-run, formed-payment, IBY, payment-file, bank-account, or another payment-execution-only context.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"payeeParty.name\",            \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.meaning\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"paymentDate\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"amountToBePaid>=<AMOUNT_THRESHOLD_FROM_USER_OR_DEFAULT_50000>\",            \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.lookupCode='<SUPPLIER_TYPE_CODE_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use supplierSite.supplier.supplierType when the organization-specific supplier category can be mapped to a supplier type code and the requested population is the Oracle Payments/payment-run branch. For generic installments under a PPR, use the deduplicated PPR installment extraction shapes instead.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"fundingBankForSupplierAmount\",          \"description\": \"Find the paying internal bank account for a supplier installment or proposed payment above a requested amount.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which internal bank account is funding a high-value installment for a supplier.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"payeeParty.name\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",            \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"bankAccount.id\",            \"bankAccount.name\",            \"externalBankAccount.bankAccountName\",            \"externalBankAccount.countryCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"payeeParty.name='<SUPPLIER_NAME_FROM_USER>'\",            \"amountToBePaid>=<AMOUNT_THRESHOLD_FROM_USER>\",            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>' when the user provides a PPR\"          ],          \"notes\": \"If no PPR is provided, use the supplier and amount threshold first, then ask for or infer the run context before presenting multiple matches.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"blockingValidationErrorsForUrgentPayments\",          \"description\": \"Show validation errors blocking overdue or high-impact document payables/installments so the user can fix the most urgent payment issues first.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for validation errors blocking high-priority, urgent, overdue, or must-fix-first payments/installments.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",            \"payeeParty.name\",            \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",            \"paymentDueDate\",            \"paymentDate\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorCode\",            \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorMessage\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode in ('PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS')\",            \"paymentDueDate < paymentDate\",            \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorCode is not null\"          ],          \"sortBy\": [            {              \"attribute\": \"paymentDueDate\",              \"direction\": \"asc\"            },            {              \"attribute\": \"amountToBePaid\",              \"direction\": \"desc\"            }          ],          \"notes\": \"Map `paymentProcessRequestStatusCode` to `paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode`, alias `PPR Status Code`. For overdue logic, use `paymentDueDate < paymentDate`. Since this shape does not expose an explicit priority field, prioritize by overdue date first and amount second.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"highValueProposedPaymentsWithSupplierDetails\",          \"description\": \"Retrieve proposed payment-run installments above a requested amount threshold with supplier details across all PPRs.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for proposed payments over a threshold with supplier details for all PPRs.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",            \"payeeParty.name\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"paymentMethod.paymentMethodName\",            \"bankAccount.name\",            \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.meaning\",            \"paymentDate\",            \"supplierSite.name\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"amountToBePaid > <AMOUNT_THRESHOLD_FROM_USER>\",            \"sortBy: amountToBePaid:desc\",            \"limit: 20\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Do not require a named PPR for all-PPR high-value proposed payment questions. Use paymentRunInstallments BV, not disbursementPayments, when the user says proposed payments with supplier details. Mandatory query contract: preserve the full fieldsToReturn list in the generated query context, including PPR Name, PPR ID, Payee, Payment Amount, Currency, Payment Method, Disbursement Bank Account, Supplier Type, Payment Date, and Supplier Site. Use a strict amountToBePaid > threshold filter for wording such as over, above, greater than, or exceeds; do not use >= unless the user explicitly says at least or greater than or equal to. A currency symbol in the threshold only denotes the numeric amount; do not add a paymentCurrencyCode filter unless the user explicitly supplies a separate currency constraint.\"        }      ],      \"additionalInstructions\": [        \"For broad all-installments-stuck-because-of-failure questions, use the stuckDueToFailure driver and keep detail columns limited to PPR Name, PPR Status, Payment File Status, Invoice Number, Installment Number, Amount, Payment Currency, and Due Date unless the user asks for more context. Payment File Status is required because payment-file failure statuses are part of the stuck-condition OR filter.\",        \"Use the canonical resource `paymentRunInstallments`, and prefer the richer `paymentRunInstallments` expanded view when bank-account, PPR, payment, payment-file, or invoice-installment accessor details are needed.\",        \"Do not use paymentRunInstallments as the primary source for plain 'review installments for PPR' requests. Use pprInstallmentsDeduplicatedSummary for summary review and pprInstallmentsDeduplicatedDetails for line-level review unless the PPR status resolves to Oracle Payments or the user explicitly asks for IBY-source, payment-run, formed-payment, payment-file, bank-account, or other payment-execution-only context.\",        \"Do not replace the deduplicated PPR installment population with this source solely because this source exposes an extra classifier such as supplier type or category. If the deduplicated extraction exposes a branch-safe alias for the classifier, keep the deduplicated shape and let that shape apply the branch-scoped filter.\",        \"Use paymentRunInstallments only for IBY-source PPR statuses: INSERTED, PENDING_REVIEW, INFORMATION_REQUIRED, DOCUMENTS_VALIDATED, PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS, PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS, VALIDATION_FAILED, FAILED_PAYMENT_VALIDATION, ORA_REQUIRE_APPROVAL, ORA_APPROVAL_INITIATED, ORA_APPROVAL_WITHDRAWN, ORA_APPROVED, ORA_APPROVAL_ERROR, PAYMENTS_INITIATED, PAYMENTS_CREATED, RETRY_DOCUMENT_VALIDATION, RETRY_PAYMENT_CREATION, COMPLETED, and ASSIGNMENT_COMPLETE.\",        \"Do not use paymentRunInstallments for AP-only statuses such as MISSING RATES, MISSING_X_RATES, SELECTING, SELECTED, REVIEW, SUBMITTED, CALCULATING, ORA_REFRESH_INSTALLMENTS, CANCELED, or CANCELLED NO PAYMENTS; use selectedPaymentInstallments for those statuses.\",        \"For mixed-source statuses CANCELING and TERMINATED, or when the PPR status is unknown, use the deduplicated installment extraction shapes instead of this IBY-only shape.\",        \"Use nested accessor paths exactly as defined in `fields.accessors`; do not invent flattened aliases or attributes not present in the expanded view.\",        \"This is the best canonical BV when the user needs readable disbursement bank account names, supplier bank account names, or formed-payment context during proposed-payment review.\",        \"Use this shape for missing-attribute drill-down after installments are already in Oracle Payments, including bank-account and payment-profile gaps on non-virtual-card documents.\",        \"Use documentCurrencyCode as the payable-document currency when comparing it with paymentCurrencyCode in installment review.\",        \"For currency-mismatch queries that ask to highlight missing conversion rates by destination country, use documentCurrencyCode!=paymentCurrencyCode and payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceToPaymentConversionRate=null together; in source-column terms this is DOCUMENT_CURRENCY_CODE != PAYMENT_CURRENCY_CODE and CONVERSION_RATE = null.\",        \"For installment bank-account questions, return both `bankAccount.name` and `externalBankAccount.bankAccountName` together, since users usually need the paying account and the destination account in one answer.\",        \"When filtering by installment, prefer `documentPayableId` when available. If the user only gives an installment number, add invoice number, source reference, or PPR context to avoid ambiguous matches.\",        \"For payment and processing option questions, include `paymentMethod`, `paymentMode`, `accountPaymentProfile`, `systemPaymentProfile.processingType`, and `systemPaymentProfile.paymentFormat` together so the answer explains the setup driving the installment payment.\",        \"When the user asks for resulting payment or file context, follow the accessor chain through `payablesDisbursementPayment` and `payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile` instead of guessing from top-level installment fields.\",        \"For broad acknowledgement rejected installment or rejected-payment questions without a payment file, supplier, date range, or active context, use `paymentRunInstallmentsExtraction` with `acknowledgementFileCreatedOn` and Oracle ANSI TIMESTAMP literals. For payment-file-scoped bank-error questions without invoice/installment columns, use `disbursementPayments` or `disbursementPaymentsExtraction`. Do not build direct paymentRunInstallments BV filters or `$fields` using nested `payablesDisbursementPayment.bepErrorCode`, `payablesDisbursementPayment.bepErrorMessageText`, `payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.*`, or `payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.disbursementInboundFile.timeCreated`.\",        \"When testing for missing bank-account or payment-profile attributes, use =null predicates in the outer filter and exclude `paymentMode.lookupCode='VIRTUAL_CARD'` when the setup rule is specific to disbursement bank accounts.\",        \"The source driver `payment mode mappings` only contributed the `VIRTUAL_CARD` branch, which is already modeled in the local missing-attribute drivers and instructions; keep using that canonical local handling instead of adding a duplicate driver.\",        \"This shape does not expose the timestamp of a recent supplier bank-account change, so fraud-risk review for recently changed bank accounts is only partial here and may require another source.\",        \"Questions asking what bank account is being used to pay a specific installment are supported. Filter by invoice number plus installment number when documentPayableId is not provided, and return both the paying bank account and payee external bank account.\",        \"For proposed payments over an amount threshold with supplier details for all PPRs, use paymentRunInstallments BV with the exact locked field set paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName,paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId,payeeParty.name,amountToBePaid,paymentCurrencyCode,paymentMethod.paymentMethodName,bankAccount.name,supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.meaning,paymentDate,supplierSite.name; filter with amountToBePaid > threshold; sort amountToBePaid desc; limit 20; do not require a PPR name. Do not trim the generated queryContext fields to the visible answer table columns.\",        \"For proposed payments over a threshold with supplier details, do not infer paymentCurrencyCode from symbols such as $ in the amount. Use only amountToBePaid > threshold unless the user separately asks for a specific payment currency.\",        \"For 'Review proposed payments for all PPRs', this BV is the required detail query after the paymentRunInstallmentSummaries AV. Use filters null, sort amountToBePaid desc, limit 20; do not add PENDING_REVIEW.\"      ],      \"fieldSelectionRuleUsage\": {        \"match\": \"Choose the closest questionExamples entry for the user request before using generic business drivers.\",        \"fields\": \"Use the matching fields value exactly and preserve order. For fieldOrderLocked rules, do not trim queryContext fields to only displayed answer-table columns.\",        \"paraphrases\": \"Use the same fields, filters, sort, and limit for paraphrased or equivalent requests.\",        \"filters\": \"If the matching rule provides filters, apply them exactly. For amount phrases such as over, above, greater than, or exceeds, use >, not >=. Use >= only when the user explicitly says at least or greater than or equal to.\",        \"sortAndLimit\": \"If the matching rule provides sortBy or limit, apply them unless the user explicitly asks for a different sort or limit.\",        \"queryContext\": \"The contextData.queryContext must retain the full matched fields, filters, sortBy, and limit even if the visible response table uses fewer columns.\"      },      \"fieldSelectionRules\": [        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"Which documents are missing disbursement bank account\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"BV\",          \"shape\": \"paymentRunInstallments\",          \"fields\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName,payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber,payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber,payeeParty.name,paymentMethod.paymentMethodName,paymentMode.meaning,paymentDate,amountToBePaid,paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"filters\": \"bankAccount.id = null and (paymentMode.lookupCode != 'VIRTUAL_CARD' or paymentMode.lookupCode = null)\",          \"sortBy\": \"amountToBePaid:desc\",          \"limit\": 20,          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true,          \"notes\": \"Detail companion query for documents missing disbursement bank account. Do not omit virtual-card exclusion and do not replace bankAccount.id with a setup/account field.\"        },        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"Show me all proposed payments over $100000 with supplier details for all PPRs\",            \"Show me all proposed payments over $100,000 with supplier details\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"BV\",          \"shape\": \"paymentRunInstallments\",          \"fields\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName,paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId,payeeParty.name,amountToBePaid,paymentCurrencyCode,paymentMethod.paymentMethodName,bankAccount.name,supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.meaning,paymentDate,supplierSite.name\",          \"filters\": \"amountToBePaid > <AMOUNT_THRESHOLD_FROM_USER>\",          \"sortBy\": \"amountToBePaid:desc\",          \"limit\": 20,          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true,          \"fieldAlias\": {            \"PPR Name\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"PPR ID\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",            \"Payee\": \"payeeParty.name\",            \"Payment Amount\": \"amountToBePaid\",            \"Currency\": \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"Payment Method\": \"paymentMethod.paymentMethodName\",            \"Disbursement Bank Account\": \"bankAccount.name\",            \"Supplier Type\": \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.meaning\",            \"Payment Date\": \"paymentDate\",            \"Supplier Site\": \"supplierSite.name\"          },          \"notes\": \"Mandatory exact query-context contract for all-PPR high-value proposed-payment questions: use this full fields list and aliases, apply amountToBePaid > <AMOUNT_THRESHOLD_FROM_USER>, sort by amountToBePaid:desc, and limit 20. Do not replace this with the generic highValueProposedPayments driver, do not use >= for over/exceeds wording, and do not trim queryContext fields to only Supplier Site, Payee, Amount, or Payment Currency. A currency symbol in the amount threshold is not a paymentCurrencyCode filter; do not add paymentCurrencyCode = 'USD' for $100000 unless the user separately asks for USD payments or payments in USD.\"        },        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"Review proposed payments for all PPRs\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"BV\",          \"shape\": \"paymentRunInstallments\",          \"fields\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName,payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentReferenceNumber,payeeParty.name,amountToBePaid,paymentCurrencyCode,paymentMethod.paymentMethodName,bankAccount.name,supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.meaning,paymentDate,paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"filters\": null,          \"sortBy\": \"amountToBePaid:desc\",          \"limit\": 20,          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true,          \"fieldAlias\": {            \"PPR Name\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"PPR ID\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",            \"Payment Reference\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"Payee\": \"payeeParty.name\",            \"Payment Amount\": \"amountToBePaid\",            \"Currency\": \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"Payment Method\": \"paymentMethod.paymentMethodName\",            \"Disbursement Bank Account\": \"bankAccount.name\",            \"Supplier Type\": \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.meaning\",            \"Payment Date\": \"paymentDate\"          },          \"notes\": \"Second required query context for Review proposed payments for all PPRs. Use filters null, sort amountToBePaid desc, limit 20. Do not add PENDING_REVIEW and do not route to disbursementPayments.\"        }      ]    },    \"paymentRunInstallmentsExtraction\": {      \"key\": \"paymentRunInstallmentsExtraction\",      \"name\": \"paymentRunInstallmentsExtraction\",      \"type\": \"EXTRACTION\",      \"module\": \"oraErpCorePaymentsFundsDisbursement\",      \"businessObject\": \"PayablesDocumentPayable\",      \"description\": \"Runtime extraction wrapper for the paymentRunInstallments BV. Use this IBY-source wrapper when the PPR status is resolved to an Oracle Payments stage, when the user asks for the failure-type summary or row list of installments stuck because of failure, or when the user needs disbursement bank-account context, missing-attribute drill-down, supplier type and destination-country slicing, currency mismatch by destination country, or resulting payment and payment-file details. Do not use it as the primary wrapper for generic PPR installment review; use the deduplicated PPR installment extraction shapes first.\",      \"exampleQuestions\": [        \"What are all the installments that are stuck because of failure?\",        \"How many documents are missing disbursement bank account by supplier?\",        \"Which documents are missing attributes in this payment run?\",        \"What is the total IBY payment-run amount for payment process request PPR_123 by payment status?\",        \"How many installments are there where the payment currency is different from the invoice currency by destination country, and highlight any with missing conversion rates\",        \"What total payment amount is assigned to each bank account so I can verify we have sufficient funds in each?\",        \"Which suppliers represent 80% of the total payment value in this PPR after it entered Oracle Payments?\",        \"Show me all IBY payment-run installments over 100000 with supplier details and invoice references in this payment run\",        \"Which installment in PPR PPR_123 is being paid from which disbursement bank account and to which external bank account?\",        \"Which internal bank account is funding the 50000 installment for Supplier ABC?\",        \"Show the payment method, payment mode, and payment profile for installment 3 on invoice INV-1001\",        \"List installments in this payment run with resulting payment id, payment reference number, and payment file id\",        \"What bank account is being used to pay for Installment 1 for invoice <INVOICE_NUMBER>\",        \"Which documents are missing disbursement bank account for PPR <PPR_NAME>\",        \"Show me what attributes are missing for processing PPR <PPR_NAME>\"      ],      \"fields\": {        \"fields\": [          \"documentPayableId\",          \"paymentDate\",          \"documentDate\",          \"documentCurrencyCode\",          \"documentAmount\",          \"interestRate\",          \"discount\",          \"invoiceTypeCode\",          \"documentCurrencyPaymentAmount\",          \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"amountToBePaid\",          \"paymentDueDate\",          \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"sourceProductFirstUniqueIdentifier\",          \"sourceProductThirdUniqueIdentifier\",          \"withheldAmount\",          \"supplierPayGroup\",          \"bankAccountId\",          \"externalBankAccountId\",          \"paymentProfileName\",          \"paymentFunctionLookupCode\",          \"paymentFunctionMeaning\",          \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",          \"paymentProcessRequestCreatedOn\",          \"paymentMethodCode\",          \"paymentMethodName\",          \"paymentModeLookupCode\",          \"paymentModeMeaning\",          \"documentPayableStatusLookupCode\",          \"documentPayableStatusMeaning\",          \"businessUnitName\",          \"legalEntityName\",          \"supplierSiteName\",          \"supplierId\",          \"supplierName\",          \"supplierTypeLookupCode\",          \"supplierTypeMeaning\",          \"payeePartyName\",          \"bankAccountName\",          \"externalBankAccountBankAccountName\",          \"countryCode\",          \"paymentProfileId\",          \"systemProfileCode\",          \"processingTypeMeaning\",          \"paymentFormatCode\",          \"formatName\",          \"invoiceId\",          \"installmentNumber\",          \"dueDate\",          \"installmentAmount\",          \"unpaidAmount\",          \"conversionRate\",          \"remitToSupplierName\",          \"invoiceNumber\",          \"invoiceDate\",          \"invoiceAmount\",          \"paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\",          \"paymentInitiationMeaning\",          \"paymentId\",          \"paymentReferenceNumber\",          \"paymentAmount\",          \"payablesDisbursementPaymentPaymentDate\",          \"bepErrorCode\",          \"bepErrorMessageText\",          \"paymentStatusLookupCode\",          \"paymentStatusMeaning\",          \"fundsStatusMeaning\",          \"paymentInstructionId\",          \"paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode\",          \"paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning\",          \"acknowledgementFileCreatedOn\",          \"paymentNumber\",          \"payablesPaymentPaymentStatusMeaning\",          \"reconciledFlag\",          \"clearingDate\"        ],        \"fieldAlias\": {          \"Document Payable ID\": \"documentPayableId\",          \"Source Product Reference\": \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"Source Product Identifier 1\": \"sourceProductFirstUniqueIdentifier\",          \"Source Product Identifier 3\": \"sourceProductThirdUniqueIdentifier\",          \"Document Date\": \"documentDate\",          \"Document Currency\": \"documentCurrencyCode\",          \"Document Amount\": \"documentAmount\",          \"Document Currency Payment Amount\": \"documentCurrencyPaymentAmount\",          \"Interest Rate\": \"interestRate\",          \"Discount\": \"discount\",          \"Invoice Type Code\": \"invoiceTypeCode\",          \"Amount\": \"amountToBePaid\",          \"Payment Currency\": \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"Payment Date\": \"paymentDate\",          \"Payment Due Date\": \"paymentDueDate\",          \"Withheld Amount\": \"withheldAmount\",          \"Supplier Pay Group\": \"supplierPayGroup\",          \"Payment Method Code\": \"paymentMethodCode\",          \"Payment Method\": \"paymentMethodName\",          \"Payment Function Code\": \"paymentFunctionLookupCode\",          \"Payment Function\": \"paymentFunctionMeaning\",          \"Payment Mode Code\": \"paymentModeLookupCode\",          \"Payment Mode\": \"paymentModeMeaning\",          \"Document Payable Status Code\": \"documentPayableStatusLookupCode\",          \"Document Payable Status\": \"documentPayableStatusMeaning\",          \"Business Unit\": \"businessUnitName\",          \"Legal Entity\": \"legalEntityName\",          \"Supplier Site\": \"supplierSiteName\",          \"Supplier ID\": \"supplierId\",          \"Supplier Name\": \"supplierName\",          \"Supplier Type Code\": \"supplierTypeLookupCode\",          \"Supplier Type\": \"supplierTypeMeaning\",          \"Payee\": \"payeePartyName\",          \"Disbursement Bank Account\": \"bankAccountName\",          \"Disbursement Bank Account ID\": \"bankAccountId\",          \"External Bank Account\": \"externalBankAccountBankAccountName\",          \"External Bank Account ID\": \"externalBankAccountId\",          \"External Bank Country\": \"countryCode\",          \"Payment Profile\": \"paymentProfileName\",          \"Payment Profile ID\": \"paymentProfileId\",          \"System Payment Profile\": \"systemProfileCode\",          \"Processing Type\": \"processingTypeMeaning\",          \"Payment Format Code\": \"paymentFormatCode\",          \"Payment Format\": \"formatName\",          \"Invoice ID\": \"invoiceId\",          \"Installment Number\": \"installmentNumber\",          \"Due Date\": \"dueDate\",          \"Installment Amount\": \"installmentAmount\",          \"Installment Unpaid Amount\": \"unpaidAmount\",          \"Remit-To Supplier\": \"remitToSupplierName\",          \"Invoice Number\": \"invoiceNumber\",          \"Invoice Date\": \"invoiceDate\",          \"Invoice Amount\": \"invoiceAmount\",          \"PPR ID\": \"paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"PPR Name\": \"paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"PPR Created On\": \"paymentProcessRequestCreatedOn\",          \"PPR Status Code\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",          \"PPR Status\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\",          \"Failure Type\": \"failureType\",          \"Installment Count\": \"installmentCount\",          \"Missing Attribute Type\": \"missingAttributeType\",          \"Document Count\": \"documentCount\",          \"Total Amount\": \"totalAmount\",          \"PPR Initiation\": \"paymentInitiationMeaning\",          \"Disbursement Payment ID\": \"paymentId\",          \"Disbursement Payment Reference\": \"paymentReferenceNumber\",          \"Payment Number\": \"paymentReferenceNumber\",          \"Disbursement Payment Amount\": \"paymentAmount\",          \"Disbursement Payment Date\": \"payablesDisbursementPaymentPaymentDate\",          \"BEP Error Code\": \"bepErrorCode\",          \"BEP Error Message\": \"bepErrorMessageText\",          \"Disbursement Payment Status Code\": \"paymentStatusLookupCode\",          \"Disbursement Payment Status\": \"paymentStatusMeaning\",          \"Funds Status\": \"fundsStatusMeaning\",          \"Payment File ID\": \"paymentInstructionId\",          \"Payment File Reference\": \"paymentInstructionId\",          \"Payment File Status Code\": \"paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode\",          \"Payment File Status\": \"paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning\",          \"Acknowledgement File Created On\": \"acknowledgementFileCreatedOn\",          \"AP Payment Number\": \"paymentNumber\",          \"AP Payment Status\": \"payablesPaymentPaymentStatusMeaning\",          \"Conversion Rate\": \"conversionRate\",          \"Reconciled\": \"reconciledFlag\",          \"Clearing Date\": \"clearingDate\"        }      },      \"supportedFilters\": [        {          \"name\": \"documentPayableId\",          \"attribute\": \"documentPayableId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user provides the internal document payable identifier.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Document Payable ID\"        },        {          \"name\": \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"attribute\": \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user refers to the source transaction or expense/reference number.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Source Product Reference\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks about a specific installment number.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Installment Number\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceId\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the invoice id is available.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Invoice ID\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user provides the invoice number for the installment.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Invoice Number\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentDate\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentDate\",          \"type\": \"date\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use for payment-date filters and date windows.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payment Date or date range\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentDueDate\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentDueDate\",          \"type\": \"date\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks about due-date-oriented installment payment runs.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payment Due Date or date range\"        },        {          \"name\": \"amountToBePaid\",          \"attribute\": \"amountToBePaid\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use for amount-threshold questions such as installments or proposed payments over 50000 or 100000.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Amount To Be Paid threshold\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentAmount\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentAmount\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user gives a payment amount threshold or asks for high-value payments.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payment amount provided by user\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payeeParty.name\",          \"attribute\": \"payeeParty.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters by payee or supplier party name.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payee\"        },        {          \"name\": \"supplierSite.name\",          \"attribute\": \"supplierSite.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters by supplier site.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Supplier Site\"        },        {          \"name\": \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierId\",          \"attribute\": \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the supplier resolves to an internal supplier identifier.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Supplier ID\"        },        {          \"name\": \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes installments by supplier type.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Supplier Type Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentMethod.code\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentMethod.code\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters by payment method code.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payment Method Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentFunction.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentFunction.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters payment-run installments by payment function.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payment Function Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentMode.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentMode.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters by payment mode.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payment Mode Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"businessUnit.id\",          \"attribute\": \"businessUnit.id\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes installments by business unit.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"id\"        },        {          \"name\": \"businessUnit.name\",          \"attribute\": \"businessUnit.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user groups or filters installments by business unit name.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Business Unit\"        },        {          \"name\": \"legalEntity.legalEntityId\",          \"attribute\": \"legalEntity.legalEntityId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes installments by legal entity.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"legalEntityId\"        },        {          \"name\": \"documentCurrencyCode\",          \"attribute\": \"documentCurrencyCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user compares the payable document currency to the payment currency.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Document Currency\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for a specific payment currency or for document-versus-payment currency mismatches.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payment Currency\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user provides a payment process request id.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"PPR ID\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user provides a payment process request name.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"PPR Name\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.timeCreated\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.timeCreated\",          \"type\": \"dateTime\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters payment-run installments by PPR creation time.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"PPR Created On\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"PENDING_REVIEW\",            \"ORA_REQUIRE_APPROVAL\",            \"ORA_APPROVAL_INITIATED\",            \"ORA_APPROVED\",            \"ORA_APPROVAL_WITHDRAWN\",            \"PAYMENTS_CREATED\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes payment-run installments to proposed-payment review or approval statuses.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"PPR Status Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.name\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks which disbursement bank account is paying the installment.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Disbursement Bank Account\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.id\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.id\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user groups or filters proposed payments by the disbursement bank account identifier.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Disbursement Bank Account ID\"        },        {          \"name\": \"externalBankAccount.bankAccountName\",          \"attribute\": \"externalBankAccount.bankAccountName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks which external bank account the installment is being paid to.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"External Bank Account\"        },        {          \"name\": \"externalBankAccount.id\",          \"attribute\": \"externalBankAccount.id\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user wants to isolate payments by the supplier bank account identifier.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"External Bank Account ID\"        },        {          \"name\": \"externalBankAccount.countryCode\",          \"attribute\": \"externalBankAccount.countryCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user groups installments by destination country.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"External Bank Country\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceToPaymentConversionRate\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceToPaymentConversionRate\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceToPaymentConversionRate is null when the user asks for currency mismatch rows with missing conversion rates.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Conversion Rate\"        },        {          \"name\": \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileId\",          \"attribute\": \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters by payment profile.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payment Profile ID\"        },        {          \"name\": \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\",          \"attribute\": \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for proposed payments routed through a named payment profile.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payment Profile\"        },        {          \"name\": \"withheldAmount\",          \"attribute\": \"withheldAmount\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks which installments have withholding tax or wants withheld totals in the payment run.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Withheld Amount\"        },        {          \"name\": \"discount\",          \"attribute\": \"discount\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks which installments are carrying discount effects in the run.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Discount\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentId\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user wants the resulting disbursement payment for the installment.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Disbursement Payment ID\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.bepErrorCode\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.bepErrorCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for bank acknowledgement rejection or BEP error details on installments.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"BEP Error Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"enum\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"VOID\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use paymentStatus.lookupCode='VOID' when the user asks for acknowledgement rejected installments. Display the status as Acknowledgment Rejected for this specific Payment File inquiry scenario.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Disbursement Payment Status Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentInstructionId\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentInstructionId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes installments by resulting payment file id.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payment File ID\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.disbursementInboundFile.timeCreated\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.disbursementInboundFile.timeCreated\",          \"type\": \"dateTime\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use as the default date filter for broad acknowledgement-rejected installment questions when the user does not provide a payment file, supplier, date range, or active context. Because this extraction generates Oracle SQL against a datetime field, emit ANSI TIMESTAMP literals such as `acknowledgementFileCreatedOn >= TIMESTAMP '2026-05-18 00:00:00'`; do not emit plain quoted date strings.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Acknowledgement File Created On\"        }      ],      \"dateFilterGuidance\": {        \"description\": \"For broad acknowledgement-rejected installment questions without a payment file, supplier, date range, or active context, use acknowledgement inbound file `timeCreated` as the default date axis and default to the last 30 days. Extraction SQL must use Oracle ANSI TIMESTAMP literals for this datetime comparison. Do not add this default date filter when the user provides a payment file id.\",        \"patterns\": [          {            \"userRequest\": \"show me installments that are in acknowledgement rejected status\",            \"clause\": \"acknowledgementFileCreatedOn>=TIMESTAMP '<TODAY_MINUS_30_DAYS> 00:00:00' when no payment file, supplier, date range, or active context is supplied\"          },          {            \"userRequest\": \"show me installments in payment file <id> that are in acknowledgement rejected status\",            \"clause\": \"Do not add a default date filter because paymentInstructionId is the scope.\"          }        ]      },      \"extractionQuery\": {        \"viewQueries\": {          \"paymentRunInstallments\": {            \"module\": \"oraErpCorePaymentsFundsDisbursement\",            \"businessObject\": \"PayablesDocumentPayable\",            \"view\": \"paymentRunInstallments\",            \"fieldAliases\": {              \"documentPayableId\": \"documentPayableId\",              \"paymentDate\": \"paymentDate\",              \"documentDate\": \"documentDate\",              \"documentCurrencyCode\": \"documentCurrencyCode\",              \"documentAmount\": \"documentAmount\",              \"interestRate\": \"interestRate\",              \"discount\": \"discount\",              \"invoiceTypeCode\": \"invoiceTypeCode\",              \"documentCurrencyPaymentAmount\": \"documentCurrencyPaymentAmount\",              \"paymentCurrencyCode\": \"paymentCurrencyCode\",              \"amountToBePaid\": \"amountToBePaid\",              \"paymentDueDate\": \"paymentDueDate\",              \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\": \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",              \"sourceProductFirstUniqueIdentifier\": \"sourceProductFirstUniqueIdentifier\",              \"sourceProductThirdUniqueIdentifier\": \"sourceProductThirdUniqueIdentifier\",              \"withheldAmount\": \"withheldAmount\",              \"supplierPayGroup\": \"supplierPayGroup\",              \"bankAccount.id\": \"bankAccountId\",              \"externalBankAccount.id\": \"externalBankAccountId\",              \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\": \"paymentProfileName\",              \"paymentFunction.lookupCode\": \"paymentFunctionLookupCode\",              \"paymentFunction.meaning\": \"paymentFunctionMeaning\",              \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",              \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.timeCreated\": \"paymentProcessRequestCreatedOn\",              \"paymentMethod.code\": \"paymentMethodCode\",              \"paymentMethod.paymentMethodName\": \"paymentMethodName\",              \"paymentMode.lookupCode\": \"paymentModeLookupCode\",              \"paymentMode.meaning\": \"paymentModeMeaning\",              \"documentPayableStatus.lookupCode\": \"documentPayableStatusLookupCode\",              \"documentPayableStatus.meaning\": \"documentPayableStatusMeaning\",              \"businessUnit.name\": \"businessUnitName\",              \"legalEntity.name\": \"legalEntityName\",              \"supplierSite.name\": \"supplierSiteName\",              \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierId\": \"supplierId\",              \"supplierSite.supplier.name\": \"supplierName\",              \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.lookupCode\": \"supplierTypeLookupCode\",              \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.meaning\": \"supplierTypeMeaning\",              \"payeeParty.name\": \"payeePartyName\",              \"bankAccount.name\": \"bankAccountName\",              \"externalBankAccount.bankAccountName\": \"externalBankAccountBankAccountName\",              \"externalBankAccount.countryCode\": \"countryCode\",              \"accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileId\": \"paymentProfileId\",              \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.systemProfileCode\": \"systemProfileCode\",              \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.processingType.meaning\": \"processingTypeMeaning\",              \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.paymentFormat.paymentFormatCode\": \"paymentFormatCode\",              \"accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.paymentFormat.formatName\": \"formatName\",              \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceId\": \"invoiceId\",              \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\": \"installmentNumber\",              \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.dueDate\": \"dueDate\",              \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentAmount\": \"installmentAmount\",              \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.unpaidAmount\": \"unpaidAmount\",              \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceToPaymentConversionRate\": \"conversionRate\",              \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.remitToSupplierName\": \"remitToSupplierName\",              \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\": \"invoiceNumber\",              \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceDate\": \"invoiceDate\",              \"payablesInvoiceInstallment.invoiceTransaction.invoiceAmount\": \"invoiceAmount\",              \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\": \"paymentProcessRequestId\",              \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\": \"paymentProcessRequestName\",              \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\",              \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentInitiation.meaning\": \"paymentInitiationMeaning\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentId\": \"paymentId\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentReferenceNumber\": \"paymentReferenceNumber\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentAmount\": \"paymentAmount\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentDate\": \"payablesDisbursementPaymentPaymentDate\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.bepErrorCode\": \"bepErrorCode\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.bepErrorMessageText\": \"bepErrorMessageText\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.lookupCode\": \"paymentStatusLookupCode\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.meaning\": \"paymentStatusMeaning\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.fundsStatus.meaning\": \"fundsStatusMeaning\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentInstructionId\": \"paymentInstructionId\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatus.lookupCode\": \"paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatus.meaning\": \"paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.disbursementInboundFile.timeCreated\": \"acknowledgementFileCreatedOn\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPayment.paymentNumber\": \"paymentNumber\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPayment.paymentStatus.meaning\": \"payablesPaymentPaymentStatusMeaning\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPayment.reconciledFlag\": \"reconciledFlag\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPayment.clearingDate\": \"clearingDate\"            }          }        },        \"select\": \"{select_statement}\"      },      \"selectExamples\": [        {          \"key\": \"stuckInstallmentsFailureTypeSummary\",          \"name\": \"stuckDueToFailureSummary\",          \"intentSliceKey\": \"stuckInstallmentsFailureTypeSummary\",          \"description\": \"Aggregate installments stuck because of failure by failure type.\",          \"outputFields\": [            \"failureType\",            \"installmentCount\"          ],          \"select\": \"SELECT CASE WHEN paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode IN ('INFORMATION_REQUIRED','PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS','VALIDATION_FAILED','FAILED_PAYMENT_VALIDATION','ORA_APPROVAL_ERROR') THEN paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning ELSE paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning END AS failureType, COUNT(*) AS installmentCount FROM paymentRunInstallments WHERE (paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode IN ('INFORMATION_REQUIRED','PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS','VALIDATION_FAILED','FAILED_PAYMENT_VALIDATION','ORA_APPROVAL_ERROR') OR paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode IN ('FORMATTING_FAILED','TRANSMISSION_FAILED','CREATION_ERROR')) GROUP BY CASE WHEN paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode IN ('INFORMATION_REQUIRED','PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS','VALIDATION_FAILED','FAILED_PAYMENT_VALIDATION','ORA_APPROVAL_ERROR') THEN paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning ELSE paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning END\"        },        {          \"name\": \"summaryMissingBankAccount\",          \"description\": \"Aggregate non-virtual-card payment-run documents missing a disbursement bank account, grouped by payment currency.\",          \"select\": \"SELECT 'Missing Disbursement Bank Account' AS missingAttributeType, COUNT(DISTINCT documentPayableId) AS documentCount, SUM(amountToBePaid) AS totalAmount, paymentCurrencyCode FROM paymentRunInstallments WHERE bankAccountId IS NULL AND (paymentModeLookupCode != 'VIRTUAL_CARD' OR paymentModeLookupCode IS NULL) GROUP BY paymentCurrencyCode\"        },        {          \"key\": \"missingProcessingAttributesSummary\",          \"name\": \"missingProcessingAttributesInPpr\",          \"intentSliceKey\": \"missingProcessingAttributesSummary\",          \"description\": \"List installments in a PPR that are missing processing attributes.\",          \"outputFields\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"missingAttributeType\",            \"supplierSiteName\",            \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",            \"paymentMethodName\",            \"businessUnitName\",            \"legalEntityName\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\"          ],          \"select\": \"SELECT paymentProcessRequestName AS paymentProcessRequestName, CASE WHEN bankAccountId IS NULL THEN 'Missing Disbursement Bank Account' WHEN paymentProfileId IS NULL THEN 'Missing Payment Profile' ELSE 'Other Missing Attribute' END AS missingAttributeType, supplierSiteName AS supplierSiteName, sourceProductReferenceNumber AS sourceProductReferenceNumber, paymentMethodName AS paymentMethodName, businessUnitName AS businessUnitName, legalEntityName AS legalEntityName, paymentCurrencyCode AS paymentCurrencyCode, paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning AS paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning FROM paymentRunInstallments WHERE (bankAccountId IS NULL OR paymentProfileId IS NULL) AND (paymentModeLookupCode != 'VIRTUAL_CARD' OR paymentModeLookupCode IS NULL)\"        },        {          \"key\": \"acknowledgementRejectedInstallmentsInPaymentFile\",          \"name\": \"acknowledgementRejectedInstallmentsInPaymentFile\",          \"intentSliceKey\": \"paymentFileRejectedPaymentDetails\",          \"description\": \"List acknowledgement-rejected installments and bank error detail for a specific payment file.\",          \"outputFields\": [            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"invoiceDate\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"payablesDisbursementPaymentPaymentDate\",            \"bepErrorCode\",            \"bepErrorMessageText\",            \"paymentStatusMeaning\",            \"paymentInstructionId\",            \"supplierName\"          ],          \"select\": \"SELECT invoiceNumber, invoiceDate, installmentNumber, paymentReferenceNumber, payablesDisbursementPaymentPaymentDate, bepErrorCode, bepErrorMessageText, paymentStatusMeaning, paymentInstructionId, supplierName FROM paymentRunInstallments WHERE paymentInstructionId = <PAYMENT_FILE_ID_FROM_USER> AND paymentStatusLookupCode = 'VOID' AND bepErrorCode IS NOT NULL\"        },        {          \"key\": \"broadAcknowledgementRejectedInstallmentsLast30Days\",          \"name\": \"broadAcknowledgementRejectedInstallmentsLast30Days\",          \"intentSliceKey\": \"paymentFileRejectedPaymentDetails\",          \"description\": \"List acknowledgement-rejected installments with invoice detail for broad rejected-payment questions using acknowledgement file creation date.\",          \"outputFields\": [            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"invoiceDate\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"payablesDisbursementPaymentPaymentDate\",            \"bepErrorCode\",            \"bepErrorMessageText\",            \"paymentStatusMeaning\",            \"paymentInstructionId\",            \"supplierName\"          ],          \"select\": \"SELECT invoiceNumber, invoiceDate, installmentNumber, paymentReferenceNumber, payablesDisbursementPaymentPaymentDate, bepErrorCode, bepErrorMessageText, paymentStatusMeaning, paymentInstructionId, supplierName FROM paymentRunInstallments WHERE paymentStatusLookupCode = 'VOID' AND bepErrorCode IS NOT NULL AND acknowledgementFileCreatedOn >= TIMESTAMP '<TODAY_MINUS_30_DAYS> 00:00:00'\"        }      ],      \"businessDrivers\": [        {          \"name\": \"installmentByIdOrReference\",          \"description\": \"Retrieve a payment-run installment by document payable id or source reference number.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for one installment, one source transaction, or one document payable entry.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"documentPayableId\",            \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",            \"paymentDate\",            \"paymentDueDate\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"documentPayableStatusMeaning\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"documentPayableId=<DOCUMENT_PAYABLE_ID_FROM_USER> or sourceProductReferenceNumber='<SOURCE_REFERENCE_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"\"        },        {          \"name\": \"installmentsByPpr\",          \"description\": \"Retrieve payment-run installments under a named or identified payment process request.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for installments in a PPR or payment run.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestId\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentDate\",            \"paymentId\",            \"paymentInstructionId\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccountByInstallment\",          \"description\": \"Retrieve the paying bank account and the payee external bank account for a specific installment, with surrounding payment logistics.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which bank account is being used to pay for a specific installment in a payment run or PPR.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"documentPayableId\",            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"bankAccountName\",            \"externalBankAccountBankAccountName\",            \"countryCode\",            \"paymentMethodName\",            \"paymentModeMeaning\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"paymentId\",            \"paymentReferenceNumber\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"documentPayableId=<DOCUMENT_PAYABLE_ID_FROM_USER> or installmentNumber=<INSTALLMENT_NUMBER_FROM_USER>\",            \"invoiceNumber='<INVOICE_NUMBER_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Prefer documentPayableId when available. If the user asks by invoice and installment number, use extraction aliases invoiceNumber and installmentNumber in the SQL WHERE clause and SELECT bankAccountName. Do not use unsupported dotted paths and do not suppress query context when no rows are returned.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentSetupByInstallment\",          \"description\": \"Retrieve payment setup details for an installment, including payment method, payment mode, payment profile, processing type, and format.\",          \"when\": \"User asks about payment and processing options for a specific installment.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"documentPayableId\",            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"paymentMethodName\",            \"paymentModeMeaning\",            \"paymentProfileName\",            \"systemProfileCode\",            \"processingTypeMeaning\",            \"paymentFormatCode\",            \"formatName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"documentPayableId=<DOCUMENT_PAYABLE_ID_FROM_USER> or payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber=<INSTALLMENT_NUMBER_FROM_USER>\"          ],          \"notes\": \"\"        },        {          \"name\": \"missingProcessingAttributesInPpr\",          \"description\": \"List payment-run installments in a PPR that are missing required processing attributes such as disbursement bank account or payment profile.\",          \"when\": \"User asks what attributes are missing for processing a named PPR, which installments are incomplete, or wants a missing-attribute drill-down for bank account or payment profile setup.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"missingAttributeType\",            \"supplierSiteName\",            \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",            \"paymentMethodName\",            \"businessUnitName\",            \"legalEntityName\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>'\",            \"(bankAccountId is null or paymentProfileId is null)\",            \"(paymentModeLookupCode!='VIRTUAL_CARD' or paymentModeLookupCode is null)\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Classify missingAttributeType in the SELECT using the CASE expression: Missing Disbursement Bank Account, Missing Payment Profile, or Other Missing Attribute. Do not add unrelated failure-status predicates; this driver is for missing setup attributes, not process failures. Use this as a detail-row driver, not a summary driver.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"resultingPaymentTrace\",          \"description\": \"Trace a payment-run installment to the resulting disbursement payment and payment file.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which payment, payment file, or payment status resulted from a specific installment.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"documentPayableId\",            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"paymentId\",            \"paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"paymentStatusMeaning\",            \"fundsStatusMeaning\",            \"paymentInstructionId\",            \"paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"documentPayableId=<DOCUMENT_PAYABLE_ID_FROM_USER> or payablesInvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber=<INSTALLMENT_NUMBER_FROM_USER>\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Add invoice number or source reference when needed to disambiguate an installment.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"proposedPaymentsByPpr\",          \"description\": \"Review proposed payments in a payment run with the bank-account and payment-formation context needed before approval.\",          \"when\": \"User asks to review proposed payments for a PPR after the run has grouped installments into payments.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestId\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentDate\",            \"bankAccountName\",            \"externalBankAccountBankAccountName\",            \"paymentProfileName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use this driver when the user explicitly wants the readable disbursement bank account name instead of only the internal bank account id.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"fundingCheckByBankAccount\",          \"description\": \"Review proposed payment totals by disbursement bank account for funding sufficiency.\",          \"when\": \"User asks to group payments by bank account to verify funds before approval or transmission.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestId\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",            \"bankAccountId\",            \"bankAccountName\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"payeePartyName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Group externally by bankAccount.id or bankAccount.name and sum amountToBePaid.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"supplierValueConcentrationInRun\",          \"description\": \"Identify the suppliers or payees that account for most of the proposed payment value in the run.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which suppliers represent 80 percent of the total value in a PPR.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestId\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"bankAccountName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Aggregate by payeeParty.name, sort descending by summed amountToBePaid, and compute the running cumulative percentage outside the base fetch.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"highValueProposedPayments\",          \"description\": \"Surface high-value proposed payments with supplier, invoice, and bank-routing context for approval review.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for payments above a threshold that need manager approval.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestId\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentDate\",            \"bankAccountName\",            \"paymentProfileName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"(paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>')\",            \"amountToBePaid>=<AMOUNT_THRESHOLD_FROM_USER_OR_DEFAULT_100000>\"          ],          \"notes\": \"\"        },        {          \"name\": \"summaryMissingBankAccount\",          \"description\": \"Summarize non-virtual-card payment-run documents that lack a disbursement bank account.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for a summary, document count, total amount, or missing-attribute grouping for documents missing disbursement bank account.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"missingAttributeType\",            \"documentCount\",            \"totalAmount\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"bankAccount.id is null\",            \"(paymentMode.lookupCode!='VIRTUAL_CARD' or paymentMode.lookupCode is null)\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Return an aggregate result only: missingAttributeType, documentCount, totalAmount, and paymentCurrencyCode. Generate a grouped SELECT from paymentRunInstallments with COUNT(DISTINCT documentPayableId) AS documentCount, SUM(amountToBePaid) AS totalAmount, and paymentCurrencyCode. Because totalAmount is returned, paymentCurrencyCode is mandatory and must appear in GROUP BY. Do not return PPR name, PPR count, invoiceNumber, installmentNumber, supplier, due date, or other row-level detail in this summary slice. Do not apply ROWNUM <= 20 to this grouped summary.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"documentsMissingDisbursementBankAccount\",          \"description\": \"Find non-virtual-card document payables in the run that do not yet have a disbursement bank account assigned.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which documents are missing the disbursement bank account during installment review.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestId\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"paymentMethodName\",            \"paymentModeMeaning\",            \"paymentDate\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>' when the user provides a PPR\",            \"bankAccountId is null\",            \"(paymentModeLookupCode!='VIRTUAL_CARD' or paymentModeLookupCode is null)\"          ],          \"notes\": \"For a named PPR, combine paymentProcessRequestName with bankAccountId is null and the virtual-card exclusion. Do not omit the virtual-card exclusion and do not replace bankAccountId with a different setup field.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"documentsMissingProcessingAttributes\",          \"description\": \"Find non-virtual-card document payables missing required payment setup such as disbursement bank account or payment profile.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which documents are missing attributes before the payment run can continue.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestId\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"dueDate\",            \"paymentMethodName\",            \"businessUnitName\",            \"legalEntityName\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"bankAccountName\",            \"externalBankAccountBankAccountName\",            \"paymentProfileName\",            \"paymentModeMeaning\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>' when the user provides a PPR\",            \"(bankAccountId is null or paymentProfileId is null)\",            \"(paymentModeLookupCode!='VIRTUAL_CARD' or paymentModeLookupCode is null)\"          ],          \"notes\": \"For a named PPR, combine paymentProcessRequestName with the missing bank-account/payment-profile predicate and virtual-card exclusion. This driver supports missing-attribute drill-down for processing a PPR. Detail output must include Payment Method, Business Unit, Legal Entity, and Currency.\"        },        {          \"key\": \"stuckInstallmentsFailureTypeSummary\",          \"name\": \"stuckDueToFailureSummary\",          \"intentSliceKey\": \"stuckInstallmentsFailureTypeSummary\",          \"description\": \"Count payment-run installments by failure type for broad stuck-because-of-failure questions.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for a summary or an all-installments view of installments stuck because of failure and needs the count of installments under each failure type before the detail rows.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"failureType\",            \"installmentCount\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"(paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode in ('INFORMATION_REQUIRED','PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS','VALIDATION_FAILED','FAILED_PAYMENT_VALIDATION','ORA_APPROVAL_ERROR') or payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatus.lookupCode in ('FORMATTING_FAILED','TRANSMISSION_FAILED','CREATION_ERROR'))\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Return an aggregate result only: failureType and installmentCount. Generate a grouped SELECT with CASE WHEN paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode is in the PPR failure-status set THEN paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning ELSE paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning END AS failureType, COUNT(*) AS installmentCount from paymentRunInstallments, and repeat the same CASE expression in GROUP BY. Do not return PPR name, invoiceNumber, installmentNumber, amount, currency, due date, or any other row-level detail in this summary slice. Do not apply ROWNUM <= 20 to this grouped summary.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"stuckDueToFailure\",          \"description\": \"List payment-run installments that are stuck because the PPR or related payment file is in a failure, validation, approval-error, or information-required state.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for all installments, documents, or rows stuck because of failure and needs the detail columns PPR Name, PPR Status, Payment File Status, Invoice Number, Installment Number, Amount, Payment Currency, and Due Date.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestId\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\",            \"paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode\",            \"paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning\",            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"dueDate\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"(paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode in ('INFORMATION_REQUIRED','PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS','VALIDATION_FAILED','FAILED_PAYMENT_VALIDATION','ORA_APPROVAL_ERROR') or payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatus.lookupCode in ('FORMATTING_FAILED','TRANSMISSION_FAILED','CREATION_ERROR'))\",            \"(paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode in ('INFORMATION_REQUIRED','PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS','MISSING RATES','MISSING_X_RATES','ORA_APPROVAL_ERROR') or payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatus.lookupCode in ('FORMATTING_FAILED','TRANSMISSION_FAILED','CREATION_ERROR'))\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use this as the primary detail row-list path for broad all-installments-stuck-because-of-failure questions. Keep the visible detail columns limited to PPR Name, PPR Status, Payment File Status, Invoice Number, Installment Number, Amount, Payment Currency, and Due Date unless the user explicitly asks for error, supplier, or setup context. Payment File Status is mandatory because payment-file failure statuses are part of the OR filter and may be the reason the installment is stuck. Return PPR ID, PPR status code, and payment file status code as helper fields for deeplink/status enrichment; these helper fields are not intended as visible business columns and are removed by the response enricher when used. Use paymentRunInstallmentExceptions or documentValidationErrors only to add attached error codes, messages, or status reasons. Missing-rate statuses are AP-source statuses and should route to selectedPaymentInstallments.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"currencyMismatchByDestinationCountry\",          \"description\": \"Review installments where the payable document currency differs from the payment currency and summarize them by destination country.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for currency mismatches grouped by destination country during installment review.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestId\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"documentCurrencyCode\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"countryCode\",            \"conversionRate\",            \"amountToBePaid\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"documentCurrencyCode!=paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"conversionRate is null\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use externalBankAccount.countryCode as the destination-country grouping dimension. For this combined query, apply both predicates together: DOCUMENT_CURRENCY_CODE != PAYMENT_CURRENCY_CODE and CONVERSION_RATE is null.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"highValueInstallmentsBySupplierType\",          \"description\": \"Find high-value installments in the Oracle Payments run branch for a supplier type or category.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for installments above a threshold for suppliers in a category such as manufacturing and the request is explicitly scoped to Oracle Payments, payment-run, formed-payment, IBY, payment-file, bank-account, or another payment-execution-only context.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestId\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"supplierTypeMeaning\",            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"paymentDate\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"amountToBePaid>=<AMOUNT_THRESHOLD_FROM_USER_OR_DEFAULT_50000>\",            \"supplierSite.supplier.supplierType.lookupCode='<SUPPLIER_TYPE_CODE_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use supplierSite.supplier.supplierType when the organization-specific supplier category can be mapped to a supplier type code and the requested population is the Oracle Payments/payment-run branch. For generic installments under a PPR, use the deduplicated PPR installment extraction shapes instead.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"fundingBankForSupplierAmount\",          \"description\": \"Find the paying internal bank account for a supplier installment or proposed payment above a requested amount.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which internal bank account is funding a high-value installment for a supplier.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestId\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"bankAccountId\",            \"bankAccountName\",            \"externalBankAccountBankAccountName\",            \"countryCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"payeeParty.name='<SUPPLIER_NAME_FROM_USER>'\",            \"amountToBePaid>=<AMOUNT_THRESHOLD_FROM_USER>\",            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>' when the user provides a PPR\"          ],          \"notes\": \"If no PPR is provided, use the supplier and amount threshold first, then ask for or infer the run context before presenting multiple matches.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"blockingValidationErrorsForUrgentPayments\",          \"description\": \"Show validation errors blocking overdue or high-impact document payables/installments so the user can fix the most urgent payment issues first.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for validation errors blocking high-priority, urgent, overdue, or must-fix-first payments/installments.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",            \"payeeParty.name\",            \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",            \"paymentDueDate\",            \"paymentDate\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorCode\",            \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorMessage\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode in ('PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS')\",            \"paymentDueDate < paymentDate\",            \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorCode is not null\"          ],          \"sortBy\": [            {              \"attribute\": \"paymentDueDate\",              \"direction\": \"asc\"            },            {              \"attribute\": \"amountToBePaid\",              \"direction\": \"desc\"            }          ],          \"notes\": \"Map `paymentProcessRequestStatusCode` to `paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode`, alias `PPR Status Code`. For overdue logic, use `paymentDueDate < paymentDate`. Since this shape does not expose an explicit priority field, prioritize by overdue date first and amount second.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"blockingValidationErrorsForHighPriorityItems\",          \"description\": \"Locate validation errors currently blocking high-priority or overdue payment items that are pending manual review before payment processing can continue.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for validation errors blocking high-priority items, overdue installments, urgent payments, or operationally critical payment exceptions requiring immediate remediation.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorCode\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",            \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",            \"documentPayableId\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode in ('PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS')\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use this driver whenever the user asks for validation errors that are actively blocking payment processing or operationally important items. Always constrain the population to PPRs pending review for document or payment validation errors. Use this as the canonical blocking-condition filter for both summary and detail workflows so the same blocked population is preserved consistently across all planned steps.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"acknowledgementRejectedInstallmentsRecent\",          \"description\": \"List recent installments or rejected payments whose resulting payment was rejected by acknowledgement processing when no payment file is provided.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for acknowledgement rejected installments, rejected acknowledgements, rejected payments with invoice detail, or installments rejected by bank acknowledgement without providing a payment file, supplier, date range, or active context.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentInstructionId\",            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"invoiceDate\",            \"invoiceAmount\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"payablesDisbursementPaymentPaymentDate\",            \"bepErrorCode\",            \"bepErrorMessageText\",            \"paymentStatusLookupCode\",            \"paymentStatusMeaning\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"supplierName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.lookupCode='VOID'\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.bepErrorCode is not null\",            \"acknowledgementFileCreatedOn>=TIMESTAMP '<TODAY_MINUS_30_DAYS> 00:00:00'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use this as the canonical driver for broad acknowledgement-rejected installment or rejected-payment questions that need invoice, supplier, error-code, and payment detail. Include invoiceAmount when invoice amount is requested or when returning invoice detail. Use acknowledgementFileCreatedOn as the default last-30-days date axis for broad acknowledgement-rejected installment questions. Because this extraction generates Oracle SQL against a datetime field, use an ANSI TIMESTAMP literal. For this Payment File inquiry scenario, display paymentStatusLookupCode='VOID' as `Acknowledgment Rejected`. Return the BEP error code and message when available. Display Payment Number from paymentReferenceNumber.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"acknowledgementRejectedInstallmentsInPaymentFile\",          \"description\": \"Payment-file-scoped acknowledgement-rejected installments with bank error, supplier, invoice, and payment context.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for acknowledgement-rejected installments, rejection reason, or bank-provided acknowledgement error for a specific payment file.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"invoiceDate\",            \"invoiceAmount\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"payablesDisbursementPaymentPaymentDate\",            \"bepErrorCode\",            \"bepErrorMessageText\",            \"paymentStatusMeaning\",            \"paymentInstructionId\",            \"supplierName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentInstructionId=<PAYMENT_FILE_ID_FROM_USER>\",            \"paymentStatusLookupCode='VOID'\",            \"bepErrorCode IS NOT NULL when supported\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Do not filter acknowledgement-rejected payments by inbound file processing status. Include invoiceAmount when invoice amount is requested or when returning invoice detail. Display paymentReferenceNumber as Payment Number and VOID as Acknowledgment Rejected.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"broadAcknowledgementRejectedInstallmentsLast30Days\",          \"description\": \"Broad acknowledgement-rejected installment search with invoice detail and default acknowledgement-file date window.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for rejected payments or acknowledgement-rejected installments with invoice detail and provides no payment file, supplier, date range, or active context.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"invoiceDate\",            \"invoiceAmount\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"payablesDisbursementPaymentPaymentDate\",            \"bepErrorCode\",            \"bepErrorMessageText\",            \"paymentStatusMeaning\",            \"paymentInstructionId\",            \"supplierName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentStatusLookupCode='VOID'\",            \"bepErrorCode IS NOT NULL when supported\",            \"acknowledgementFileCreatedOn>=TIMESTAMP '<TODAY_MINUS_30_DAYS> 00:00:00' when no date range is supplied\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use acknowledgementFileCreatedOn for the default date window and Oracle ANSI TIMESTAMP literals. Include invoiceAmount when invoice amount is requested or when returning invoice detail. Do not generate a direct BV filter on the deep inbound-file timestamp path for broad queries.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"rejectedPaymentsInPartiallyAcknowledgedFiles\",          \"description\": \"Rejected payments with supplier, invoice, and bank-error detail limited to parent payment files in partially acknowledged status.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for rejected payments within partially acknowledged files, optionally with error codes, suppliers, or invoice details, and does not provide a specific payment file.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentInstructionId\",            \"paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning\",            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"invoiceDate\",            \"invoiceAmount\",            \"installmentNumber\",            \"paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"payablesDisbursementPaymentPaymentDate\",            \"bepErrorCode\",            \"bepErrorMessageText\",            \"paymentStatusMeaning\",            \"supplierName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode='PARTIALLY_ACKNOWLEDGED'\",            \"paymentStatusLookupCode='VOID'\",            \"bepErrorCode IS NOT NULL when supported\",            \"acknowledgementFileCreatedOn>=TIMESTAMP '<TODAY_MINUS_30_DAYS> 00:00:00' when no date range is supplied\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use this driver for the partially acknowledged parent-file scenario. Preserve the parent payment-file scope with paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode='PARTIALLY_ACKNOWLEDGED'. Display VOID as `Acknowledgment Rejected`, include BEP error code/message when available, and use acknowledgementFileCreatedOn for the default last-30-days window.\"        }      ],      \"additionalInstructions\": [        \"For broad all-installments-stuck-because-of-failure questions, use stuckDueToFailureSummary for the failure-type count summary and stuckDueToFailure for the detail rows. Detail rows must include Payment File Status because payment-file failure statuses are part of the stuck-condition OR filter.\",        \"For stuckDueToFailureSummary, return only failureType and installmentCount from a grouped aggregate query. Never reuse stuckDueToFailure detail fields, never include row-level columns, and never apply the detail row limit.\",        \"For summaryMissingBankAccount, return only missingAttributeType, documentCount, totalAmount, and paymentCurrencyCode from a grouped aggregate query. Never include PPR count, never reuse documentsMissingDisbursementBankAccount detail fields, never include row-level columns, and never apply the detail row limit.\",        \"Generate the full SELECT statement and place it into {select_statement} before execution.\",        \"Use viewQueries.paymentRunInstallments as the FROM source with alias consistent in the SQL (for example paymentRunInstallments).\",        \"The inner subselect should project all aliases used by the outer SELECT and WHERE.\",        \"Apply supported filters and date filters as needed, using supportedFilters and entity resolution.\",        \"For detail row-list queries, limit the outer query to 20 rows using where ROWNUM<=20. Do not apply this row limit to grouped summary queries unless the user explicitly asks for top N groups and the query has a valid aggregate ORDER BY.\",        \"Use the canonical resource `paymentRunInstallments`, and prefer the richer `paymentRunInstallments` expanded view when bank-account, PPR, payment, payment-file, or invoice-installment accessor details are needed.\",        \"When any detail or grouped output returns the display column `PPR Name` or the runtime field `paymentProcessRequestName`, also return `paymentProcessRequestId` with alias `PPR ID` and `paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode` with alias `PPR Status Code` as deeplink support fields. When `PPR Status` or `paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning` is returned without PPR Name, still return `paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode` with alias `PPR Status Code` when supported. These support fields are not visible business columns; the response deeplink enricher removes them after building links.\",        \"When a response explicitly needs payment-file deeplinks, return `paymentInstructionId`, `paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning`, and `paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode` with their existing aliases so the response deeplink enricher can choose the correct payment-file view or action link.\",        \"Do not use paymentRunInstallmentsExtraction as the primary source for plain 'review installments for PPR' requests. Use pprInstallmentsDeduplicatedSummary for summary review and pprInstallmentsDeduplicatedDetails for line-level review unless the PPR status resolves to Oracle Payments or the user explicitly asks for IBY-source, payment-run, formed-payment, payment-file, bank-account, or other payment-execution-only context.\",        \"Do not replace the deduplicated PPR installment population with this source solely because this source exposes an extra classifier such as supplier type or category. If the deduplicated extraction exposes a branch-safe alias for the classifier, keep the deduplicated shape and let that shape apply the branch-scoped filter.\",        \"Use nested accessor paths exactly as defined in `fields.accessors`; do not invent flattened aliases or attributes not present in the expanded view.\",        \"This is the best canonical BV when the user needs readable disbursement bank account names, supplier bank account names, or formed-payment context during proposed-payment review.\",        \"Use this shape for missing-attribute drill-down after installments are already in Oracle Payments, including bank-account and payment-profile gaps on non-virtual-card documents.\",        \"Use documentCurrencyCode as the payable-document currency when comparing it with paymentCurrencyCode in installment review.\",        \"For currency-mismatch queries that ask to highlight missing conversion rates by destination country, use documentCurrencyCode!=paymentCurrencyCode and conversionRate is null together; in source-column terms this is DOCUMENT_CURRENCY_CODE != PAYMENT_CURRENCY_CODE and CONVERSION_RATE is null.\",        \"For installment bank-account questions, return both `bankAccount.name` and `externalBankAccount.bankAccountName` together, since users usually need the paying account and the destination account in one answer.\",        \"When filtering by installment, prefer `documentPayableId` when available. If the user only gives an installment number, add invoice number, source reference, or PPR context to avoid ambiguous matches.\",        \"For payment and processing option questions, include `paymentMethod`, `paymentMode`, `accountPaymentProfile`, `systemPaymentProfile.processingType`, and `systemPaymentProfile.paymentFormat` together so the answer explains the setup driving the installment payment.\",        \"When the user asks for resulting payment or file context, follow the accessor chain through `payablesDisbursementPayment` and `payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile` instead of guessing from top-level installment fields.\",        \"For broad acknowledgement rejected installment or rejected-payment questions without a payment file, supplier, date range, or active context, filter `payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.lookupCode='VOID'`, require `payablesDisbursementPayment.bepErrorCode is not null` when available, and default to the last 30 days using `acknowledgementFileCreatedOn` with an Oracle ANSI TIMESTAMP literal. This extraction path is the canonical route when the user asks for rejected payments with error codes, suppliers, and invoice details. For a single-day user request on this datetime field, use whole-day TIMESTAMP bounds. For payment-file-scoped acknowledgement rejected installment questions, filter by `payablesDisbursementPayment.payablesPaymentFile.paymentInstructionId` and do not add a default date filter. For rejected payments within partially acknowledged files, preserve the parent file scope with `paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode='PARTIALLY_ACKNOWLEDGED'`. Display VOID as `Acknowledgment Rejected`; include BEP error code/message when available. Display Payment Number from `paymentReferenceNumber`.\",        \"When testing for missing bank-account or payment-profile attributes, use is null predicates in the outer filter and exclude `paymentMode.lookupCode='VIRTUAL_CARD'` when the setup rule is specific to disbursement bank accounts.\",        \"The source driver `payment mode mappings` only contributed the `VIRTUAL_CARD` branch, which is already modeled in the local missing-attribute drivers and instructions; keep using that canonical local handling instead of adding a duplicate driver.\",        \"This shape does not expose the timestamp of a recent supplier bank-account change, so fraud-risk review for recently changed bank accounts is only partial here and may require another source.\",        \"Questions asking what bank account is being used to pay a specific installment are supported. Filter by invoice number plus installment number when documentPayableId is not provided, and return both the paying bank account and payee external bank account.\",        \"For 'Which documents are missing disbursement bank account', always generate the summaryMissingBankAccount extraction query context grouped by paymentCurrencyCode before any detail rows.\",        \"Questions asking what bank account is being used to pay a specific invoice installment are supported. For invoice/installment wording, generate SELECT bankAccountName FROM paymentRunInstallments WHERE invoiceNumber = '<INVOICE_NUMBER_FROM_USER>' AND installmentNumber = <INSTALLMENT_NUMBER_FROM_USER> AND ROWNUM <= 20.\"      ],      \"fieldSelectionRuleUsage\": {        \"match\": \"Choose the closest questionExamples entry for the user request.\",        \"fields\": \"Use the matching fields value exactly and preserve order.\",        \"paraphrases\": \"Use the same fields for paraphrased or equivalent requests.\",        \"addFieldsOnlyWhen\": \"The user explicitly asks for more displayed columns, or the field is required for filter, sort, group, key, or deeplink handling.\"      },      \"fieldSelectionRules\": [        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"Which documents are missing disbursement bank account\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"extraction\",          \"shape\": \"paymentRunInstallmentsExtraction\",          \"fields\": \"missingAttributeType,documentCount,totalAmount,paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"filters\": \"bankAccountId IS NULL AND (paymentModeLookupCode != 'VIRTUAL_CARD' OR paymentModeLookupCode IS NULL)\",          \"groupBy\": \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"sortBy\": \"totalAmount:desc\",          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true,          \"notes\": \"Use summaryMissingBankAccount. Select 'Missing Disbursement Bank Account' AS missingAttributeType, COUNT(DISTINCT documentPayableId) AS documentCount, SUM(amountToBePaid) AS totalAmount, paymentCurrencyCode. Do not omit query context and do not add a PPR filter unless supplied.\"        },        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"Show me all proposed payments over $100,000 with supplier details\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"extraction\",          \"fields\": \"paymentProcessRequestName,paymentProcessRequestId,payeePartyName,amountToBePaid,paymentCurrencyCode,paymentMethodName,bankAccountName,supplierTypeMeaning,paymentDate,supplierSiteName\",          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true,          \"shape\": \"paymentRunInstallmentsExtraction\",          \"filters\": \"amountToBePaid > <AMOUNT_THRESHOLD_FROM_USER>\",          \"sortBy\": \"amountToBePaid:desc\",          \"limit\": 20,          \"notes\": \"Fallback extraction only; prefer paymentRunInstallments BV when the expected answer asks for proposed payments over a threshold with supplier details.\"        },        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"show me what attributes are missing for processing PPR gapr_ppr_test_4\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"extraction\",          \"fields\": \"missingAttributeType,documentCount,totalAmount,paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true        },        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"show me what attributes are missing for processing PPR gapr_ppr_test_4\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"extraction\",          \"fields\": \"paymentProcessRequestName,missingAttributeType,supplierSiteName,sourceProductReferenceNumber,paymentMethodName,businessUnitName,legalEntityName,paymentCurrencyCode,paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\",          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true        },        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"What bank account is being used to pay for Installment 1 for invoice JPM01-INV01\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"extraction\",          \"fields\": \"bankAccountName\",          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true,          \"shape\": \"paymentRunInstallmentsExtraction\",          \"filters\": \"invoiceNumber = '<INVOICE_NUMBER_FROM_USER>' AND installmentNumber = <INSTALLMENT_NUMBER_FROM_USER> AND ROWNUM <= 20\",          \"notes\": \"Exact supported pattern: SELECT bankAccountName FROM paymentRunInstallments WHERE invoiceNumber = '<INVOICE_NUMBER_FROM_USER>' AND installmentNumber = <INSTALLMENT_NUMBER_FROM_USER> AND ROWNUM <= 20. Do not return narrative only when the result is empty.\"        }      ]    },    \"paymentRunInstallmentExceptions\": {      \"key\": \"paymentRunInstallmentExceptions\",      \"name\": \"paymentRunInstallmentExceptions\",      \"type\": \"BV\",      \"shapeRole\": \"detail\",      \"module\": \"oraErpCorePaymentsFundsDisbursement\",      \"businessObject\": \"DisbursementPaymentTransactionError\",      \"api\": \"objects/ora/erpCore/paymentsFundsDisbursement/v1/paymentRunInstallmentExceptions\",      \"description\": \"Use this BV shape to inspect document-payable and installment-level validation errors inside a payment run. It is the primary shape when the user asks which PPRs are stuck on document validation, which error codes are blocking payment runs, and which payees, invoices, or document payables are affected.\",      \"exampleQuestions\": [        \"Show document validation errors for this payment run.\",        \"Which installments in this PPR are blocked by document validation errors and what errors are attached?\",        \"Group document validation failures by error code and PPR.\",        \"What are the PPRs stuck because of document validation failure?\",        \"Show me all PPRs pending review for document or payment validation errors.\"      ],      \"fields\": {        \"fields\": [          \"id\",          \"errorCode\",          \"errorDate\",          \"errorMessage\",          \"transactionType\",          \"statusReasonCode\",          \"statusReasonMessage\",          \"errorType.lookupCode\",          \"errorType.meaning\",          \"errorStatus.lookupCode\",          \"errorStatus.meaning\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.documentPayableId\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.amountToBePaid\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentMethod.paymentMethodName\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.payeeParty.name\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\"        ],        \"accessors\": {          \"errorType\": {            \"shape\": \"Lookup\",            \"fields\": [              \"lookupType\",              \"meaning\",              \"lookupCode\"            ]          },          \"errorStatus\": {            \"shape\": \"Lookup\",            \"fields\": [              \"lookupType\",              \"meaning\",              \"lookupCode\"            ]          },          \"payablesDocumentPayable\": {            \"shape\": \"PayablesDocumentPayable\",            \"fields\": [              \"documentPayableId\",              \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",              \"amountToBePaid\",              \"paymentCurrencyCode\",              \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\"            ],            \"accessors\": {              \"paymentMethod\": {                \"shape\": \"PaymentMethod\",                \"fields\": [                  \"code\",                  \"paymentMethodName\"                ]              },              \"payeeParty\": {                \"shape\": \"Party\",                \"fields\": [                  \"id\",                  \"name\"                ]              },              \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest\": {                \"shape\": \"PaymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest\",                \"fields\": [                  \"paymentProcessRequestId\",                  \"paymentProcessRequestName\",                  \"timeCreated\"                ],                \"accessors\": {                  \"paymentProcessRequestStatus\": {                    \"shape\": \"Lookup\",                    \"fields\": [                      \"lookupType\",                      \"meaning\",                      \"lookupCode\"                    ]                  }                }              }            }          }        },        \"fieldAlias\": {          \"Exception Id\": \"id\",          \"Error Date\": \"errorDate\",          \"Error Message\": \"errorMessage\",          \"Transaction Type\": \"transactionType\",          \"Status Reason Code\": \"statusReasonCode\",          \"Status Reason Message\": \"statusReasonMessage\",          \"Error Type Code\": \"errorType.lookupCode\",          \"Error Type\": \"errorType.meaning\",          \"Error Status Code\": \"errorStatus.lookupCode\",          \"Error Status\": \"errorStatus.meaning\",          \"Document Payable Id\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.documentPayableId\",          \"Source Reference Number\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"Amount To Be Paid\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.amountToBePaid\",          \"Payment Currency\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"Rejected Group Id\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",          \"Payment Method\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentMethod.paymentMethodName\",          \"Payee\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.payeeParty.name\",          \"PPR Id\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"PPR Name\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"PPR Status Code\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"PPR Status\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\"        }      },      \"fieldSelection\": {        \"base\": [          \"id\",          \"errorDate\",          \"errorMessage\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\"        ],        \"optional\": [          \"errorStatus.meaning\",          \"statusReasonCode\",          \"statusReasonMessage\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.amountToBePaid\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.payeeParty.name\",          \"payablesDocumentPayable.rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\"        ]      },      \"sortableAttributes\": [        \"id\",        \"errorCode\",        \"errorDate\",        \"errorMessage\",        \"transactionType\",        \"statusReasonCode\",        \"statusReasonMessage\",        \"errorType.lookupCode\",        \"errorType.meaning\",        \"errorStatus.lookupCode\",        \"errorStatus.meaning\",        \"payablesDocumentPayable.documentPayableId\",        \"payablesDocumentPayable.sourceProductReferenceNumber\",        \"payablesDocumentPayable.amountToBePaid\",        \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentCurrencyCode\",        \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentMethod.paymentMethodName\",        \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",        \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",        \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",        \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\"      ],      \"filterConditions\": [        {          \"name\": \"transactionType\",          \"attribute\": \"transactionType\",          \"type\": \"enum\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"DOCUMENT_PAYABLE\"          ],          \"usage\": \"This resource is fixed to document-payable and installment-level errors.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"errorCode\",          \"attribute\": \"errorCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for one document-validation error code.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"statusReasonCode\",          \"attribute\": \"statusReasonCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the seeded installment exception includes a status-reason code for the failure.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes exceptions to one payment process request.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"enum\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS\",            \"PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use to isolate PPRs waiting for manual review of document or payment validation errors. These codes come from the source-controlled IBY_REQUEST_STATUSES lookup snapshot.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.payeeParty.name\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.payeeParty.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user wants document validation exceptions for a specific supplier or payee.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user wants to isolate rejected document groups inside the payment process request.\"        }      ],      \"dateFilterGuidance\": {        \"description\": \"Use `errorDate` when the user asks for recent or historical document-validation failures.\",        \"patterns\": [          {            \"userRequest\": \"today, yesterday, or last N days\",            \"clause\": \"apply the date window to errorDate\"          }        ]      },      \"extractionQuery\": null,      \"businessDrivers\": [        {          \"name\": \"documentValidationFailuresByPpr\",          \"description\": \"Find installment-level failures within a payment run.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for document validation errors or blocked installments in a PPR and needs the attached error code, error message, or status reason.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Add the exact PPR status code predicate when the user is specifically asking about runs pending review for document or payment validation errors.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"allPprsPendingValidationReview\",          \"description\": \"Locate all PPRs currently requiring action because document or payment validation failed.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for all PPRs stuck on failure, pending review for validation errors, or blocked before payment creation.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorMessage\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.payeeParty.name\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.amountToBePaid\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode in ('PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS')\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Summarize or aggregate externally by error message  before drilling into individual document-payable rows.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"pprsStuckOnDocumentValidation\",          \"description\": \"List PPRs and document-payable rows awaiting manual review because of document validation errors.\",          \"when\": \"User asks what or which PPRs are stuck because of document validation failure or document validation errors.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.sourceProductReferenceNumber\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.documentPayableId\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.payeeParty.name\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.amountToBePaid\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentCurrencyCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode = 'PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use this row/detail BV for exact and paraphrased requests asking what or which PPRs are stuck because of document validation failure. Return the locked field-selection columns, apply the PPR status lookup filter exactly, sort by payablesDocumentPayable.amountToBePaid desc, and limit to 20 unless the user asks for a different limit. Do not substitute paymentRunExceptionsSummaries for this detail-list wording. Add explicit user filters, such as PPR name, date, supplier, business unit, currency, or amount, only when this shape exposes the field.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"blockingValidationErrorsForHighPriorityItems\",          \"description\": \"Locate validation errors currently blocking high-priority or overdue payment items that are pending manual review before payment processing can continue.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for validation errors blocking high-priority items, overdue installments, urgent payments, or operationally critical payment exceptions requiring immediate remediation.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorMessage\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",            \"documentPayableId\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode in ('PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS')\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use this driver whenever the user asks for validation errors that are actively blocking payment processing or operationally important items. Always constrain the population to PPRs pending review for document or payment validation errors. Use this as the canonical blocking-condition filter for both summary and detail workflows so the same blocked population is preserved consistently across all planned steps.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"installmentsExcludedForBankAccountErrorsGeneratedDate\",          \"description\": \"Find installments excluded from a payment run because of bank-account-related validation errors, using a generated datetime window instead of SYSDATE.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which installments were excluded from a payment run because of bank account errors and the date must be provided by the business view as generated datetime values.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"id\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"errorDate\",            \"documentPayableId\",            \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",            \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId is not null\",            \"transactionType = 'DOCUMENT_PAYABLE'\",            \"upper(errorMessage) like '%BANK ACCOUNT%'\",            \"errorDate >= <GENERATED_START_DATETIME>\",            \"errorDate < <GENERATED_END_DATETIME>\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use generated datetime parameters from the business view for the date window. Do not use SYSDATE in this driver.\"        }      ],      \"additionalInstructions\": [        \"Use this shape for document-payable or installment-level validation error context. For a broad row list of all installments stuck because of failure, use paymentRunInstallments as the primary shape and enrich from this shape only when error details are needed. For payment-file failures, switch to disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptions.\",        \"When the user asks for all stuck PPRs, use the payment process request status codes `PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS` and `PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS` from the IBY_REQUEST_STATUSES lookup snapshot and summarize by `errorMessage` before drilling down.\",        \"For exact or paraphrased requests such as 'What are the PPRs stuck because of document validation failure' or 'Which PPRs are stuck due to document validation errors', use paymentRunInstallmentExceptions as the BV/detail shape. Apply payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode = 'PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS', return the locked document-validation PPR fields, sort by payablesDocumentPayable.amountToBePaid:desc, and use limit 20. Do not use paymentRunExceptionsSummaries for this wording.\",        \"Do not return any error code to end user.\"      ],      \"fieldSelectionRuleUsage\": {        \"match\": \"Choose the closest questionExamples entry for the user request.\",        \"fields\": \"Use the matching fields value exactly and preserve order.\",        \"paraphrases\": \"Use the same fields for paraphrased or equivalent requests.\",        \"addFieldsOnlyWhen\": \"The user explicitly asks for more displayed columns, or the field is required for filter, sort, group, key, or deeplink handling.\",        \"filters\": \"If the matching rule provides filters, apply them exactly and add any explicit supported user filters without dropping required filters.\",        \"sortAndLimit\": \"If the matching rule provides sortBy or limit, apply them unless the user explicitly asks for a different sort or limit.\"      },      \"fieldSelectionRules\": [        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"What are the PPRs stuck because of document validation failure\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"BV\",          \"fields\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName,payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId,payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning,payablesDocumentPayable.sourceProductReferenceNumber,payablesDocumentPayable.documentPayableId,errorMessage,payablesDocumentPayable.payeeParty.name,payablesDocumentPayable.amountToBePaid,payablesDocumentPayable.paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true,          \"shape\": \"paymentRunInstallmentExceptions\",          \"filters\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode = 'PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS'\",          \"sortBy\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.amountToBePaid:desc\",          \"limit\": 20        }      ]    },    \"paymentRunInstallmentExceptionsExtraction\": {      \"key\": \"paymentRunInstallmentExceptionsExtraction\",      \"name\": \"paymentRunInstallmentExceptionsExtraction\",      \"type\": \"EXTRACTION\",      \"module\": \"oraErpCorePaymentsFundsDisbursement\",      \"businessObject\": \"DisbursementPaymentTransactionError\",      \"description\": \"Runtime extraction wrapper for the paymentRunInstallmentExceptions BV. Use this BV shape primarily for summary queries about document-payable and installment-level validation errors inside a payment run, such as grouped counts and blocked amounts by error code, PPR, payee, or validation status. Use it to identify the biggest validation hotspots before drilling into specific invoices or installments.\",      \"exampleQuestions\": [        \"How many document validation errors are there for this payment run by error code?\",        \"Which installments in this PPR are blocked by document validation errors and what errors are attached?\",        \"How many document validation failures are there by error code and PPR?\",        \"What are the PPRs stuck because of document validation failure?\",        \"Show me all PPRs pending review for document or payment validation errors.\"      ],      \"fields\": {        \"fields\": [          \"id\",          \"errorCode\",          \"errorDate\",          \"errorMessage\",          \"transactionType\",          \"statusReasonCode\",          \"statusReasonMessage\",          \"errorTypeLookupCode\",          \"errorTypeMeaning\",          \"errorStatusLookupCode\",          \"errorStatusMeaning\",          \"documentPayableId\",          \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"amountToBePaid\",          \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",          \"paymentMethodName\",          \"payeePartyName\",          \"paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",          \"paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\"        ],        \"fieldAlias\": {          \"Exception Id\": \"id\",          \"Error Code\": \"errorCode\",          \"Error Date\": \"errorDate\",          \"Error Message\": \"errorMessage\",          \"Transaction Type\": \"transactionType\",          \"Status Reason Code\": \"statusReasonCode\",          \"Status Reason Message\": \"statusReasonMessage\",          \"Error Type Code\": \"errorTypeLookupCode\",          \"Error Type\": \"errorTypeMeaning\",          \"Error Status Code\": \"errorStatusLookupCode\",          \"Error Status\": \"errorStatusMeaning\",          \"Document Payable Id\": \"documentPayableId\",          \"Source Reference Number\": \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"Amount To Be Paid\": \"amountToBePaid\",          \"Payment Currency\": \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"Rejected Group Id\": \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",          \"Payment Method\": \"paymentMethodName\",          \"Payee\": \"payeePartyName\",          \"PPR Id\": \"paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"PPR Name\": \"paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"PPR Status Code\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",          \"PPR Status\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\"        }      },      \"supportedFilters\": [        {          \"name\": \"transactionType\",          \"attribute\": \"transactionType\",          \"type\": \"enum\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"DOCUMENT_PAYABLE\"          ],          \"usage\": \"This resource is fixed to document-payable and installment-level errors.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Transaction Type\"        },        {          \"name\": \"errorCode\",          \"attribute\": \"errorCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for one document-validation error code.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Error Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"statusReasonCode\",          \"attribute\": \"statusReasonCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the seeded installment exception includes a status-reason code for the failure.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Status Reason Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes exceptions to one payment process request.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"PPR Name\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"enum\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS\",            \"PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use to isolate PPRs waiting for manual review of document or payment validation errors. These codes come from the source-controlled IBY_REQUEST_STATUSES lookup snapshot.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"PPR Status Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.payeeParty.name\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.payeeParty.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user wants document validation exceptions for a specific supplier or payee.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payee\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDocumentPayable.rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user wants to isolate rejected document groups inside the payment process request.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Rejected Group Id\"        }      ],      \"dateFilterGuidance\": {        \"description\": \"Use `errorDate` when the user asks for recent or historical document-validation failures.\",        \"patterns\": [          {            \"userRequest\": \"today, yesterday, or last N days\",            \"clause\": \"apply the date window to errorDate\"          }        ]      },      \"extractionQuery\": {        \"viewQueries\": {          \"paymentRunInstallmentExceptions\": {            \"module\": \"oraErpCorePaymentsFundsDisbursement\",            \"businessObject\": \"DisbursementPaymentTransactionError\",            \"view\": \"paymentRunInstallmentExceptions\",            \"fieldAliases\": {              \"id\": \"id\",              \"errorCode\": \"errorCode\",              \"errorDate\": \"errorDate\",              \"errorMessage\": \"errorMessage\",              \"transactionType\": \"transactionType\",              \"statusReasonCode\": \"statusReasonCode\",              \"statusReasonMessage\": \"statusReasonMessage\",              \"errorType.lookupCode\": \"errorTypeLookupCode\",              \"errorStatus.lookupCode\": \"errorStatusLookupCode\",              \"errorStatus.meaning\": \"errorStatusMeaning\",              \"payablesDocumentPayable.documentPayableId\": \"documentPayableId\",              \"payablesDocumentPayable.sourceProductReferenceNumber\": \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",              \"payablesDocumentPayable.amountToBePaid\": \"amountToBePaid\",              \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentCurrencyCode\": \"paymentCurrencyCode\",              \"payablesDocumentPayable.rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\": \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",              \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentMethod.paymentMethodName\": \"paymentMethodName\",              \"payablesDocumentPayable.payeeParty.name\": \"payeePartyName\",              \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\": \"paymentProcessRequestId\",              \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\": \"paymentProcessRequestName\",              \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",              \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\"            }          }        },        \"select\": \"{select_statement}\"      },      \"businessDrivers\": [        {          \"name\": \"documentValidationFailuresByPpr\",          \"description\": \"Find installment-level failures within a payment run.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for document validation errors or blocked installments in a PPR and needs the attached error code, error message, or status reason.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Add the exact PPR status code predicate when the user is specifically asking about runs pending review for document or payment validation errors.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"allPprsPendingValidationReview\",          \"description\": \"Locate all PPRs currently requiring action because document or payment validation failed.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for all PPRs stuck on failure, pending review for validation errors, or blocked before payment creation.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorMessage\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"amountToBePaid\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode in ('PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS')\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Summarize or aggregate externally by errorCode before drilling into individual document-payable rows.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"blockingValidationErrorsForHighPriorityItems\",          \"description\": \"Locate validation errors currently blocking high-priority or overdue payment items that are pending manual review before payment processing can continue.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for validation errors blocking high-priority items, overdue installments, urgent payments, or operationally critical payment exceptions requiring immediate remediation.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorMessage\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",            \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",            \"documentPayableId\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode in ('PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS')\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use this driver whenever the user asks for validation errors that are actively blocking payment processing or operationally important items. Always constrain the population to PPRs pending review for document or payment validation errors. Use this as the canonical blocking-condition filter for both summary and detail workflows so the same blocked population is preserved consistently across all planned steps.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"installmentsExcludedForBankAccountErrors\",          \"description\": \"Find installments excluded from a payment run because of bank-account-related validation errors.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which installments were excluded from today's run because of bank account errors, or similar questions about rejected installments caused by bank account validation failures.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"id\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"errorDate\",            \"documentPayableId\",            \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",            \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"paymentProcessRequestName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId is not null\",            \"transactionType = 'DOCUMENT_PAYABLE'\",            \"upper(errorMessage) like '%BANK ACCOUNT%'\",            \"errorDate >= trunc(sysdate)\",            \"errorDate < trunc(sysdate) + 1\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use SYSDATE-based datetime filtering for 'today'.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"pprsStuckOnDocumentValidation\",          \"description\": \"Find PPRs and affected document payables stuck because of document validation failure.\",          \"when\": \"User asks what PPRs are stuck because of document validation failure, which runs are pending review for document validation errors, or which payees and document payables are blocked by validation issues.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.sourceProductReferenceNumber\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.documentPayableId\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.payeeParty.name\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.amountToBePaid\",            \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentCurrencyCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"payablesDocumentPayable.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode = 'PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS'\",            \"transactionType='DOCUMENT_PAYABLE'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use this driver for document-validation failure review only. Do not add payment-file failure predicates or unrelated stuck-status filters. Group externally by PPR name and error code when the user asks for a summary, and use the detail rows when they want the affected document payables.\"        }      ],      \"additionalInstructions\": [        \"Generate the full SELECT statement and place it into {select_statement} before execution.\",        \"Use viewQueries.paymentRunInstallmentExceptions as the FROM source with alias consistent in the SQL (for example paymentRunInstallmentExceptions).\",        \"The inner subselect should project all aliases used by the outer SELECT and WHERE.\",        \"Apply supported filters and date filters as needed, using supportedFilters and entity resolution.\",        \"Always limit the outer query to 20 rows using where ROWNUM<=20.\",        \"Use this shape for document-payable or installment-level validation error context. For a broad row list of all installments stuck because of failure, use paymentRunInstallments as the primary shape and enrich from this shape only when error details are needed. For payment-file failures, switch to disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptions.\",        \"When the user asks for all stuck PPRs, use the payment process request status codes `PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS` and `PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS` from the IBY_REQUEST_STATUSES lookup snapshot and summarize by `errorCode` before drilling down.\",        \"Do Not return error code back in response\"      ],      \"fieldSelectionRuleUsage\": {        \"match\": \"Choose the closest questionExamples entry for the user request.\",        \"fields\": \"Use the matching fields value exactly and preserve order.\",        \"paraphrases\": \"Use the same fields for paraphrased or equivalent requests.\",        \"addFieldsOnlyWhen\": \"The user explicitly asks for more displayed columns, or the field is required for filter, sort, group, key, or deeplink handling.\"      },      \"fieldSelectionRules\": [        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"Which installments were excluded from today's run for EFT-Batch-45 because of bank account errors\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"extraction\",          \"fields\": \"paymentProcessRequestName,payeePartyName,sourceProductReferenceNumber,documentPayableId,amountToBePaid,paymentCurrencyCode,statusReasonMessage,errorMessage,errorStatusMeaning\",          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true        }      ]    },    \"documentValidationErrors\": {      \"key\": \"documentValidationErrors\",      \"name\": \"documentValidationErrors\",      \"type\": \"BV\",      \"shapeRole\": \"detail\",      \"module\": \"oraErpCorePaymentsFundsDisbursement\",      \"businessObject\": \"PayablesDocumentPayable\",      \"api\": \"objects/ora/erpCore/paymentsFundsDisbursement/v1/payablesDocumentPayables/$views/documentValidationErrors\",      \"description\": \"Business view for document-payable validation errors in a payment process request. Use it to review document validation failures by PPR, payee, payment amount, currency, payment method, rejected group, and validation error code.\",      \"exampleQuestions\": [        \"Show document validation errors for PPR AGTPPR04_GAPR_PPR_TEST_4\",        \"Show validation errors on installments that are stuck because of failure.\",        \"Show document validation errors that are blocking high-priority or overdue installments.\",        \"Group document validation failures by error code and PPR.\",        \"If I cannot resolve these rejected invoices today, what payment value and which suppliers are affected?\",        \"For the document validation errors in this run, are certain error types concentrated with specific suppliers?\"      ],      \"fields\": {        \"fields\": [          \"documentPayableId\",          \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"amountToBePaid\",          \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\"        ],        \"accessors\": {          \"paymentMethod\": {            \"shape\": \"PaymentMethod\",            \"fields\": [              \"code\",              \"paymentMethodName\"            ]          },          \"type\": {            \"shape\": \"Lookup\",            \"fields\": [              \"lookupType\",              \"meaning\",              \"lookupCode\"            ]          },          \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest\": {            \"shape\": \"PaymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest\",            \"fields\": [              \"paymentProcessRequestId\",              \"paymentProcessRequestName\",              \"timeCreated\"            ],            \"accessors\": {              \"paymentProcessRequestStatus\": {                \"shape\": \"Lookup\",                \"fields\": [                  \"lookupType\",                  \"meaning\",                  \"lookupCode\"                ]              }            }          },          \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors\": {            \"shape\": \"DisbursementPaymentTransactionError\",            \"fields\": [              \"id\",              \"errorCode\",              \"errorMessage\",              \"transactionType\",              \"transactionId\"            ],            \"accessors\": {              \"errorType\": {                \"shape\": \"Lookup\",                \"fields\": [                  \"lookupType\",                  \"meaning\",                  \"lookupCode\"                ]              }            }          },          \"payeeParty\": {            \"shape\": \"Party\",            \"fields\": [              \"id\",              \"name\"            ]          }        },        \"fieldAlias\": {          \"Document Payable ID\": \"documentPayableId\",          \"Source Product Reference\": \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"Amount To Be Paid\": \"amountToBePaid\",          \"Payment Currency\": \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"Rejected Document Group ID\": \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",          \"Payment Method Code\": \"paymentMethod.code\",          \"Payment Method\": \"paymentMethod.paymentMethodName\",          \"PPR ID\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"PPR Name\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"PPR Status Code\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"PPR Status\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\",          \"Error ID\": \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.id\",          \"Error Code\": \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorCode\",          \"Error Message\": \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorMessage\",          \"Transaction Type\": \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.transactionType\",          \"Error Type\": \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorType.meaning\",          \"Payee\": \"payeeParty.name\"        }      },      \"fieldSelection\": {        \"base\": [          \"documentPayableId\",          \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"amountToBePaid\",          \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\"        ],        \"optional\": []      },      \"sortableAttributes\": [        \"documentPayableId\",        \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",        \"amountToBePaid\",        \"paymentCurrencyCode\",        \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\"      ],      \"filterConditions\": [        {          \"name\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes document validation errors to one payment process request.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"enum\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS\",            \"PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for PPRs stuck on document or payment validation review.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorCode\",          \"attribute\": \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for a specific validation error code or wants grouping by root cause.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payeeParty.name\",          \"attribute\": \"payeeParty.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters document validation errors by supplier or payee.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentMethod.code\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentMethod.code\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for validation errors by payment method.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",          \"attribute\": \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user wants rejected document groups inside a payment process request.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"amountToBePaid\",          \"attribute\": \"amountToBePaid\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for high-impact document validation errors by payment amount.\"        }      ],      \"dateFilterGuidance\": null,      \"extractionQuery\": null,      \"businessDrivers\": [        {          \"name\": \"documentValidationErrorRows\",          \"description\": \"Review document validation error rows and messages for a named PPR or document context.\",          \"when\": \"User explicitly asks for document validation error details, error codes, or error messages for a named PPR or document; not a list of PPRs stuck because of document validation.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\",            \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorCode\",            \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorMessage\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"payeeParty.name\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode = 'PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use this only when document-validation error rows are requested. For PPRs stuck because of document validation failure, use paymentRunInstallmentExceptions instead.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"documentValidationImpact\",          \"description\": \"Quantify delayed payment value and affected suppliers for unresolved document validation errors.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for the impact of unresolved validation errors or which suppliers are affected.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"payeeParty.name\",            \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorCode\",            \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorMessage\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode in ('PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS')\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Group externally by payeeParty.name, PPR, currency, and error code to produce impact summaries.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"highValueValidationBlockers\",          \"description\": \"Find document validation errors that block high-value documents.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which validation errors should be fixed first because they block high-priority or high-value payments.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"payeeParty.name\",            \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorCode\",            \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorMessage\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"amountToBePaid>=<AMOUNT_THRESHOLD_FROM_USER>\"          ],          \"notes\": \"This view does not expose installment due date; pair with paymentRunInstallments for overdue-specific filtering.\"        }      ],      \"additionalInstructions\": [        \"Use this view when the user explicitly asks for document validation errors. Use paymentRunInstallmentExceptions when the desired source is transaction-error-centric.\",        \"For overdue-specific blockers, pair this with paymentRunInstallments because this view does not expose due date.\",        \"The nested disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors collection is scoped to transactionType='DOCUMENT_PAYABLE' by the source view.\",        \"Do not use this shape for requests such as 'What are the PPRs stuck because of document validation failure' or close variants asking which PPRs/runs are stuck. Use paymentRunInstallmentExceptions BV for that PPR detail-list wording.\"      ]    },    \"documentValidationErrorsExtraction\": {      \"key\": \"documentValidationErrorsExtraction\",      \"name\": \"documentValidationErrorsExtraction\",      \"type\": \"EXTRACTION\",      \"module\": \"oraErpCorePaymentsFundsDisbursement\",      \"businessObject\": \"PayablesDocumentPayable\",      \"description\": \"Runtime extraction wrapper for the documentValidationErrors BV. Use this shape to summarize or list document validation failures by PPR, supplier, error code, amount, currency, and rejected document group.\",      \"exampleQuestions\": [        \"Show validation errors on installments that are stuck because of failure.\",        \"Show document validation errors that are blocking high-priority installments.\",        \"Group document validation failures by error code and PPR.\",        \"If I cannot resolve these rejected invoices today, what payment value and which suppliers are affected?\"      ],      \"fields\": {        \"fields\": [          \"documentPayableId\",          \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"amountToBePaid\",          \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",          \"paymentMethodCode\",          \"paymentMethodName\",          \"pprId\",          \"pprName\",          \"pprStatusCode\",          \"pprStatusMeaning\",          \"errorId\",          \"errorCode\",          \"errorMessage\",          \"transactionType\",          \"errorTypeMeaning\",          \"payeeName\"        ],        \"fieldAlias\": {          \"Document Payable ID\": \"documentPayableId\",          \"Source Product Reference\": \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",          \"Amount To Be Paid\": \"amountToBePaid\",          \"Payment Currency\": \"paymentCurrencyCode\",          \"Rejected Document Group ID\": \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",          \"Payment Method Code\": \"paymentMethodCode\",          \"Payment Method\": \"paymentMethodName\",          \"PPR ID\": \"pprId\",          \"PPR Name\": \"pprName\",          \"PPR Status Code\": \"pprStatusCode\",          \"PPR Status\": \"pprStatusMeaning\",          \"Error ID\": \"errorId\",          \"Error Code\": \"errorCode\",          \"Error Message\": \"errorMessage\",          \"Transaction Type\": \"transactionType\",          \"Error Type\": \"errorTypeMeaning\",          \"Payee\": \"payeeName\"        }      },      \"supportedFilters\": [        {          \"name\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes document validation errors to one payment process request.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"PPR Name\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"enum\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS\",            \"PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for PPRs stuck on document or payment validation review.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"PPR Status Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorCode\",          \"attribute\": \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for a specific validation error code or wants grouping by root cause.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Error Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payeeParty.name\",          \"attribute\": \"payeeParty.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters document validation errors by supplier or payee.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payee\"        },        {          \"name\": \"amountToBePaid\",          \"attribute\": \"amountToBePaid\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for high-impact document validation errors by payment amount.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Amount threshold\"        }      ],      \"dateFilterGuidance\": null,      \"extractionQuery\": {        \"viewQueries\": {          \"documentValidationErrors\": {            \"module\": \"oraErpCorePaymentsFundsDisbursement\",            \"businessObject\": \"PayablesDocumentPayable\",            \"view\": \"documentValidationErrors\",            \"fieldAliases\": {              \"documentPayableId\": \"documentPayableId\",              \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\": \"sourceProductReferenceNumber\",              \"amountToBePaid\": \"amountToBePaid\",              \"paymentCurrencyCode\": \"paymentCurrencyCode\",              \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\": \"rejectedDocumentsPayableGroupId\",              \"paymentMethod.code\": \"paymentMethodCode\",              \"paymentMethod.paymentMethodName\": \"paymentMethodName\",              \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\": \"pprId\",              \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\": \"pprName\",              \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\": \"pprStatusCode\",              \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\": \"pprStatusMeaning\",              \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.id\": \"errorId\",              \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorCode\": \"errorCode\",              \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorMessage\": \"errorMessage\",              \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.transactionType\": \"transactionType\",              \"disbursementPaymentTransactionErrors.errorType.meaning\": \"errorTypeMeaning\",              \"payeeParty.name\": \"payeeName\"            }          }        },        \"select\": \"{select_statement}\"      },      \"businessDrivers\": [        {          \"name\": \"pprsStuckOnDocumentValidation\",          \"description\": \"Find document validation errors for PPRs awaiting manual review.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which PPRs are stuck because of document validation failure.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"pprName\",            \"pprStatusMeaning\",            \"errorCode\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"payeeName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"pprStatusCode='PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Aggregate externally by PPR and error code when the user asks for a summary.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"documentValidationImpact\",          \"description\": \"Quantify delayed payment value and affected suppliers for unresolved document validation errors.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for the impact of unresolved validation errors or which suppliers are affected.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"pprName\",            \"amountToBePaid\",            \"paymentCurrencyCode\",            \"payeeName\",            \"errorCode\",            \"errorMessage\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"pprStatusCode in ('PENDING_REVIEW_DOC_VAL_ERRORS','PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS')\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Group externally by payeeName, PPR, currency, and error code to produce impact summaries.\"        }      ],      \"additionalInstructions\": [        \"Generate the full SELECT statement and place it into {select_statement} before execution.\",        \"Use viewQueries.documentValidationErrors as the FROM source with alias consistent in the SQL.\",        \"For overdue-specific blockers, pair this with paymentRunInstallments because this view does not expose due date.\",        \"Always limit the outer query to 20 rows using where ROWNUM<=20.\"      ]    },    \"disbursementPaymentExceptionsExtraction\": {      \"key\": \"disbursementPaymentExceptionsExtraction\",      \"name\": \"disbursementPaymentExceptionsExtraction\",      \"type\": \"EXTRACTION\",      \"module\": \"oraErpCorePaymentsFundsDisbursement\",      \"businessObject\": \"DisbursementPaymentTransactionError\",      \"description\": \"Runtime extraction wrapper for the disbursementPaymentExceptions BV. Use this BV shape primarily for summary queries about payment-level validation and processing exceptions in Oracle Payments, such as grouped counts and amounts by error code, payee, payment status, or PPR. Use it to measure the scale and concentration of individual-payment failures before drilling into specific records.\",      \"exampleQuestions\": [        \"How many payment validation errors are affecting individual payments by error code?\",        \"Which payments in this PPR failed validation and why, grouped by payee?\",        \"List payment exceptions by error code and payee.\",        \"Show me payment validation errors affecting individual payments in this payment process request, grouped by payment status.\",        \"How many rejected payments are there for terminated payment process requests in the last week by payee?\"      ],      \"fields\": {        \"fields\": [          \"id\",          \"errorCode\",          \"errorDate\",          \"errorMessage\",          \"transactionType\",          \"statusReasonCode\",          \"statusReasonMessage\",          \"errorTypeLookupCode\",          \"errorTypeMeaning\",          \"errorStatusLookupCode\",          \"errorStatusMeaning\",          \"paymentId\",          \"paymentReferenceNumber\",          \"paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"payeePartyName\",          \"paymentAmount\",          \"paymentDate\",          \"paperDocumentNumber\",          \"paymentStatusLookupCode\",          \"paymentStatusMeaning\",          \"paymentModeLookupCode\",          \"paymentModeMeaning\",          \"paymentProfileId\",          \"paymentProfileName\",          \"disbursementBankAccountName\",          \"bankAccountName\",          \"paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequestPaymentProcessRequestName\",          \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",          \"paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\"        ],        \"fieldAlias\": {          \"Exception Id\": \"id\",          \"Error Code\": \"errorCode\",          \"Error Date\": \"errorDate\",          \"Error Message\": \"errorMessage\",          \"Transaction Type\": \"transactionType\",          \"Status Reason Code\": \"statusReasonCode\",          \"Status Reason Message\": \"statusReasonMessage\",          \"Error Type Code\": \"errorTypeLookupCode\",          \"Error Type\": \"errorTypeMeaning\",          \"Error Status Code\": \"errorStatusLookupCode\",          \"Error Status\": \"errorStatusMeaning\",          \"Payment Id\": \"paymentId\",          \"Payment Reference\": \"paymentReferenceNumber\",          \"PPR Name\": \"paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"Payee\": \"payeePartyName\",          \"Payment Amount\": \"paymentAmount\",          \"Payment Date\": \"paymentDate\",          \"Paper Document Number\": \"paperDocumentNumber\",          \"Payment Status Code\": \"paymentStatusLookupCode\",          \"Payment Status\": \"paymentStatusMeaning\",          \"Payment Mode Code\": \"paymentModeLookupCode\",          \"Payment Mode\": \"paymentModeMeaning\",          \"Payment Process Profile Id\": \"paymentProfileId\",          \"Payment Process Profile\": \"paymentProfileName\",          \"Disbursement Bank Account\": \"disbursementBankAccountName\",          \"Payee Bank Account\": \"bankAccountName\",          \"PPR Id\": \"paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"Linked PPR Name\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequestPaymentProcessRequestName\",          \"Linked PPR Status Code\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",          \"Linked PPR Status\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\"        }      },      \"supportedFilters\": [        {          \"name\": \"transactionType\",          \"attribute\": \"transactionType\",          \"type\": \"enum\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"PAYMENT\"          ],          \"usage\": \"This resource is fixed to payment-level errors.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Transaction Type\"        },        {          \"name\": \"errorCode\",          \"attribute\": \"errorCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for a specific payment error code.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Error Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"statusReasonCode\",          \"attribute\": \"statusReasonCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the seeded payment exception includes a status-reason code for the failure.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Status Reason Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"errorType.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"errorType.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"enum\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"VALIDATION\",            \"BANK\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user distinguishes validation failures from bank-return or bank-processing failures.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Error Type Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes payment exceptions to a single PPR.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"PPR Name\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payeePartyName\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payeePartyName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters payment exceptions to one supplier or payee.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payee\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for failed, rejected, or other payment-status-specific exceptions.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payment Status Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"enum\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"FAILED_PAYMENT_VALIDATION\",            \"INFORMATION_REQUIRED\",            \"PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS\",            \"TERMINATED\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user targets terminated runs or PPRs that are pending review or blocked for payment validation follow-up. These values come from the source-controlled IBY_REQUEST_STATUSES lookup snapshot.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Linked PPR Status Code\"        }      ],      \"dateFilterGuidance\": {        \"description\": \"Apply date filters in the same query block over the returned date columns. For general recent-PPR discovery, default to paymentProcessRequestCreationDate. If the user explicitly asks about payment date, pending since, completion date, termination date, acknowledgement processing date, or payment file creation date, use that returned date column instead.\",        \"patterns\": [          {            \"userRequest\": \"no date or time range specified for a discovery request\",            \"clause\": \"<date_column> >= TRUNC(SYSDATE) - 30\"          },          {            \"userRequest\": \"last <N> days\",            \"example\": \"last 7 days\",            \"clause\": \"<date_column> >= TRUNC(SYSDATE) - <N>\"          },          {            \"userRequest\": \"last <N> months\",            \"example\": \"last 2 months\",            \"clause\": \"<date_column> >= ADD_MONTHS(TRUNC(SYSDATE), -<N>)\"          },          {            \"userRequest\": \"between <start> and <end>\",            \"example\": \"between 2026-03-01 and 2026-03-31\",            \"clause\": \"<date_column> >= TO_DATE('<start_date>','YYYY-MM-DD') and <date_column> <= TO_DATE('<end_date>','YYYY-MM-DD')\"          }        ]      },      \"extractionQuery\": {        \"viewQueries\": {          \"disbursementPaymentExceptions\": {            \"module\": \"oraErpCorePaymentsFundsDisbursement\",            \"businessObject\": \"DisbursementPaymentTransactionError\",            \"view\": \"disbursementPaymentExceptions\",            \"fieldAliases\": {              \"id\": \"id\",              \"errorCode\": \"errorCode\",              \"errorDate\": \"errorDate\",              \"errorMessage\": \"errorMessage\",              \"transactionType\": \"transactionType\",              \"statusReasonCode\": \"statusReasonCode\",              \"statusReasonMessage\": \"statusReasonMessage\",              \"errorType.lookupCode\": \"errorTypeLookupCode\",              \"errorType.meaning\": \"errorTypeMeaning\",              \"errorStatus.lookupCode\": \"errorStatusLookupCode\",              \"errorStatus.meaning\": \"errorStatusMeaning\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentId\": \"paymentId\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentReferenceNumber\": \"paymentReferenceNumber\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentProcessRequestName\": \"paymentProcessRequestName\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payeePartyName\": \"payeePartyName\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentAmount\": \"paymentAmount\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentDate\": \"paymentDate\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paperDocumentNumber\": \"paperDocumentNumber\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.lookupCode\": \"paymentStatusLookupCode\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.meaning\": \"paymentStatusMeaning\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentMode.lookupCode\": \"paymentModeLookupCode\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentMode.meaning\": \"paymentModeMeaning\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileId\": \"paymentProfileId\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\": \"paymentProfileName\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.disbursementBankAccount.name\": \"disbursementBankAccountName\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.externalBankAccount.bankAccountName\": \"bankAccountName\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\": \"paymentProcessRequestId\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\": \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequestPaymentProcessRequestName\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",              \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\"            }          }        },        \"select\": \"{select_statement}\"      },      \"businessDrivers\": [        {          \"name\": \"paymentsTerminated\",          \"description\": \"Find individual payment that are terminated.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for payment that are terminated\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorCode\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"paymentAmount\",            \"paymentDate\",            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequestPaymentProcessRequestName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode in('TERMINATED','FAILED_PAYMENT_VALIDATION') \"          ],          \"notes\": \"\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentLevelValidationFailures\",          \"description\": \"Find individual payment failures rather than file-level failures.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for payment validation errors affecting specific payments.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorCode\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"paymentAmount\",            \"paymentDate\",            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequestPaymentProcessRequestName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"transactionType='PAYMENT'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"\"        },        {          \"name\": \"rejectedPaymentsForAffectedPprs\",          \"description\": \"Find individual payment failures inside runs that are already stalled or terminated because of payment validation problems.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for rejected or failed payments for terminated or payment-validation-error PPRs.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorCode\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"paymentStatusMeaning\",            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequestPaymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"transactionType='PAYMENT'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"When the user asks for the comparison against whole-file failures, pair this driver with disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptions and compare grouped counts outside the base fetch.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentConfirmationFailureByPpr\",          \"description\": \"Explain payment confirmation failures for a named payment process request at the individual payment level.\",          \"when\": \"User asks why payment confirmation failed for a PPR or wants the payment-level cause, impacted payees, and likely downstream impact.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorCode\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"errorTypeMeaning\",            \"errorStatusMeaning\",            \"paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"paymentAmount\",            \"paymentStatusMeaning\",            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequestPaymentProcessRequestName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"transactionType='PAYMENT'\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>' or payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Pair this result with PayablesPaymentProcessRequestDetails for run-level lifecycle context and use payablesPaymentDetails or disbursementPayments if the user needs payment logistics or settlement follow-up.\"        }      ],      \"additionalInstructions\": [        \"Generate the full SELECT statement and place it into {select_statement} before execution.\",        \"Use viewQueries.disbursementPaymentExceptions as the FROM source with alias consistent in the SQL (for example disbursementPaymentExceptions).\",        \"Build the extraction SQL in a single query block where possible. Do not use an outer inline-view wrapper only to apply row limits or filter projected aliases.\",        \"Apply supported filters and date filters as needed, using supportedFilters and entity resolution.\",        \"For detail row-list queries, append FETCH FIRST 20 ROWS ONLY in the same query block after ORDER BY when present. Do not use legacy row-number predicates.\",        \"Do not reference SELECT aliases in WHERE, HAVING, ORDER BY, GROUP BY, or outer query filters. If a calculated expression must be filtered, ordered, or grouped, repeat the full expression in that clause. Output aliases are allowed only as returned column names.\",        \"Use this shape for payment-level exceptions. For whole-file failures, use disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptions.\",        \"When the user asks to compare file-level versus payment-level validation errors, treat this shape as the payment-level side of the comparison and compute grouped counts after filtering by the same PPR scope or date window.\",        \"When the user asks why payment confirmation failed, use the payment-level error rows here to identify the exact failing payments, then explain the broader PPR state with PayablesPaymentProcessRequestDetails.\"      ]    },    \"disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptionsExtraction\": {      \"key\": \"disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptionsExtraction\",      \"name\": \"disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptionsExtraction\",      \"type\": \"EXTRACTION\",      \"module\": \"oraErpCorePaymentsFundsDisbursement\",      \"businessObject\": \"DisbursementPaymentTransactionError\",      \"description\": \"Runtime extraction wrapper for the disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptions BV. Use this BV shape primarily for summary queries about payment-file and instruction-level failures, such as grouped counts of formatting, transmission, acknowledgement, and rejection issues by file status, error code, transmission setup, or PPR. Use it to quantify whole-file impact before drilling into specific payment files.\",      \"exampleQuestions\": [        \"How many payment files were rejected by the bank by error code?\",        \"How many file-level transmission failures were there in the last week by payment file status?\",        \"List payment instruction exceptions by payment file status and PPR.\",        \"How many payment validation errors caused entire payment files to be rejected by error code?\",        \"Which whole-batch payment validation errors should I fix first to unblock the most payments?\",        \"Why did payment confirmation for PPR EFT-Batch-45 fail?\"      ],      \"fields\": {        \"fields\": [          \"id\",          \"errorCode\",          \"errorDate\",          \"errorMessage\",          \"transactionType\",          \"statusReasonCode\",          \"statusReasonMessage\",          \"errorTypeLookupCode\",          \"errorTypeMeaning\",          \"errorStatusLookupCode\",          \"errorStatusMeaning\",          \"paymentInstructionId\",          \"bankStatusCode\",          \"payablesPaymentFileErrorCode\",          \"payablesPaymentFileErrorMessage\",          \"timeCreated\",          \"paymentRequestName\",          \"paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode\",          \"paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning\",          \"paymentProfileId\",          \"paymentProfileName\",          \"transmissionConfigurationName\",          \"transmitProtocolCode\",          \"transmissionProtocolName\",          \"systemProfileCode\",          \"processingTypeLookupCode\",          \"processingTypeMeaning\"        ],        \"fieldAlias\": {          \"Exception Id\": \"id\",          \"Error Code\": \"errorCode\",          \"Error Date\": \"errorDate\",          \"Error Message\": \"errorMessage\",          \"Transaction Type\": \"transactionType\",          \"Status Reason Code\": \"statusReasonCode\",          \"Status Reason Message\": \"statusReasonMessage\",          \"Error Type Code\": \"errorTypeLookupCode\",          \"Error Type\": \"errorTypeMeaning\",          \"Error Status Code\": \"errorStatusLookupCode\",          \"Error Status\": \"errorStatusMeaning\",          \"Payment File Id\": \"paymentInstructionId\",          \"Payment File Reference\": \"paymentInstructionId\",          \"Bank Status Code\": \"bankStatusCode\",          \"Payment File Error Code\": \"payablesPaymentFileErrorCode\",          \"Payment File Error Message\": \"payablesPaymentFileErrorMessage\",          \"Payment File Created On\": \"timeCreated\",          \"PPR Name\": \"paymentRequestName\",          \"Payment File Status Code\": \"paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode\",          \"Payment File Status\": \"paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning\",          \"Payment Process Profile Id\": \"paymentProfileId\",          \"Payment Process Profile\": \"paymentProfileName\",          \"Transmission Configuration\": \"transmissionConfigurationName\",          \"Transmission Protocol Code\": \"transmitProtocolCode\",          \"Transmission Protocol\": \"transmissionProtocolName\",          \"System Payment Profile Code\": \"systemProfileCode\",          \"Processing Type Code\": \"processingTypeLookupCode\",          \"Processing Type\": \"processingTypeMeaning\",          \"Payment Process Request Name\": \"paymentRequestName\"        }      },      \"supportedFilters\": [        {          \"name\": \"errorDate\",          \"attribute\": \"errorDate\",          \"type\": \"datetime\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use as the default date filter for recent payment-file exception queries. Because this extraction generates Oracle SQL against a datetime field, emit ANSI TIMESTAMP literals such as `errorDate >= TIMESTAMP '2026-05-18 00:00:00'`; do not emit plain quoted date strings.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Error Date\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesPaymentFile.timeCreated\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesPaymentFile.timeCreated\",          \"type\": \"datetime\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use only when the user explicitly asks about payment file creation timing. Because this extraction generates Oracle SQL against a datetime field, emit ANSI TIMESTAMP literals.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payment File Created On\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentInstructionId\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentInstructionId\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes a file-level exception query to one payment file or payment instruction id.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payment File Reference\"        },        {          \"name\": \"transactionType\",          \"attribute\": \"transactionType\",          \"type\": \"enum\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"PAYMENT_INSTRUCTION\"          ],          \"usage\": \"This resource is fixed to payment-instruction or payment-file-level errors.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Transaction Type\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesPaymentFile.paymentRequestName\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesPaymentFile.paymentRequestName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes file-level failures to one payment process request.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"PPR Name\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatus.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatus.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"enum\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"REJECTED\",            \"TRANSMISSION_FAILED\",            \"PENDING_ACK\",            \"PENDING_ACTION_ACK_FAILURE\",            \"TRANSMITTED_PENDING_ACK\",            \"FORMATTING_FAILED\",            \"CREATION_ERROR\",            \"RETRY_CREATION\",            \"TERMINATED\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for rejected, transmission-failed, or pending-acknowledgement files.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Payment File Status Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"errorCode\",          \"attribute\": \"errorCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for one file-level error code or wants to group whole-batch failures by root cause.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Error Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"transmissionConfigurationName\",          \"attribute\": \"transmissionConfigurationName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for known or recent transmission issues by transmission configuration.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Transmission Configuration\"        },        {          \"name\": \"statusReasonCode\",          \"attribute\": \"statusReasonCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the seeded payment-instruction exception includes a status-reason code for the failure.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Status Reason Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"errorType.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"errorType.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"enum\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"VALIDATION\",            \"BANK\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user distinguishes file-generation validation issues from bank-return failures.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Error Type Code\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesPaymentFile.accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.processingType.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesPaymentFile.accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.processingType.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user narrows to electronic versus printed processing flows or other system processing types.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Processing Type Code\"        }      ],      \"dateFilterGuidance\": {        \"description\": \"Use `errorDate` for recent file-level exceptions and `payablesPaymentFile.timeCreated` when the user explicitly asks about file creation timing. Extraction SQL must use Oracle ANSI TIMESTAMP literals for datetime comparisons.\",        \"patterns\": [          {            \"userRequest\": \"recent payment file failures\",            \"clause\": \"errorDate>=TIMESTAMP '<TODAY_MINUS_30_DAYS> 00:00:00' unless the user supplies a different date range\"          }        ]      },      \"extractionQuery\": {        \"viewQueries\": {          \"disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptions\": {            \"module\": \"oraErpCorePaymentsFundsDisbursement\",            \"businessObject\": \"DisbursementPaymentTransactionError\",            \"view\": \"disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptions\",            \"fieldAliases\": {              \"id\": \"id\",              \"errorCode\": \"errorCode\",              \"errorDate\": \"errorDate\",              \"errorMessage\": \"errorMessage\",              \"transactionType\": \"transactionType\",              \"statusReasonCode\": \"statusReasonCode\",              \"statusReasonMessage\": \"statusReasonMessage\",              \"errorType.lookupCode\": \"errorTypeLookupCode\",              \"errorType.meaning\": \"errorTypeMeaning\",              \"errorStatus.lookupCode\": \"errorStatusLookupCode\",              \"errorStatus.meaning\": \"errorStatusMeaning\",              \"payablesPaymentFile.paymentInstructionId\": \"paymentInstructionId\",              \"payablesPaymentFile.bankStatusCode\": \"bankStatusCode\",              \"payablesPaymentFile.errorCode\": \"payablesPaymentFileErrorCode\",              \"payablesPaymentFile.errorMessage\": \"payablesPaymentFileErrorMessage\",              \"payablesPaymentFile.timeCreated\": \"timeCreated\",              \"payablesPaymentFile.paymentRequestName\": \"paymentRequestName\",              \"payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatus.lookupCode\": \"paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode\",              \"payablesPaymentFile.paymentFileProcessingStatus.meaning\": \"paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning\",              \"payablesPaymentFile.accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileId\": \"paymentProfileId\",              \"payablesPaymentFile.accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\": \"paymentProfileName\",              \"payablesPaymentFile.accountPaymentProfile.paymentTransmissionConfiguration.transmissionConfigurationName\": \"transmissionConfigurationName\",              \"payablesPaymentFile.accountPaymentProfile.paymentTransmissionConfiguration.paymentTransmissionProtocol.transmitProtocolCode\": \"transmitProtocolCode\",              \"payablesPaymentFile.accountPaymentProfile.paymentTransmissionConfiguration.paymentTransmissionProtocol.transmissionProtocolName\": \"transmissionProtocolName\",              \"payablesPaymentFile.accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.systemProfileCode\": \"systemProfileCode\",              \"payablesPaymentFile.accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.processingType.lookupCode\": \"processingTypeLookupCode\",              \"payablesPaymentFile.accountPaymentProfile.systemPaymentProfile.processingType.meaning\": \"processingTypeMeaning\"            }          }        },        \"select\": \"{select_statement}\"      },      \"businessDrivers\": [        {          \"name\": \"fileLevelFailures\",          \"description\": \"Find failures affecting payment files rather than individual payments.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which payment files were rejected, failed transmission, or await acknowledgement.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorCode\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"paymentInstructionId\",            \"paymentRequestName\",            \"paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning\",            \"bankStatusCode\",            \"paymentProfileName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"transactionType='PAYMENT_INSTRUCTION'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"\"        },        {          \"name\": \"wholeBatchRejectionComparison\",          \"description\": \"Find whole-file failures that should be contrasted with individual payment errors for the same PPR or date range.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which validation errors rejected entire payment files versus only individual payments.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorCode\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"paymentInstructionId\",            \"paymentRequestName\",            \"paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning\",            \"transmissionConfigurationName\",            \"transmissionProtocolName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"transactionType='PAYMENT_INSTRUCTION'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use this as the whole-file side of the comparison and pair it with disbursementPaymentExceptions to derive grouped counts.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentConfirmationFailureRootCause\",          \"description\": \"Retrieve file-level exception details for a PPR whose payment confirmation did not complete.\",          \"when\": \"User asks why payment confirmation failed for a PPR or batch.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorCode\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"paymentInstructionId\",            \"paymentRequestName\",            \"paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning\",            \"bankStatusCode\",            \"paymentProfileName\",            \"transmissionConfigurationName\",            \"transmissionProtocolName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER_WITH_LEADING_PPR_PREFIX_REMOVED>'\",            \"transactionType='PAYMENT_INSTRUCTION'\",            \"paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode in ('FORMATTED_ELECTRONIC','TRANSMITTED','PRINTED','TRANSMISSION_FAILED','PENDING_ACTION_ACK_FAILURE','PENDING_ACK')\"          ],          \"notes\": \"For payment confirmation failure, strip a leading literal 'PPR ' from the user's identifier before filtering paymentRequestName, and include PENDING_ACK in the status set.\"        }      ],      \"additionalInstructions\": [        \"Generate the full SELECT statement and place it into {select_statement} before execution.\",        \"Use viewQueries.disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptions as the FROM source with alias consistent in the SQL (for example disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptions).\",        \"Build the extraction SQL in a single query block where possible. Do not use an outer inline-view wrapper only to apply row limits or filter projected aliases.\",        \"Apply supported filters and date filters as needed, using supportedFilters and entity resolution. For datetime filters such as `errorDate` and `timeCreated`, use Oracle ANSI TIMESTAMP literals and never plain quoted date strings.\",        \"For detail row-list queries, append FETCH FIRST 20 ROWS ONLY in the same query block after ORDER BY when present. Do not use legacy row-number predicates.\",        \"Do not reference SELECT aliases in WHERE, HAVING, ORDER BY, GROUP BY, or outer query filters. If a calculated expression must be filtered, ordered, or grouped, repeat the full expression in that clause. Output aliases are allowed only as returned column names.\",        \"Use this shape for file-level failures. For individual payment failures, switch to disbursementPaymentExceptions.\",        \"When the user asks for file-level versus payment-level comparison, filter this shape and disbursementPaymentExceptions to the same PPR scope, status, or date range, then compare grouped counts outside the base fetch.\",        \"For payment-confirmation failure diagnosis, use the PPR name to fetch the instruction exception, then explain how the file status, bank status, error code, transmission configuration, and protocol relate to the run-level confirmation state.\",        \"For payment confirmation failure questions, normalize 'PPR <name>' to '<name>' for paymentRequestName filters and include PENDING_ACK in the paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode IN list.\"      ],      \"fieldSelectionRuleUsage\": {        \"match\": \"Choose the closest questionExamples entry for the user request.\",        \"fields\": \"Use the matching fields value exactly and preserve order.\",        \"paraphrases\": \"Use the same fields for paraphrased or equivalent requests.\",        \"addFieldsOnlyWhen\": \"The user explicitly asks for more displayed columns, or the field is required for filter, sort, group, key, or deeplink handling.\"      },      \"fieldSelectionRules\": [        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"Why did payment confirmation for PPR EFT-Batch-45 fail?\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"extraction\",          \"shapeHint\": \"disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptionsExtraction\",          \"fields\": \"paymentRequestName,errorCode,errorMessage,paymentInstructionId,paymentFileProcessingStatusMeaning,bankStatusCode,paymentProfileName,transmissionConfigurationName,transmissionProtocolName\",          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true,          \"shape\": \"disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptionsExtraction\",          \"filters\": \"transactionType = 'PAYMENT_INSTRUCTION' AND paymentRequestName = '<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER_WITH_LEADING_PPR_PREFIX_REMOVED>' AND paymentFileProcessingStatusLookupCode IN ('FORMATTED_ELECTRONIC','TRANSMITTED','PRINTED','TRANSMISSION_FAILED','PENDING_ACTION_ACK_FAILURE','PENDING_ACK')\",          \"notes\": \"If the user says 'PPR CFA-6', filter paymentRequestName as 'CFA-6'. Include PENDING_ACK with the other payment-file processing statuses. Append FETCH FIRST 20 ROWS ONLY to detail row-list SQL in the same query block.\"        }      ]    },    \"payablesSelectedInstallmentsSummary\": {      \"key\": \"payablesSelectedInstallmentsSummary\",      \"name\": \"payablesSelectedInstallmentsSummary\",      \"type\": \"AV\",      \"shapeRole\": \"summary\",      \"module\": \"oraErpCorePayablesPayments\",      \"businessObject\": null,      \"api\": \"analyticviews/ora/erpCore/payablesPayments/v1/selectedPaymentInstallmentsSummaries\",      \"description\": \"Use this AV shape to summarize the invoice installments selected into a payment process request by PPR, supplier, supplier site, currency, due date, payment date, payment method, bank account, payment profile, payment function, and status. It is the right shape for deduplicated selected-installment payment-value rollups within a PPR before drilling into row-level installment details.\",      \"exampleQuestions\": [        \"What is the total cash outflow for this PPR across all currencies?\",        \"Summarize the top suppliers by value in this payment batch.\",        \"Show the distribution of payment amounts by business unit in this PPR.\",        \"Display selected-installment totals grouped by bank account.\",        \"Show selected-installment totals by due-date bucket and payment currency.\",        \"Which payment methods account for the selected payment amount in this run?\"      ],      \"drivers\": [        {          \"topic\": \"Summary semantics\",          \"description\": \"This analytic view already returns deduplicated summary data for the supported payment process request reporting scope. When the requested summary metrics are supported by this AV, use it directly and do not add extra union or deduplication logic.\"        }      ],      \"fields\": {        \"measures\": [          \"paymentAmount\",          \"unpaidAmount\",          \"withheldAmount\",          \"discountAmount\",          \"interestAmount\"        ],        \"dimensions\": [          {            \"name\": \"legalEntity\",            \"attributes\": [              {                \"name\": \"legalEntityId\",                \"sortable\": true,                \"searchable\": true              },              {                \"name\": \"legalEntityName\",                \"sortable\": true,                \"searchable\": true              }            ],            \"hierarchies\": [              {                \"name\": \"legalEntityHierarchy\",                \"levels\": [                  \"LEGALENTITY\"                ]              }            ]          },          {            \"name\": \"businessUnit\",            \"attributes\": [              {                \"name\": \"businessUnitId\",                \"sortable\": true,                \"searchable\": true              },              {                \"name\": \"businessUnitName\",                \"sortable\": true,                \"searchable\": true              }            ],            \"hierarchies\": [              {                \"name\": \"businessUnitHierarchy\",                \"levels\": [                  \"BUSINESSUNIT\"                ]              }            ]          },          {            \"name\": \"paymentProcessRequest\",            \"attributes\": [              {                \"name\": \"checkrunId\",                \"sortable\": true,                \"searchable\": true              },              {                \"name\": \"checkrunName\",                \"searchable\": true              }            ],            \"hierarchies\": [              {                \"name\": \"paymentProcessRequestHierarchy\",                \"levels\": [                  \"PAYMENTPROCESSREQUEST\"                ]              }            ]          },          {            \"name\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatus\",            \"attributes\": [              {                \"name\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusCode\",                \"sortable\": true,                \"searchable\": true              },              {                \"name\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatus\"              }            ],            \"hierarchies\": [              {                \"name\": \"paymentProcessRequestStatusHierarchy\",                \"levels\": [                  \"PAYMENTPROCESSREQUESTSTATUS\"                ]              }            ]          },          {            \"name\": \"supplierSite\",            \"attributes\": [              {                \"name\": \"supplierSiteId\",                \"sortable\": true,                \"searchable\": true              },              {                \"name\": \"supplierSiteName\",                \"sortable\": true,                \"searchable\": true              },              {                \"name\": \"partySiteId\"              },              {                \"name\": \"country\"              },              {                \"name\": \"supplierId\",                \"sortable\": true,                \"searchable\": true              },              {                \"name\": \"partyNumber\"              },              {                \"name\": \"supplierName\",                \"sorta