installment totals.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"businessUnitHierarchy.businessUnitName\",          \"attribute\": \"businessUnitHierarchy.businessUnitName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes or groups payment-run installment value by business unit.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"legalEntityHierarchy.legalEntityName\",          \"attribute\": \"legalEntityHierarchy.legalEntityName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes or groups payment-run installment value by legal entity.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccountHierarchy.bankAccountName\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccountHierarchy.bankAccountName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for funding breakdown by disbursement bank account.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentDateHierarchy.calendarDate\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentDateHierarchy.calendarDate\",          \"type\": \"date\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for payment-run installment payment timing, actual payment date, or payment-date trend.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"dueDateHierarchy.calendarDate\",          \"attribute\": \"dueDateHierarchy.calendarDate\",          \"type\": \"date\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks about due-date urgency, due today, due this week, or overdue payment-run installments.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentProcessRequestDateHierarchy.calendarDate\",          \"attribute\": \"paymentProcessRequestDateHierarchy.calendarDate\",          \"type\": \"date\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for payment runs created or submitted on a date or date range.\"        },        {         