llowed\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"checkrunId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or checkrunName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"\"        },        {          \"name\": \"groupingAndSourceCriteriaAudit\",          \"description\": \"Review how a payment run groups or restricts invoices by pay group, currency, legal entity, business unit, and source.\",          \"when\": \"User asks how a payment run was configured to group or select invoices.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"checkrunName\",            \"payGroupOption\",            \"currencyGroupOption\",            \"legalEntityGroupOptions\",            \"businessUnitGroupOption\",            \"invoiceSourceGroupOption\",            \"vendorTypeLookupCode\",            \"partyName\",            \"batchName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"checkrunId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or checkrunName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use party and invoice batch only when the user asks for payee or invoice-batch context.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"discountAndConversionPolicyAudit\",          \"description\": \"Inspect dynamic discount, document rejection, and invoice conversion-rate criteria for a payment run.\",          \"when\": \"User asks about accelerated invoices, invoice conversion rates, or document rejection behavior. Includes document rejection level questions for a named PPR. Includes document rejection level questions for a named PPR.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"checkrunName\",            \"acceleratedInvoicesLookupLookupCode\",            \"acceleratedInvoicesLookupMeaning\",            \"invoiceConversionRateTypeLookupLookupCode\",            \"invoiceConversionRateTypeLookupMeaning\",            \"documentRejectionLookupLookupCode\",            \"documentRejectionLookupMeaning\",            \"paymentMethodName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"checkrunId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or checkrunName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"For document rejection level, return documentRejectionLookup.meaning filtered by checkrunName/checkrunId, sorted by checkrunId asc with limit 20.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"fileCreationWaitAnalysis\",          \"description\": \"Identify why payment process requests are still waiting for payment file creation, especially when the run is approved or already in payments-created status but file creation has not been triggered.\",          \"when\": \"User asks why one or more payment process requests are waiting for file creation, or why approved PPRs have not moved into file generation.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"checkrunId\",            \"checkrunName\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusLookupCode\",            \"paymentProcessRequestStatusMeaning\",            \"createPaymentInstructionFlag\",            \"paymentMethodName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode in ('ORA_APPROVED','PAYMENTS_CREATED')\",            \"createPaymentInstructionFlag = false\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use this driver when the user is investigating a file-creation hold condition on payment process requests.\"        }      ],      \"additionalInstructions\": [        \"Generate the full SELECT statement and place it into {select_statement} before execution.\",        \"Use viewQueries.paymentRunCriteria as the FROM source with alias consistent in the SQL (for example paymentRunCriteria).\",        \"The inner subselect should project all aliases used by the outer SELECT and WHERE.\",        \"Apply supported filters and date filters as needed, using supportedFilters and entity resolution.\",        \"Always limit the outer query to 20 rows using where ROWNUM<=20.\",        \"Use checkrunId or checkrunName to identify a specific payment process request; these are the primary identifiers exposed by this BV resource.\",        \"Use nested accessor paths such as paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode, paymentMethod.paymentMethodName, party.name, and invoiceBatch.batchName when the user asks for readable status, method, payee, or batch context.\",        \"Treat payGroupOption, currencyGroupOption, legalEntityGroupOptions, businessUnitGroupOption, and invoiceSourceGroupOption as configuration criteria for the run, not as transactional invoice attributes.\",        \"When the user asks whether dynamic discount or accelerated invoices are enabled, use acceleratedInvoicesLookup.lookupCode or acceleratedInvoicesLookup.meaning rather than inferring from unrelated installment shapes.\",        \"When the user asks about validation or rejection policy for document payables in the run, use documentRejectionLookup.lookupCode or documentRejectionLookup.meaning. The available configured values are DOCUMENT, NONE, PAYEE, and REQUEST from IBY_DOCUMENT_REJECTION_LEVELS.\",        \"The live OpenAPI description mentions broader payment setup context, but retrieval for this shape must stay within the top-level fields and accessor paths explicitly exposed here.\",        \"When constructing filters for null checks, use is null or is not null. Do not compare null with equality or inequality operators.\",        \"Treat business-driver filters as the required semantic core, not a closed-form query. When the user adds explicit constraints such as date or date range, PPR name/id, supplier, business unit, currency, amount, status, payment method, bank account, or payment file, add those filters when the selected shape exposes the field. A user-provided date filter overrides the default recency window. Do not drop required status, null-rate, source-shape, or sorting rules unless the user explicitly asks for a different lifecycle/source and the selected shape supports it.\",        \"Document rejection level questions are supported by paymentRunCriteria/paymentRunCriteriaExtraction. Do not return unsupported when the user asks what document rejection level is set for a named PPR.\",        \"If a requested filter, grouping, or output field is not exposed by the selected shape, do not invent a field or silently drop the constraint. Choose another supported shape that exposes it, or state the limitation while returning the closest supported query context.\"      ]    },    \"bankAccountBusinessUnitAssignments\": {      \"key\": \"bankAccountBusinessUnitAssignments\",      \"name\": \"bankAccountBusinessUnitAssignments\",      \"type\": \"BV\",      \"shapeRole\": \"detail\",      \"module\": \"oraErpCoreBankingSetup\",      \"businessObject\": \"BankAccountBusinessUnitAssignment\",      \"api\": \"objects/ora/erpCore/bankingSetup/v1/bankAccountBusinessUnitAssignments\",      \"description\": \"Business view for internal bank account business-unit assignment setup. Use this shape to check whether a bank account is assigned to a business unit, whether the assignment or bank account is active or end-dated, whether the bank account is enabled for Payables use, and which bank, branch, country, and currency context applies to the assignment.\",      \"exampleQuestions\": [        \"Which bank accounts are assigned to business unit Vision Operations?\",        \"Is bank account US Disbursement assigned to this business unit for Payables?\",        \"Show active bank account assignments for business unit Vision Services.\",        \"Which business units can use bank account 300100123456789 for payments?\",        \"Show bank, branch, country, and currency details for this bank account assignment.\"      ],      \"fields\": {        \"fields\": [          \"id\",          \"endDate\"        ],        \"accessors\": {          \"businessUnit\": {            \"shape\": \"BusinessUnit\",            \"fields\": [              \"id\",              \"name\",              \"effectiveStartDate\",              \"effectiveEndDate\"            ]          },          \"bankAccount\": {            \"shape\": \"BankAccount\",            \"fields\": [              \"id\",              \"name\",              \"startDate\",              \"endDate\",              \"payablesUseAllowedFlag\",              \"multicurrencyFlag\",              \"nettingAccountFlag\"            ],            \"accessors\": {              \"bank\": {                \"shape\": \"Bank\",                \"fields\": [                  \"id\",                  \"name\"                ]              },              \"bankBranch\": {                \"shape\": \"BankBranch\",                \"fields\": [                  \"id\",                  \"name\"                ],                \"accessors\": {                  \"country\": {                    \"shape\": \"Territory\",                    \"fields\": [                      \"territoryCode\"                    ]                  }                }              },              \"currency\": {                \"shape\": \"Currency\",                \"fields\": [                  \"currencyCode\"                ]              }            }          }        },        \"fieldAlias\": {          \"Assignment ID\": \"id\",          \"Assignment End Date\": \"endDate\",          \"Business Unit ID\": \"businessUnit.id\",          \"Business Unit\": \"businessUnit.name\",          \"Business Unit Effective Start Date\": \"businessUnit.effectiveStartDate\",          \"Business Unit Effective End Date\": \"businessUnit.effectiveEndDate\",          \"Bank Account ID\": \"bankAccount.id\",          \"Bank Account Name\": \"bankAccount.name\",          \"Bank Account Start Date\": \"bankAccount.startDate\",          \"Bank Account End Date\": \"bankAccount.endDate\",          \"Bank Account Payables Use Allowed\": \"bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag\",          \"Bank Account Multicurrency\": \"bankAccount.multicurrencyFlag\",          \"Bank Account Netting Account\": \"bankAccount.nettingAccountFlag\",          \"Bank ID\": \"bankAccount.bank.id\",          \"Bank\": \"bankAccount.bank.name\",          \"Bank Branch ID\": \"bankAccount.bankBranch.id\",          \"Bank Branch\": \"bankAccount.bankBranch.name\",          \"Bank Branch Country\": \"bankAccount.bankBranch.country.territoryCode\",          \"Bank Account Currency\": \"bankAccount.currency.currencyCode\"        }      },      \"fieldSelection\": {        \"base\": [          \"id\",          \"bankAccount.name\",          \"businessUnit.name\",          \"endDate\",          \"bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag\",          \"bankAccount.currency.currencyCode\"        ],        \"optional\": [          \"businessUnit.id\",          \"businessUnit.effectiveStartDate\",          \"businessUnit.effectiveEndDate\",          \"bankAccount.id\",          \"bankAccount.startDate\",          \"bankAccount.endDate\",          \"bankAccount.multicurrencyFlag\",          \"bankAccount.nettingAccountFlag\",          \"bankAccount.bank.id\",          \"bankAccount.bank.name\",          \"bankAccount.bankBranch.id\",          \"bankAccount.bankBranch.name\",          \"bankAccount.bankBranch.country.territoryCode\"        ]      },      \"sortableAttributes\": [        \"id\",        \"endDate\"      ],      \"filterConditions\": [        {          \"name\": \"id\",          \"attribute\": \"id\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the bank account business-unit assignment id is known.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"endDate\",          \"attribute\": \"endDate\",          \"type\": \"date\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for active, expired, end-dated, or ending bank account assignments.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"businessUnit.id\",          \"attribute\": \"businessUnit.id\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the business unit id is known.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"businessUnit.name\",          \"attribute\": \"businessUnit.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user identifies the business unit by name.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.id\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.id\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the bank account id is known or when joining from payment shapes by internal bank account id.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.name\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user identifies an internal bank account by name.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.startDate\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.startDate\",          \"type\": \"date\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks whether the bank account was effective as of a specific date.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.endDate\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.endDate\",          \"type\": \"date\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks whether the underlying bank account is active or end-dated.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag\",          \"type\": \"boolean\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"true\",            \"false\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks whether the bank account can be used for Payables disbursements.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.multicurrencyFlag\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.multicurrencyFlag\",          \"type\": \"boolean\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"true\",            \"false\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks whether the assigned bank account supports multiple currencies.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.nettingAccountFlag\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.nettingAccountFlag\",          \"type\": \"boolean\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"true\",            \"false\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks whether the assigned bank account is marked for netting.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.bank.name\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.bank.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when filtering assigned bank accounts by bank name.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.bankBranch.name\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.bankBranch.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when filtering assigned bank accounts by branch name.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.bankBranch.country.territoryCode\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.bankBranch.country.territoryCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when filtering bank account assignments by bank branch country code.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.currency.currencyCode\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.currency.currencyCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when filtering assigned bank accounts by currency.\"        }      ],      \"dateFilterGuidance\": {        \"description\": \"Use assignment `endDate` for whether the business-unit assignment itself is active. Use `bankAccount.startDate` and `bankAccount.endDate` when the user asks whether the underlying bank account was active as of a date.\",        \"patterns\": [          {            \"userRequest\": \"active or current bank account assignment\",            \"clause\": \"endDate=null or endDate>=<AS_OF_DATE>\"          },          {            \"userRequest\": \"bank account active as of a date\",            \"clause\": \"(bankAccount.startDate=null or bankAccount.startDate<=<AS_OF_DATE>) and (bankAccount.endDate=null or bankAccount.endDate>=<AS_OF_DATE>)\"          },          {            \"userRequest\": \"expired or end-dated assignments\",            \"clause\": \"endDate!=null and endDate< <AS_OF_DATE>\"          }        ]      },      \"extractionQuery\": null,      \"businessDrivers\": [        {          \"name\": \"bankAccountAssignmentsForBusinessUnit\",          \"description\": \"List internal bank accounts assigned to a business unit.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which bank accounts are available or assigned for a named business unit.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"id\",            \"businessUnit.name\",            \"bankAccount.id\",            \"bankAccount.name\",            \"bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag\",            \"bankAccount.currency.currencyCode\",            \"endDate\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"businessUnit.name='<BUSINESS_UNIT_NAME_FROM_USER>'\",            \"endDate=null or endDate>=<AS_OF_DATE>\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use this driver for setup assignment questions. Use paymentRunInstallments or disbursementPayments for transaction rows.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"businessUnitsForBankAccount\",          \"description\": \"List business units that can use a specific internal bank account.\",          \"when\": \"User starts from a bank account name or id and asks where it is assigned.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"bankAccount.id\",            \"bankAccount.name\",            \"businessUnit.id\",            \"businessUnit.name\",            \"businessUnit.effectiveStartDate\",            \"businessUnit.effectiveEndDate\",            \"endDate\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"bankAccount.name='<BANK_ACCOUNT_NAME_FROM_USER>' or bankAccount.id=<BANK_ACCOUNT_ID_FROM_USER>\",            \"endDate=null or endDate>=<AS_OF_DATE>\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Return business-unit effective dates when the user asks why an assignment is not currently usable.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"activePayablesBankAccountAssignment\",          \"description\": \"Find active bank account assignments that are enabled for Payables use.\",          \"when\": \"User asks whether a bank account can be used for Payables disbursements for a business unit.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"businessUnit.name\",            \"bankAccount.name\",            \"bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag\",            \"bankAccount.startDate\",            \"bankAccount.endDate\",            \"endDate\",            \"bankAccount.currency.currencyCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag = 'Y'\",            \"endDate=null or endDate>=<AS_OF_DATE>\",            \"(bankAccount.startDate=null or bankAccount.startDate<=<AS_OF_DATE>) and (bankAccount.endDate=null or bankAccount.endDate>=<AS_OF_DATE>)\",            \"bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag=true\"          ],          \"notes\": \"This view exposes Payables enablement through `bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag`; do not use the BO-only assignment-level payables flag unless a separate shape exposes it.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankBranchCurrencyContext\",          \"description\": \"Return bank, branch, branch country, and currency context for assigned bank accounts.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which bank or branch backs a business-unit bank account assignment, or needs branch country and currency for setup triage.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"businessUnit.name\",            \"bankAccount.name\",            \"bankAccount.bank.name\",            \"bankAccount.bankBranch.name\",            \"bankAccount.bankBranch.country.territoryCode\",            \"bankAccount.currency.currencyCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"businessUnit.name='<BUSINESS_UNIT_NAME_FROM_USER>'\",            \"bankAccount.currency.currencyCode='<CURRENCY_CODE_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Currency and bank branch are setup context only. Use payment shapes to analyze actual payment currency, bank charges, or paid amounts.\"        }      ],      \"additionalInstructions\": [        \"Use this shape for internal bank account setup and business-unit assignment questions, not for payment execution rows.\",        \"For active assignment checks, combine assignment `endDate` with bank account `startDate` and `endDate` when the user asks whether the bank account itself is usable as of a date.\",        \"The requested view exposes only top-level `id` and `endDate`; use accessor paths for business unit, bank account, bank, branch, country, and currency details.\",        \"When user asks for available bank accounts for a business unit and current, ensure they are active also. endDate should be null\",        \"For before-I-assign disbursement account lookup, active assignment means endDate = null. payablesUseAllowedFlag is displayed, not a filter, unless the user explicitly asks for accounts allowed for Payables use.\"      ],      \"fieldSelectionRuleUsage\": {        \"match\": \"Choose the closest questionExamples entry for the user request.\",        \"fields\": \"Use the matching fields value exactly and preserve order.\",        \"paraphrases\": \"Use the same fields for paraphrased or equivalent requests.\",        \"addFieldsOnlyWhen\": \"The user explicitly asks for more displayed columns, or the field is required for filter, sort, group, key, or deeplink handling.\"      },      \"fieldSelectionRules\": [        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"Before I assign the bank account, show me all disbursement accounts for this Business Unit Vision Operations\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"BV\",          \"fields\": \"id,businessUnit.name,bankAccount.id,bankAccount.name,bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag,bankAccount.currency.currencyCode,endDate\",          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true,          \"shape\": \"bankAccountBusinessUnitAssignments\",          \"filters\": \"businessUnit.name = '<BUSINESS_UNIT_NAME_FROM_USER>' AND endDate = null\",          \"sortBy\": \"id:asc\",          \"limit\": 20,          \"notes\": \"For before-I-assign disbursement account lookup, include bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag as an output field only. Do not add bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag = true unless explicitly requested.\"        },        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"Show me available bank accounts for this business unit Vision Operations and currency USD\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"BV\",          \"fields\": \"id,bankAccount.name,businessUnit.name,endDate,bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag,bankAccount.currency.currencyCode\",          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true,          \"shape\": \"bankAccountBusinessUnitAssignments\",          \"filters\": \"businessUnit.name = '<BUSINESS_UNIT_NAME_FROM_USER>' AND bankAccount.currency.currencyCode = '<CURRENCY_CODE_FROM_USER>' AND endDate = null\",          \"sortBy\": \"id:asc\",          \"limit\": 20,          \"notes\": \"For available accounts with an explicit currency, filter by BU, currency, and active assignment endDate = null. Do not add payablesUseAllowedFlag unless requested.\"        }      ]    },    \"bankAccountBusinessUnitAssignmentsExtraction\": {      \"key\": \"bankAccountBusinessUnitAssignmentsExtraction\",      \"name\": \"bankAccountBusinessUnitAssignmentsExtraction\",      \"type\": \"EXTRACTION\",      \"module\": \"oraErpCoreBankingSetup\",      \"businessObject\": \"BankAccountBusinessUnitAssignment\",      \"description\": \"Runtime extraction wrapper for the bankAccountBusinessUnitAssignments BV. Use this shape to retrieve internal bank account business-unit assignments, Payables-use enablement, active or end-dated assignment status, and bank, branch, country, and currency setup context.\",      \"exampleQuestions\": [        \"Which bank accounts are assigned to business unit Vision Operations?\",        \"Is bank account US Disbursement assigned to this business unit for Payables?\",        \"Show active bank account assignments for business unit Vision Services.\",        \"Which business units can use bank account 300100123456789 for payments?\",        \"Show bank, branch, country, and currency details for this bank account assignment.\"      ],      \"fields\": {        \"fields\": [          \"assignmentId\",          \"assignmentEndDate\",          \"businessUnitId\",          \"businessUnitName\",          \"businessUnitEffectiveStartDate\",          \"businessUnitEffectiveEndDate\",          \"bankAccountId\",          \"bankAccountName\",          \"bankAccountStartDate\",          \"bankAccountEndDate\",          \"bankAccountPayablesUseAllowedFlag\",          \"bankAccountMulticurrencyFlag\",          \"bankAccountNettingAccountFlag\",          \"bankId\",          \"bankName\",          \"bankBranchId\",          \"bankBranchName\",          \"bankBranchCountryCode\",          \"bankAccountCurrencyCode\"        ],        \"fieldAlias\": {          \"Assignment ID\": \"assignmentId\",          \"Assignment End Date\": \"assignmentEndDate\",          \"Business Unit ID\": \"businessUnitId\",          \"Business Unit\": \"businessUnitName\",          \"Business Unit Effective Start Date\": \"businessUnitEffectiveStartDate\",          \"Business Unit Effective End Date\": \"businessUnitEffectiveEndDate\",          \"Bank Account ID\": \"bankAccountId\",          \"Bank Account Name\": \"bankAccountName\",          \"Bank Account Start Date\": \"bankAccountStartDate\",          \"Bank Account End Date\": \"bankAccountEndDate\",          \"Bank Account Payables Use Allowed\": \"bankAccountPayablesUseAllowedFlag\",          \"Bank Account Multicurrency\": \"bankAccountMulticurrencyFlag\",          \"Bank Account Netting Account\": \"bankAccountNettingAccountFlag\",          \"Bank ID\": \"bankId\",          \"Bank\": \"bankName\",          \"Bank Branch ID\": \"bankBranchId\",          \"Bank Branch\": \"bankBranchName\",          \"Bank Branch Country\": \"bankBranchCountryCode\",          \"Bank Account Currency\": \"bankAccountCurrencyCode\"        }      },      \"supportedFilters\": [        {          \"name\": \"id\",          \"attribute\": \"id\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the bank account business-unit assignment id is known.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Assignment ID\"        },        {          \"name\": \"endDate\",          \"attribute\": \"endDate\",          \"type\": \"date\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for active, expired, end-dated, or ending bank account assignments.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Assignment End Date or date range\"        },        {          \"name\": \"businessUnit.id\",          \"attribute\": \"businessUnit.id\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the business unit id is known.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Business Unit ID\"        },        {          \"name\": \"businessUnit.name\",          \"attribute\": \"businessUnit.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user identifies the business unit by name.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Business Unit\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.id\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.id\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the bank account id is known or when joining from payment shapes by internal bank account id.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Bank Account ID\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.name\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user identifies an internal bank account by name.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Bank Account Name\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.startDate\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.startDate\",          \"type\": \"date\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks whether the bank account was effective as of a specific date.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Bank Account Start Date or date range\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.endDate\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.endDate\",          \"type\": \"date\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks whether the underlying bank account is active or end-dated.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Bank Account End Date or date range\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag\",          \"type\": \"boolean\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"true\",            \"false\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks whether the bank account can be used for Payables disbursements.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Bank Account Payables Use Allowed\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.multicurrencyFlag\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.multicurrencyFlag\",          \"type\": \"boolean\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"true\",            \"false\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks whether the assigned bank account supports multiple currencies.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Bank Account Multicurrency\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.nettingAccountFlag\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.nettingAccountFlag\",          \"type\": \"boolean\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"true\",            \"false\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks whether the assigned bank account is marked for netting.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Bank Account Netting Account\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.bank.name\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.bank.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when filtering assigned bank accounts by bank name.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Bank\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.bankBranch.name\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.bankBranch.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when filtering assigned bank accounts by branch name.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Bank Branch\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.bankBranch.country.territoryCode\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.bankBranch.country.territoryCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when filtering bank account assignments by bank branch country code.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Bank Branch Country\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankAccount.currency.currencyCode\",          \"attribute\": \"bankAccount.currency.currencyCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when filtering assigned bank accounts by currency.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Bank Account Currency\"        }      ],      \"dateFilterGuidance\": {        \"description\": \"Use assignment `endDate` for whether the business-unit assignment itself is active. Use `bankAccount.startDate` and `bankAccount.endDate` when the user asks whether the underlying bank account was active as of a date.\",        \"patterns\": [          {            \"userRequest\": \"active or current bank account assignment\",            \"clause\": \"endDate is null or endDate>=<AS_OF_DATE>\"          },          {            \"userRequest\": \"bank account active as of a date\",            \"clause\": \"(bankAccount.startDate is null or bankAccount.startDate<=<AS_OF_DATE>) and (bankAccount.endDate is null or bankAccount.endDate>=<AS_OF_DATE>)\"          },          {            \"userRequest\": \"expired or end-dated assignments\",            \"clause\": \"endDate is not null and endDate< <AS_OF_DATE>\"          }        ]      },      \"extractionQuery\": {        \"viewQueries\": {          \"bankAccountBusinessUnitAssignments\": {            \"module\": \"oraErpCoreBankingSetup\",            \"businessObject\": \"BankAccountBusinessUnitAssignment\",            \"view\": \"bankAccountBusinessUnitAssignments\",            \"fieldAliases\": {              \"id\": \"assignmentId\",              \"endDate\": \"assignmentEndDate\",              \"businessUnit.id\": \"businessUnitId\",              \"businessUnit.name\": \"businessUnitName\",              \"businessUnit.effectiveStartDate\": \"businessUnitEffectiveStartDate\",              \"businessUnit.effectiveEndDate\": \"businessUnitEffectiveEndDate\",              \"bankAccount.id\": \"bankAccountId\",              \"bankAccount.name\": \"bankAccountName\",              \"bankAccount.startDate\": \"bankAccountStartDate\",              \"bankAccount.endDate\": \"bankAccountEndDate\",              \"bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag\": \"bankAccountPayablesUseAllowedFlag\",              \"bankAccount.multicurrencyFlag\": \"bankAccountMulticurrencyFlag\",              \"bankAccount.nettingAccountFlag\": \"bankAccountNettingAccountFlag\",              \"bankAccount.bank.id\": \"bankId\",              \"bankAccount.bank.name\": \"bankName\",              \"bankAccount.bankBranch.id\": \"bankBranchId\",              \"bankAccount.bankBranch.name\": \"bankBranchName\",              \"bankAccount.bankBranch.country.territoryCode\": \"bankBranchCountryCode\",              \"bankAccount.currency.currencyCode\": \"bankAccountCurrencyCode\"            }          }        },        \"select\": \"{select_statement}\"      },      \"businessDrivers\": [        {          \"name\": \"bankAccountAssignmentsForBusinessUnit\",          \"description\": \"List internal bank accounts assigned to a business unit.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which bank accounts are available or assigned for a named business unit.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"assignmentId\",            \"businessUnitName\",            \"bankAccountId\",            \"bankAccountName\",            \"bankAccountPayablesUseAllowedFlag\",            \"bankAccountCurrencyCode\",            \"assignmentEndDate\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"businessUnit.name='<BUSINESS_UNIT_NAME_FROM_USER>'\",            \"bankAccount.currency.currencyCode='<CURRENCY_CODE_FROM_USER>' when the user supplies currency\",            \"endDate IS NULL\",            \"sortBy: id:asc\",            \"limit: 20\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Use this setup shape for available disbursement bank accounts for a business unit and currency. Filter active assignments with endDate null; do not route this question to payment transaction rows.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"businessUnitsForBankAccount\",          \"description\": \"List business units that can use a specific internal bank account.\",          \"when\": \"User starts from a bank account name or id and asks where it is assigned.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"bankAccountId\",            \"bankAccountName\",            \"businessUnitId\",            \"businessUnitName\",            \"businessUnitEffectiveStartDate\",            \"businessUnitEffectiveEndDate\",            \"assignmentEndDate\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"bankAccount.name='<BANK_ACCOUNT_NAME_FROM_USER>' or bankAccount.id=<BANK_ACCOUNT_ID_FROM_USER>\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Return business-unit effective dates when the user asks why an assignment is not currently usable.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"activePayablesBankAccountAssignment\",          \"description\": \"Find active bank account assignments that are enabled for Payables use.\",          \"when\": \"User asks whether a bank account can be used for Payables disbursements for a business unit.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"businessUnitName\",            \"bankAccountName\",            \"bankAccountPayablesUseAllowedFlag\",            \"bankAccountStartDate\",            \"bankAccountEndDate\",            \"assignmentEndDate\",            \"bankAccountCurrencyCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag = 'Y'\",            \"endDate is null or endDate>=<AS_OF_DATE>\",            \"(bankAccount.startDate is null or bankAccount.startDate<=<AS_OF_DATE>) and (bankAccount.endDate is null or bankAccount.endDate>=<AS_OF_DATE>)\",            \"bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag=true\"          ],          \"notes\": \"This view exposes Payables enablement through `bankAccount.payablesUseAllowedFlag`; do not use the BO-only assignment-level payables flag unless a separate shape exposes it.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"bankBranchCurrencyContext\",          \"description\": \"Return bank, branch, branch country, and currency context for assigned bank accounts.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which bank or branch backs a business-unit bank account assignment, or needs branch country and currency for setup triage.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"businessUnitName\",            \"bankAccountName\",            \"bankName\",            \"bankBranchName\",            \"bankBranchCountryCode\",            \"bankAccountCurrencyCode\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"businessUnit.name='<BUSINESS_UNIT_NAME_FROM_USER>'\",            \"bankAccount.currency.currencyCode='<CURRENCY_CODE_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Currency and bank branch are setup context only. Use payment shapes to analyze actual payment currency, bank charges, or paid amounts.\"        }      ],      \"additionalInstructions\": [        \"Generate the full SELECT statement and place it into {select_statement} before execution.\",        \"Use viewQueries.bankAccountBusinessUnitAssignments as the FROM source with alias consistent in the SQL.\",        \"The inner subselect should project all aliases used by the outer SELECT and WHERE.\",        \"Apply supported filters and date filters as needed, using supportedFilters and entity resolution.\",        \"Always limit the outer query to 20 rows using where ROWNUM<=20.\",        \"Use this shape for internal bank account setup and business-unit assignment questions, not for payment execution rows.\",        \"When user asks for available bank accounts for a business unit and current, ensure they are active also. endDate should be null\",        \"Treat business-driver filters as the required semantic core, not a closed-form query. When the user adds explicit constraints such as date or date range, PPR name/id, supplier, business unit, currency, amount, status, payment method, bank account, or payment file, add those filters when the selected shape exposes the field. A user-provided date filter overrides the default recency window. Do not drop required status, null-rate, source-shape, or sorting rules unless the user explicitly asks for a different lifecycle/source and the selected shape supports it.\",        \"If a requested filter, grouping, or output field is not exposed by the selected shape, do not invent a field or silently drop the constraint. Choose another supported shape that exposes it, or state the limitation while returning the closest supported query context.\"      ]    },    \"disbursementPaymentExceptions\": {      \"key\": \"disbursementPaymentExceptions\",      \"name\": \"disbursementPaymentExceptions\",      \"type\": \"BV\",      \"shapeRole\": \"detail\",      \"module\": \"oraErpCorePaymentsFundsDisbursement\",      \"businessObject\": \"DisbursementPaymentTransactionError\",      \"api\": \"objects/ora/erpCore/paymentsFundsDisbursement/v1/disbursementPaymentExceptions\",      \"description\": \"Use this BV shape to inspect payment-level validation and processing exceptions in Oracle Payments. It is the right shape when the user asks which individual payments failed, whether the issue affects specific payments versus whole files, and which PPR and payee are impacted.\",      \"exampleQuestions\": [        \"Show me payment validation errors affecting individual payments.\",        \"Which payments in this PPR failed validation and why?\",        \"List payment exceptions by error code and payee.\",        \"Show me payment validation errors affecting individual payments in this payment process request.\",        \"Show rejected payments for terminated payment process requests in the last week.\"      ],      \"fields\": {        \"fields\": [          \"id\",          \"errorCode\",          \"errorDate\",          \"errorMessage\",          \"transactionType\",          \"statusReasonCode\",          \"statusReasonMessage\",          \"errorType.lookupCode\",          \"errorType.meaning\",          \"errorStatus.lookupCode\",          \"errorStatus.meaning\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentId\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentReferenceNumber\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payeePartyName\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentAmount\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentDate\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paperDocumentNumber\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.lookupCode\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.meaning\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentMode.lookupCode\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentMode.meaning\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileId\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.disbursementBankAccount.name\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.externalBankAccount.bankAccountName\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\"        ],        \"accessors\": {          \"errorType\": {            \"shape\": \"Lookup\",            \"fields\": [              \"lookupType\",              \"meaning\",              \"lookupCode\"            ]          },          \"errorStatus\": {            \"shape\": \"Lookup\",            \"fields\": [              \"lookupType\",              \"meaning\",              \"lookupCode\"            ]          },          \"payablesDisbursementPayment\": {            \"shape\": \"PayablesDisbursementPayment\",            \"fields\": [              \"paymentId\",              \"paymentReferenceNumber\",              \"paymentProcessRequestName\",              \"payeePartyName\",              \"paymentAmount\",              \"paymentDate\",              \"paperDocumentNumber\"            ],            \"accessors\": {              \"accountPaymentProfile\": {                \"shape\": \"AccountPaymentProfile\",                \"fields\": [                  \"paymentProfileId\",                  \"paymentProfileName\"                ]              },              \"externalBankAccount\": {                \"shape\": \"ExternalBankAccount\",                \"fields\": [                  \"id\",                  \"bankAccountName\"                ]              },              \"paymentStatus\": {                \"shape\": \"Lookup\",                \"fields\": [                  \"lookupType\",                  \"meaning\",                  \"lookupCode\"                ]              },              \"paymentMode\": {                \"shape\": \"Lookup\",                \"fields\": [                  \"lookupType\",                  \"meaning\",                  \"lookupCode\"                ]              },              \"disbursementBankAccount\": {                \"shape\": \"BankAccount\",                \"fields\": [                  \"id\",                  \"name\"                ]              },              \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest\": {                \"shape\": \"PaymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest\",                \"fields\": [                  \"paymentProcessRequestId\",                  \"paymentProcessRequestName\",                  \"timeCreated\"                ],                \"accessors\": {                  \"paymentProcessRequestStatus\": {                    \"shape\": \"Lookup\",                    \"fields\": [                      \"lookupType\",                      \"meaning\",                      \"lookupCode\"                    ]                  }                }              }            }          }        },        \"fieldAlias\": {          \"Exception Id\": \"id\",          \"Error Code\": \"errorCode\",          \"Error Date\": \"errorDate\",          \"Error Message\": \"errorMessage\",          \"Transaction Type\": \"transactionType\",          \"Status Reason Code\": \"statusReasonCode\",          \"Status Reason Message\": \"statusReasonMessage\",          \"Error Type Code\": \"errorType.lookupCode\",          \"Error Type\": \"errorType.meaning\",          \"Error Status Code\": \"errorStatus.lookupCode\",          \"Error Status\": \"errorStatus.meaning\",          \"Payment Id\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentId\",          \"Payment Reference\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentReferenceNumber\",          \"PPR Name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"Payee\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payeePartyName\",          \"Payment Amount\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentAmount\",          \"Payment Date\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentDate\",          \"Paper Document Number\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paperDocumentNumber\",          \"Payment Status Code\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.lookupCode\",          \"Payment Status\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.meaning\",          \"Payment Mode Code\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentMode.lookupCode\",          \"Payment Mode\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentMode.meaning\",          \"Payment Process Profile Id\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileId\",          \"Payment Process Profile\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\",          \"Disbursement Bank Account\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.disbursementBankAccount.name\",          \"Payee Bank Account\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.externalBankAccount.bankAccountName\",          \"PPR Id\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",          \"Linked PPR Name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"Linked PPR Status Code\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"Linked PPR Status\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\"        }      },      \"fieldSelection\": {        \"base\": [          \"id\",          \"errorCode\",          \"errorDate\",          \"errorMessage\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentReferenceNumber\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payeePartyName\"        ],        \"optional\": [          \"errorType.meaning\",          \"errorStatus.meaning\",          \"statusReasonCode\",          \"statusReasonMessage\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentAmount\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentDate\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentMode.meaning\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\",          \"payablesDisbursementPayment.externalBankAccount.bankAccountName\"        ]      },      \"sortableAttributes\": [        \"id\",        \"errorCode\",        \"errorDate\",        \"errorMessage\",        \"transactionType\",        \"statusReasonCode\",        \"statusReasonMessage\",        \"errorType.lookupCode\",        \"errorType.meaning\",        \"errorStatus.lookupCode\",        \"errorStatus.meaning\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentId\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentReferenceNumber\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentProcessRequestName\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payeePartyName\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentAmount\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentDate\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paperDocumentNumber\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.lookupCode\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.meaning\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentMode.lookupCode\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentMode.meaning\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileId\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.accountPaymentProfile.paymentProfileName\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.disbursementBankAccount.name\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestId\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",        \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\"      ],      \"filterConditions\": [        {          \"name\": \"transactionType\",          \"attribute\": \"transactionType\",          \"type\": \"enum\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"PAYMENT\"          ],          \"usage\": \"This resource is fixed to payment-level errors.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"errorCode\",          \"attribute\": \"errorCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for a specific payment error code.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"statusReasonCode\",          \"attribute\": \"statusReasonCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the seeded payment exception includes a status-reason code for the failure.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"errorType.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"errorType.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"enum\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"VALIDATION\",            \"BANK\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user distinguishes validation failures from bank-return or bank-processing failures.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentProcessRequestName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user scopes payment exceptions to a single PPR.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payeePartyName\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payeePartyName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters payment exceptions to one supplier or payee.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for failed, rejected, or other payment-status-specific exceptions.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode\",          \"type\": \"enum\",          \"possibleValues\": [            \"FAILED_PAYMENT_VALIDATION\",            \"INFORMATION_REQUIRED\",            \"PENDING_REVIEW_PMT_VAL_ERRORS\",            \"TERMINATED\"          ],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user targets terminated runs or PPRs that are pending review or blocked for payment validation follow-up. These values come from the source-controlled IBY_REQUEST_STATUSES lookup snapshot.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"errorDate\",          \"attribute\": \"errorDate\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks to filter PP terminated in a particular date or period. example:  errorDate >= '2026-03-27' \"        }      ],      \"dateFilterGuidance\": {        \"description\": \"Use `checkDate` when the user is asking about the intended payment date. Use `timeCreated` when the user is asking for recently created or historically created PPRs. \\nUse errorDate when user asks to see PPR terminated in a particular period. for errorDate use the yyyy-mm-dd format eg : errorDate >= '2026-04-27'\",        \"patterns\": [          {            \"userRequest\": \"today or tomorrow's payment runs\",            \"clause\": \"apply todays date to date field <date field> >= '2026-04-27'\"          },          {            \"userRequest\": \"recently created payment runs\",            \"example\": \"last 7 days\",            \"clause\": \"apply todays date to date field <date field> >= '<Date from 7 days ago>'\"          },          {            \"userRequest\": \"payment runs for a named date range\",            \"example\": \"next week or this month\"          }        ]      },      \"extractionQuery\": null,      \"businessDrivers\": [        {          \"name\": \"paymentsTerminated\",          \"description\": \"Find individual payment that are terminated.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for payment that are terminated\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorCode\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"payeePartyName\",            \"paymentAmount\",            \"paymentDate\",            \"paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequestPaymentProcessRequestName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.lookupCode in('TERMINATED','FAILED_PAYMENT_VALIDATION') \"          ],          \"notes\": \"\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentLevelValidationFailures\",          \"description\": \"Find individual payment failures rather than file-level failures.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for payment validation errors affecting specific payments.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorCode\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payeePartyName\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentAmount\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentDate\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"transactionType='PAYMENT'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"\"        },        {          \"name\": \"rejectedPaymentsForAffectedPprs\",          \"description\": \"Find individual payment failures inside runs that are already stalled or terminated because of payment validation problems.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for rejected or failed payments for terminated or payment-validation-error PPRs.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorCode\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payeePartyName\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.meaning\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"transactionType='PAYMENT'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"When the user asks for the comparison against whole-file failures, pair this driver with disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptions and compare grouped counts outside the base fetch.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentConfirmationFailureByPpr\",          \"description\": \"Explain payment confirmation failures for a named payment process request at the individual payment level.\",          \"when\": \"User asks why payment confirmation failed for a PPR or wants the payment-level cause, impacted payees, and likely downstream impact.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"errorCode\",            \"errorMessage\",            \"errorType.meaning\",            \"errorStatus.meaning\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentReferenceNumber\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.payeePartyName\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentAmount\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentStatus.meaning\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestStatus.meaning\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"transactionType='PAYMENT'\",            \"payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>' or payablesDisbursementPayment.paymentsPayablesPaymentProcessRequest.paymentProcessRequestName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Pair this result with PayablesPaymentProcessRequestDetails for run-level lifecycle context and use payablesPaymentDetails or disbursementPayments if the user needs payment logistics or settlement follow-up.\"        }      ],      \"additionalInstructions\": [        \"Use this shape for payment-level exceptions. For whole-file failures, use disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptions.\",        \"When the user asks to compare file-level versus payment-level validation errors, treat this shape as the payment-level side of the comparison and compute grouped counts after filtering by the same PPR scope or date window.\",        \"When the user asks why payment confirmation failed, use the payment-level error rows here to identify the exact failing payments, then explain the broader PPR state with PayablesPaymentProcessRequestDetails.\"      ]    },    \"disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptions\": {      \"key\": \"disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptions\",      \"name\": \"disbursementPaymentInstructionExceptions\",      \"type\": \"BV\",      \"shapeRole\": \"detail\