nvoiceInstallment.installmentNumber,invoiceInstallment.dueDate,invoiceInstallment.installmentAmount,originalInvoiceTransaction.invoiceCurrency.currencyCode,reason\",          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true        }      ]    },    \"unselectedPaymentInstallmentsExtraction\": {      \"key\": \"unselectedPaymentInstallmentsExtraction\",      \"name\": \"unselectedPaymentInstallmentsExtraction\",      \"type\": \"EXTRACTION\",      \"module\": \"oraErpCorePayablesPayments\",      \"businessObject\": \"PayablesPaymentProcessRequestUnselectedInvoiceInstallment\",      \"description\": \"Runtime extraction wrapper for the unselectedPaymentInstallments BV. Business view for installments that met selection criteria but were excluded from a payment process request. Use this shape primarily for summary queries about dropped-out payment value and counts by exclusion reason, supplier, currency, business unit, or due-date urgency before drilling into individual invoices or installments.\",      \"exampleQuestions\": [        \"For Supplier X, which open invoices were not included in this PPR?\",        \"Show me all installments for Supplier ABC that were excluded from this PPR due to a payment hold.\",        \"Why was installment 1 of Invoice ABC not picked up in the current payment run?\",        \"How many unselected installments are there for this PPR by exclusion reason?\",        \"What are the installments not selected for processing in PPR xyz?\",        \"Which installments due today for Supplier ABC were not selected in this run?\"      ],      \"fields\": {        \"fields\": [          \"checkrunId\",          \"invoiceId\",          \"installmentNumber\",          \"reason\",          \"checkrunName\",          \"invoiceNumber\",          \"invoiceInstallmentInstallmentNumber\",          \"dueDate\",          \"unpaidAmount\",          \"invoiceCurrencyCode\"        ],        \"fieldAlias\": {          \"PPR Id\": \"checkrunId\",          \"Invoice Id\": \"invoiceId\",          \"Installment Number\": \"installmentNumber\",          \"Reason\": \"reason\",          \"Invoice Currency\": \"invoiceCurrencyCode\"        }      },      \"supportedFilters\": [        {          \"name\": \"payablesPaymentProcessRequest.checkrunId\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesPaymentProcessRequest.checkrunId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user identifies the payment process request by id.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"checkrunId\"        },        {          \"name\": \"payablesPaymentProcessRequest.checkrunName\",          \"attribute\": \"payablesPaymentProcessRequest.checkrunName\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user identifies the payment process request by name.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"checkrunName\"        },        {          \"name\": \"originalInvoiceTransaction.supplier.supplierId\",          \"attribute\": \"originalInvoiceTransaction.supplier.supplierId\",          \"type\": \"int64\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters excluded installments to one supplier id.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"supplierId\"        },        {          \"name\": \"originalInvoiceTransaction.supplier.name\",          \"attribute\": \"originalInvoiceTransaction.supplier.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters excluded installments to one supplier name.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"name\"        },        {          \"name\": \"reason\",          \"attribute\": \"reason\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for a specific exclusion reason such as a payment hold or missing setup.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"Reason\"        },        {          \"name\": \"originalInvoiceTransaction.businessUnit.name\",          \"attribute\": \"originalInvoiceTransaction.businessUnit.name\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user filters excluded installments to one business unit.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"name\"        },        {          \"name\": \"originalInvoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",          \"attribute\": \"originalInvoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",          \"type\": \"string\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user identifies the excluded installment by invoice number.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"invoiceNumber\"        },        {          \"name\": \"invoiceInstallment.dueDate\",          \"attribute\": \"invoiceInstallment.dueDate\",          \"type\": \"date\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for excluded installments due today or due within a date window.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"dueDate or date range\"        },        {          \"name\": \"invoiceInstallment.unpaidAmount\",          \"attribute\": \"invoiceInstallment.unpaidAmount\",          \"type\": \"number\",          \"possibleValues\": [],          \"usage\": \"Use when the user asks for excluded installments above an unpaid-amount threshold.\",          \"valueFromUser\": \"unpaidAmount\"        }      ],      \"dateFilterGuidance\": null,      \"extractionQuery\": {        \"viewQueries\": {          \"unselectedPaymentInstallments\": {            \"module\": \"oraErpCorePayablesPayments\",            \"businessObject\": \"PayablesPaymentProcessRequestUnselectedInvoiceInstallment\",            \"view\": \"unselectedPaymentInstallments\",            \"fieldAliases\": {              \"checkrunId\": \"checkrunId\",              \"invoiceId\": \"invoiceId\",              \"installmentNumber\": \"installmentNumber\",              \"reason\": \"reason\",              \"payablesPaymentProcessRequest.checkrunName\": \"checkrunName\",              \"originalInvoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\": \"invoiceNumber\",              \"invoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\": \"invoiceInstallmentInstallmentNumber\",              \"invoiceInstallment.dueDate\": \"dueDate\",              \"invoiceInstallment.unpaidAmount\": \"unpaidAmount\",              \"originalInvoiceTransaction.invoiceCurrency.currencyCode\": \"invoiceCurrencyCode\"            }          }        },        \"select\": \"{select_statement}\"      },      \"businessDrivers\": [        {          \"name\": \"unselectedByPpr\",          \"description\": \"Unselected installments for a specific PPR/checkrun.\",          \"when\": \"User asks to show unselected installments for a given PPR or checkrun.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"checkrunId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or checkrunName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"\"        },        {          \"name\": \"unselectedByPprAndSupplier\",          \"description\": \"Unselected installments for a specific supplier under a PPR.\",          \"when\": \"User asks to show unselected installments for supplier X under PPR Y.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"(checkrunId=<PPR_ID_FROM_USER> or checkrunName='<PPR_NAME_FROM_USER>')\",            \"(originalInvoiceTransaction.supplier.supplierId=<SUPPLIER_ID_FROM_USER> or originalInvoiceTransaction.supplier.name='<SUPPLIER_NAME_FROM_USER>')\"          ],          \"notes\": \"\"        },        {          \"name\": \"unselectedByReason\",          \"description\": \"Unselected installments filtered by a particular reason or error code.\",          \"when\": \"User asks for unselected installments due to a specific reason such as a payment hold or validation issue.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"reason='<REASON_FROM_USER>'\"          ],          \"notes\": \"\"        },        {          \"name\": \"unselectedDueNow\",          \"description\": \"Unselected installments that are due immediately or within a short date window.\",          \"when\": \"User asks which due-today or due-soon installments were not picked up in a run.\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"checkrunName\",            \"invoiceNumber\",            \"invoiceInstallmentInstallmentNumber\",            \"dueDate\",            \"unpaidAmount\",            \"reason\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"invoiceInstallment.dueDate=<REQUESTED_DATE_OR_WINDOW>\"          ],          \"notes\": \"Combine with the PPR predicate when the user asks about a specific run.\"        },        {          \"name\": \"paymentOnHold\",          \"description\": \"Unselected installments that are due immediately or within a short date window.\",          \"when\": \"User asks installments in PPR that are in hold payment hold\",          \"fieldsToReturn\": [            \"payablesPaymentProcessRequest.checkrunName\",            \"originalInvoiceTransaction.invoiceNumber\",            \"invoiceInstallment.installmentNumber\",            \"invoiceInstallment.dueDate\",            \"invoiceInstallment.unpaidAmount\",            \"originalInvoiceTransaction.invoiceCurrency.currencyCode\",            \"reason\"          ],          \"extraFilterExpressions\": [            \"(reason ='SCHEDULED_PAYMENT_HOLD' or reason = 'SUPPLIER_SITE_HOLD') \"          ],          \"notes\": \"Combine with the other filters if required. Do not use filters like 'payment hold' or %HOLD%. Do not use AND operator\"        }      ],      \"additionalInstructions\": [        \"Generate the full SELECT statement and place it into {select_statement} before execution.\",        \"Use viewQueries.unselectedPaymentInstallments as the FROM source with alias consistent in the SQL (for example unselectedPaymentInstallments).\",        \"The inner subselect should project all aliases used by the outer SELECT and WHERE.\",        \"Apply supported filters and date filters as needed, using supportedFilters and entity resolution.\",        \"Always limit the outer query to 20 rows using where ROWNUM<=20.\",        \"Use this shape when the user asks why an invoice or installment was not picked in the current run.\",        \"When the user asks for upcoming or alternative scheduling, combine this with payment-run criteria or schedule-oriented shapes instead of inventing schedule fields here.\",        \"This shape does not expose discount-expiration or discount-amount-remaining fields. For discount-eligibility analysis, pair it with invoiceInstallmentDetails.\",        \"If user mentioned Payment hold in their query, ensure the paymentOnHold driver filters are applied eg: Show me all installments for Supplier <Supplier name> that were excluded from PPR <PPR Name> due to a payment hold\"      ],      \"fieldSelectionRuleUsage\": {        \"match\": \"Choose the closest questionExamples entry for the user request.\",        \"fields\": \"Use the matching fields value exactly and preserve order.\",        \"paraphrases\": \"Use the same fields for paraphrased or equivalent requests.\",        \"addFieldsOnlyWhen\": \"The user explicitly asks for more displayed columns, or the field is required for filter, sort, group, key, or deeplink handling.\"      },      \"fieldSelectionRules\": [        {          \"questionExamples\": [            \"Show me all invoices for Supplier Advanced Network Devices that were eligible but not selected for gapr_ppr_test_4 PPR\"          ],          \"queryType\": \"extraction\",          \"fields\": \"reason,installmentCount,totalAmount\",          \"fieldOrderLocked\": true        }      ]    },    \"invoiceInstallmentDetails\": {      \"key\": \"invoiceInstallmentDetails\",      \"name\": \"invoiceInstallmentDetails\",      \"type\": \"BV\",      \"shapeRole\": \"detail\",      \"module\": \"oraErpCorePayablesInvoices\",      