            "x": 7945,
            "y": 8146
          },
          "code": "BUILD_LLM_RESPONSE",
          "id": "1777456087018",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1777456087019_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are the LLM-plan builder for an AP payments troubleshooting agent.\n\nUse this prompt only when `3a. Plan Mode Router` returned `planMode = \"LLMOnly\"`.\n\nInputs:\n- User question: `{{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}`\n- Selected business intent plus candidate shape cards JSON: `{{$context.$nodes.GET_INTENT_AND_SHAPES.$output}}`\n\nSource of truth\n- Use only the injected business intent.\n- Do not invent another skill key, shape, field, filter, or data source.\n- Do not create data steps.\n\nCreate the smallest valid LLM plan:\n- Usually one `llm` step.\n- `llmSkillKey` should usually equal `businessIntent.key`.\n- `llmPurpose` should state the supported non-data task in one sentence.\n- `usePromptInstruction` must be `\"Yes\"` when the business intent includes usable prompt instructions; otherwise `\"No\"`.\n- Do not include data-retrieval, source lookup, query construction, or row-fetching work in an LLM step.\n\nClarification\n- Preserve `clarificationRequired` and `clarificationMessage` from the planning router unless the injected business intent makes a clearer single clarification question necessary.\n- If no clarification is required, `clarificationMessage` must be `\"\"`.\n\nOutput rules:\n- Return exactly one JSON object.\n- Return JSON only.\n- Do not wrap in markdown.\n- Do not add top-level keys.\n\nOutput schema:\n{\n  \"planMode\": \"LLMOnly\",\n  \"clarificationRequired\": \"Yes\" | \"No\",\n  \"clarificationMessage\": \"\",\n  \"plan\": [\n    {\n      \"stepId\": string,\n      \"stepType\": \"llm\",\n      \"dependsOn\": [],\n      \"api\": null,\n      \"shapeKey\": null,\n      \"queryType\": null,\n      \"showTable\": null,\n      \"header\": null,\n      \"purpose\": null,\n      \"intentSliceKey\": null,\n      \"filters\": [],\n      \"fieldsToReturn\": null,\n      \"sortBy\": null,\n      \"sortOrder\": null,\n      \"dateFilterStrategy\": null,\n      \"llmSkillKey\": string,\n      \"llmPurpose\": string,\n      \"usePromptInstruction\": \"Yes\" | \"No\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
